organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/24d03d44bb9f15b5695b51440553774fd84c82d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T09:05:52Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T09:05:52Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"fix(scripts): 개인 경로 검증기가 docs·.claude 도 스캔하도록 확장\n\nTARGETS 에 `docs`·`.claude` 가 빠져 있어 `docs/issues/002` 의 로그 인용에 섞인\n`/Users/<name>` 이 오래 통과했다. 해당 인용은 자리표시자로 가린다.\n\n스코프를 넓히는 김에 gitignore 된 파일은 제외한다. 이 검증기의 대상은 \"배포되는\n파일\"이고, 커밋되지 않는 머신별 로컬 설정(`.claude/settings.local.json`)에 개인 경로가\n있는 건 정상이다 — 그것까지 오류로 세면 검증기를 끄게 만든다. 판정에 실패하면\n(git 부재 등) 거르지 않아, 덜 검사하는 쪽이 아니라 더 검사하는 쪽으로 물러선다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f74d5c661ed6aaa1da8e211a9a5e23dc2ce364b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/9f74d5c661ed6aaa1da8e211a9a5e23dc2ce364b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/24d03d44bb9f15b5695b51440553774fd84c82d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/K