":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/787a6a7c98ada38d3c12fcb8f27c62c50e7a9230/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T09:05:34Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T09:05:34Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"chore: 개인 세션 기록 추적 해제 및 .gitignore 신설\n\nagent-factory-plugin 의 최상위 설계 규칙은 \"자기 소유가 아닌 레포에 아무것도 쓰지\n않는다\"이고 산출물은 전부 `~/.agent-factory/` 에 둔다. 레포에 커밋돼 있던\n`.agent-factory/sessions/*.md` 2건은 그 규칙 이전의 잔재이며 session_id·토큰 소비\n상세·회고 판정이 그대로 들어 있었다.\n\n추적만 해제하고 파일은 지우지 않는다. `.gitignore` 가 없어 재발이 막히지 않던 것도\n함께 신설한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae6dab5309341a2060aeecc6ff745ecacd6148fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/ae6dab5309341a2060aeecc6ff745ecacd6148fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/787a6a7c98ada38d3c12fcb8f27c62c50e7a9230","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-