tps://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/3cc99ede185d9c5ff551fcfaad97cf12095d4e33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:52:19Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T08:52:19Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(mfe-architecture): Module Federation 아키텍처 플러그인 신규 추가\n\nHost/Remote 설정을 생성·검토하는 mfe-config-architect, 노출 모듈의 공개\n계약을 SKILL.md로 기록·감사하는 remote-contract-manager 두 에이전트와,\n런타임 통합 증상을 6계열로 분류해 진단하는 mfe-runtime-troubleshooting,\n배포 단위·소유 팀 기준으로 경계를 긋는 mfe-boundary-design 두 스킬을 담는다.\n\n규칙 원본(shared singleton 정책, init() 런타임 등록·장애 내성 플러그인,\nsrc/export 노출 규약과 Provider 래퍼, 모듈 간 통신 경로)은 rsbuild +\n@module-federation/rsbuild-plugin 기반 실제 운영 구성에서 도출했다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"779ebd6bc6da27bbb23089c7918e3ad0f1a42b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/779ebd6bc6da27bbb23089c7918e3ad0f1a42b25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/3cc99ede185d9c5ff551fcfaad97cf12095d4e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won"