"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/31d51f613893273cb1f8c248757f21a53f1b10ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T06:12:27Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T06:12:27Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): observer MCP 서버 번들 (커밋 단위 에이전트 사용 집계 질의)\n\nObserver REST(/api/agent-factory/*)를 감싸는 읽기 전용 stdio MCP 서버를\nplugin.json의 mcpServers.observer 로 번들한다. esbuild로 의존성을 인라인한\n단일 dist/index.mjs 라 node_modules·tsx 없이 `node` 만으로 뜬다(자립형 실행).\n\n- 도구 9개: list_agent_usage/plugin/skill·feedback_breakdown·signal_summary·\n  token_trend·search_records·get_record·get_meta (전부 읽기 전용)\n- 설정은 push 훅과 같은 ~/.agent-factory/config.json(apiBase·token) 공유,\n  env는 OBSERVER_* 우선(AGENT_FACTORY_* 하위호환)\n- 원본: personal-coding-agent-monitor/mcp. src/ 동봉(재빌드용), README에 절차 명시\n- version 0.12.7 → 0.13.0 (기능 추가)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf285dbc555757a976d9e001b1e5191feae43242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/cf285dbc555757a976d9e001b1e5191feae43242"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/31d51f613893273cb1f8c248757f21a53f1b10ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":1051485