결)\n\n근본 원인: hooks.json 의 `if: \"Bash(git commit *)\"` 접두 패턴이 훅 실행 자체를\n게이팅했고, `git -C <repo> commit …` 은 이 패턴에 안 맞아 훅(.mjs)이 아예 실행되지\n않았다(로그·큐·커서 무변화). 안쪽 GIT_COMMIT_RE(가드3)는 이 바깥 게이트를 통과해야\n도달하는 2차 필터라 무력화돼 있었다.\n\n- `if` 를 `Bash(git *commit*)` 로 변경 — \"git … commit\" 형태(옵션 낀 -C/-c 포함)만\n  발동해 \"커밋할 때만 실행\"이라는 의도를 유지하면서 누락을 없앤다. GIT_COMMIT_RE 가\n  최종 확정 필터로 남는다.\n- 앞선 GIT_COMMIT_RE 개행 지원(75dd9b9)과 합쳐 배치·-C 커밋을 함께 포착.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9aa78eb137d26e0c1081fdc6ba071c8b3bd5217","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/c9aa78eb137d26e0c1081fdc6ba071c8b3bd5217"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/883db32e53ec2c7f2df8d401d630025adceba707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/883db32e53ec2