it 도 인식\n\nGIT_COMMIT_RE 가 `git commit` 을 문자열 맨 앞(^)·`;&|` 뒤에서만 봤다. 여러 줄\n스크립트(`cd …\\ngit add .\\ngit commit …`)에서 git commit 이 개행 뒤 줄 맨 앞에\n오면 비-커밋으로 오분류돼 커밋이 통째로 캡처에서 누락됐다(옵저버가 자기 커밋을\n관측 못 함). 구분자 클래스에 개행(\\n)을 추가해 이런 배치 커밋도 인식한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ee3fcf1fa9c70a19bffd15648a40366d43ee4693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/ee3fcf1fa9c70a19bffd15648a40366d43ee4693"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/75dd9b9ad60af5a987249bf8c608e812f4243bb6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/75dd9b9ad60af5a987249bf8c608e812f4243bb6","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDc1ZGQ5YjlhZDYwYWY1YTk4NzI0OWJmOGM2MDhlODEyZjQyNDNiYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPla