eResultSpikes 가 있을 때만 전파.\n- 대용량 사용자 입력(프롬프트·붙여넣기)도 급상승 원인이다. tool_result 와 달리\n  사용자가 이 유입을 알기 어려우므로 tool=\"user_input\" 으로 잡는다 — 내용은\n  싣지 않고 길이·라벨만(서버 무전송 원칙 유지). 문턱 USER_INPUT_SPIKE_MIN=4000\n  으로 평범한 지시는 제외. 문자열·배열 text 블록 총량 양쪽을 본다.\n- 스파이크 push+evict 를 pushSpike 헬퍼로 정리(tool_result·user_input 공유).\n\ntool_result_spikes 는 이미 Json 이라 서버·마이그레이션 변경 없음. 테스트·문서 동기화.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"995977f055bc0b32f216c5f9150065a513ea3c66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/995977f055bc0b32f216c5f9150065a513ea3c66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/bea3554e6d5239beedee7adf3ad705533bd8ede8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/bea3554e6d5239beedee7adf3ad705533bd8ede8","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoA