열을 다운샘플 없이 전량 담는다\n(''컨텍스트가 언제 부풀었나 = 초과 비용 시점 = harness 힌트''). core.mjs 의\n기존 턴 순회에서 [turnIndex, ctx] 를 수집하고, computeDeltaHygiene 이\ncontext_series 와 assistant_turns(= API 호출 수)를 방출한다. LLM 을 거치지\n않는 결정론적 계산이라 요약 토큰 비용은 늘지 않는다. 폭주 델타 대비 방어\n상한 MAX_CONTEXT_SERIES=5000(초과 시 초반 턴부터 유지). 단위 테스트·스키마\n문서·output-format 동기화.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84fc9d0ca84272d0d188b195247ae898e0815c53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/84fc9d0ca84272d0d188b195247ae898e0815c53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/6efa7d465c96347c0fd8cd871742a9a63a2ebb14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/6efa7d465c96347c0fd8cd871742a9a63a2ebb14","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDZlZmE3ZDQ2NWM5NjM0N2MwZmQ4Y2Q4NzE3NDJhOWE2M2EyZW