되거나 엉뚱한 레포에\n오귀속됐다. 명령의 ''git -C <path>''·선행 ''cd <path>'' 를 rev-parse 로 검증해\n대상 레포를 먼저 정하고, 없으면 cwd 로 폴백한다. GIT_COMMIT_RE 가 subcommand\n앞 전역 옵션(-C/-c/--git-dir)도 커밋으로 인정하도록 확장하고, 가드2(커밋\n최신성)는 명령 확정 시에도 건너뛰지 않아 오래된 HEAD 오귀속을 막는다.\n경위·트레이드오프는 docs/issues/002 에 기록.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a52a596821c6c6825875823ca5f92c24dc4e596","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/3a52a596821c6c6825875823ca5f92c24dc4e596"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/6fe411da77a8d93590dc761d85670362876771f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/6fe411da77a8d93590dc761d85670362876771f6","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDZmZTQxMWRhNzdhOGQ5MzU5MGRjNzYxZDg1NjcwMzYyODc2NzcxZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-