ant 턴 카운터로 각 tool_result 의 생성 시점 턴 인덱스를\n  기록. \"먼저 나온 10개\"가 아니라 후보 버퍼(len 최소 evict)로 크기 상위 유지.\n- hygiene.mjs: finalizeResultSpikes 순수 함수 — turns_resident(잔류 턴),\n  rebilled_tokens(글자÷4 × 잔류 턴) 계산 후 재청구 비용 내림차순 상위 N개.\n- constants.mjs: RESULT_SPIKE_MIN 480→2000자 상향(timeline 문턱과 분리),\n  MAX_SPIKE_CANDIDATES 신규.\n- 근사 한계 명시: ÷4 토큰 환산, 델타 내부 compact/clear 무시(단일 순회가\n  compact 지점 턴 인덱스를 모름). 정밀화는 후속 과제.\n- 문서(schema·summarizer output-format) 새 형태로 갱신.\n- 단위 테스트(node:test, zero-dep): 뺄셈·정렬·top-N·경계.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b64cf0f5b16f6d5eec5dddbda930618621d734f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/4b64cf0f5b16f6d5eec5dddbda930618621d734f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/b13b8b360bdab77bd43000a7a288f10fff940547","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url