aver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"docs: description 트리거 원칙을 스킬까지 확장\n\n에이전트 description(서브에이전트 위임 판단)과 스킬 description(스킬 자동 호출\n판단)은 둘 다 트리거 매칭에 쓰이는 텍스트이므로, 부정 경계문 금지를 포함한\n원칙이 동일하게 적용된다는 점을 명시한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WYpwHoz8j5DEdKfjg7n2PH","tree":{"sha":"c24ff131698f6cf04708761712b2206f6bb6435d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/c24ff131698f6cf04708761712b2206f6bb6435d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/dc5b91bc543dd15185b190041b122aca0461dbe6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/dc5b91bc543dd15185b190041b122aca0461dbe6","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKGRjNWI5MWJjNTQzZGQxNTE4NWIxOTAwNDFiMTIyYWNhMDQ2MWRiZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/c1ee9a0f97e18caad69a20ef9b1bed43390f6a40","sha":"c1ee9a0f97e18caad69a20ef9b1bed43390f6a40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/c1ee9a0f97e18caad69a20ef9b1bed43390f6a40"}],"sha":"dc5b91bc543dd15185b190041b122aca0461dbe6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/dc5b91bc543dd15185b190041b122aca0461dbe6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/c1ee9a0f97e18caad69a20ef9b1bed43390f6a40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T02:53:46Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T02:53:46Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"fix(agent-factory): 레포 스코프 커서로 세션 간 중복 캡처 차단 (0.11.0)\n\n가드1은 커서를 session_id 로만 키잉해, 새 세션에서는 prev.commit 이 null 이라\n같은 HEAD 여도 그대로 통과했다. 실제로 한 커밋이 서로 다른 세션에서 2~7회\n중복 적재된 사례가 관측됐다(고유 커밋 13개에 델타 39건).\n\ncursors.json 에 예약 키 `repos` 를 두어 레포별 마지막 캡처 sha 를 병기하고,\n가드1 바로 아래·가드2 위에 가드1b 를 신설했다. gitRoot·commit 은 이미 구해져\n있어 추가 git 호출이 0 이고, 중복 케이스에선 git log 호출조차 생략된다.\n가드1b 는 return 만 하므로 세션 offset 워터마크가 전진하지 않아, 그 사이 델타는\n다음 진짜 커밋이 온전히 이어받는다(작업 유실 없음).\n\n- AGENT_FACTORY_FORCE_CAPTURE=1 로 중복 가드만 우회하는 탈출구 추가\n  (가드2·가드3 은 우회되지 않는다 — 유령 커밋 방지는 풀지 않는다)\n- session_id 가 예약 키와 같으면 skip (repos 버킷 덮어쓰기 원천 차단)\n- repos 키가 없는 기존 cursors.json 하위 호환. backfill 하지 않는다\n\n격리 검증 7/7 통과: 세션 간 차단, 신규 세션 from_offset 불변, amend·rebase·\nworktree 통과(오탐 없음), 레거시 파일 호환, 탈출구 동작.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WYpwHoz8j5DEdKfjg7n2PH","tree":{"sha":"afb7d18d18b77c3838381418cca88b10c905de3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/afb7d18d18b77c3838381418cca88b10c905de3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/c1ee9a0f97e18caad69a20ef9b1bed43390f6a40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://ap