0Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T05:59:50Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"docs(agent-factory): 세션 위생 지표 소비측 스키마 계약 + summarizer 서술 지침 추가\n\n- docs/session-hygiene-schema.md: metrics.json.session_hygiene 필드 계약(서버·UI\n  미러링용). 델타/세션누적 스코프 구분, digest vs 사이드카 출처, null 의미, 해석 가이드.\n- summarizer 리소스: .md 요약이 hygiene_delta·delta_shrank(델타 스코프)만 서술하고\n  세션 누적 수치(context_slope·session_resets)는 사이드카 전용이라 지어내지 않도록 못박음.\n  cr_gen_ratio 단독 낭비 판정 금지 원칙 명시.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc74d5f2fff4e3a4368c896eb634ca1940475057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/fc74d5f2fff4e3a4368c896eb634ca1940475057"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/00c354d638846a08fe70051bc55ee5ed8094e9d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.git