mmitter":{"date":"2026-07-28T05:55:58Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): 세션 위생(컨텍스트 경계) 지표를 커밋 시점에 결정론적으로 캡처 (0.10.0)\n\n커밋마다 세션 위생 신호를 metrics.json 사이드카에 additive 로 실어 서버 직송한다:\n- 델타 스코프: cr:gen 비율, tool_result 출력 급증, 턴 컨텍스트 급증\n- 세션 누적 스코프: 커밋당 샘플 1개를 session-hygiene.json 에 증분 적재해\n  컨텍스트 기울기(context_slope)·리셋 횟수(session_resets)를 전체 재읽기 없이 복원\n\n훅은 파일 축소(compact/clear) 1비트(shrank)만 방출하고, 집계·회귀는 오프-패스\ndistill(lib/distill/hygiene.mjs)이 소유해 훅 경량 계약을 지킨다. metrics.json 은 순수\nadditive 라 push 경로 변경 없이 서버로 흘러간다(소비측 스키마 확장은 후속 작업).\n\n이 커밋은 distill 로직을 distill-session.mjs 단일 파일에서 lib/distill/* 로 분리한\n기존 리팩터도 함께 담는다(세션 위생 코드가 그 위에 얹혀 분리 불가).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6efc8c8d535508fe631c0d3e89c075c8a7a7212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/c6efc8c8d535508fe631c0d3e89c075c8a7a7212"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/ee1771a946315081234f6b6a4b3b3eb67427b813","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/ee1771a946315081234f6b6a4b3b3eb67427b813","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKGVlMTc3MWE5NDYzMTUwODEyMzRmNmI2YTRiM2IzZWI2NzQyN2I4MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b","sha":"17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b"}],"sha":"ee1771a946315081234f6b6a4b3b3eb67427b813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/ee1771a946315081234f6b6a4b3b3eb67427b813"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:57:41Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:57:41Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): 서브에이전트 토큰·도구호출·에러를 사이드카에서 귀속 (0.9.0)\n\nObserver Sub-agents 화면에서 SPAWN·커밋 수는 채워지나 OUTPUT·CACHE READ·\n도구호출·에러가 전부 0이던 문제를 해결한다. 원인은 Claude Code가\n서브에이전트 턴을 메인 트랜스크립트에 attributionAgent로 남기지 않고\n<sessionId>/subagents/agent-<id>.jsonl 별도 파일에 두는데, distill이 그\n사이드카를 읽지 않아 토큰 귀속 근거가 없던 미구현 갭이었다.\n\ndistill-session.mjs에 결정론적 사이드카 집계 추가:\n- resolveSubagentsDir: jsonl_path에서 형제 subagents/ 디렉터리 유도.\n- readSubagentUsage: agent-<id>.jsonl에서 토큰·도구호출·에러 집계.\n- attributeSubagents: meta.toolUseId가 델타 내 Agent tool_use id와 짝이면\n  귀속(toolUseId 우선, 첫 이벤트 timestamp 폴백). 경량 meta.json만 전수\n  스캔하고 대용량 .jsonl은 귀속 확정 건만 읽어 델타 정합성 유지.\n- distillLines: 델타 내 Agent tool_use.id 수집 + 시각 범위 계산 후\n  agent_costs에 누산. cost_tokens(메인)엔 더하지 않음(메인/서브 분리).\n\n사이드카 부재·읽기 실패 시 throw 없이 기존처럼 spawn 수만 채운다.\n격리 스모크 3시나리오(정확 귀속·델타별 분배·graceful) 통과.\npush-sessions.mjs·factory-home.mjs 무변경(metrics.json 스키마 불변).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5eae2190e4f8df8564c812abb098c234c3d18a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/a5eae2190e4f8df8564c812abb098c234c3d18a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDE3YTJlYjM2YjZhOGM2YzQ2YTA3ZGQyNTE1YzczMmU2NDZhZGJlNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/a217321db4bca7f361eab3a102bc3ddd61bdfd5a","sha":"a217321db4bca7f361eab3a102bc3ddd61bdfd5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/a217321db4bca7f361eab3a102bc3ddd61bdfd5a"}],"sha":"17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/17a2eb36b6a8c6c46a07dd2515c732e646adbe4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/a217321db4bca7f361eab3a102bc3ddd61bdfd5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:58:37Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T06:58:37Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"fix(agent-factory): 커밋 안 한 세션에 생기던 유령 커밋 기록을 3중 가드로 차단 (0.8.1)\n\ncapture 훅이 실제 git commit 없이도 발동해(if 게이트가 비-커밋 Bash에 샘),\n변하지 않은 기존 HEAD(6주 전 남의 머지 커밋)에 세션 델타를 귀속시켜 유령\n\"커밋 세션\" 기록을 만들던 문제를 해결한다. 훅에 \"정말 새 커밋인가\" 검증이\n전혀 없었고, distill의 commitExists 안전망은 실재 커밋이라 통과시켰다.\n\ncapture-commit-session.mjs에 발동 원인 경로와 무관하게 막는 3중 가드 추가:\n- 가드3: 트리거 명령(tool_input.command)이 실제 git commit인지 재확인.\n  아니면 skip. 명령이 없으면 ''불확실''로 두고 가드2가 백스톱.\n- 가드1: 커서에 세션의 마지막 캡처 sha를 저장하고, HEAD가 그 sha에서 전진\n  안 했으면 skip(오프셋 워터마크도 미전진 → 다음 진짜 커밋이 델타 이어받음).\n- 가드2: 명령이 불확실할 때만 HEAD committer 시각이 90초 밖이면 skip.\n  명령으로 커밋이 확정되면 건너뛴다(커밋 뒤 긴 작업 한 줄 명령 대비).\n\n모든 skip은 조용한 return + errors.jsonl 로그, 항상 exit 0·커밋 비차단 유지.\n격리 홈 스모크 5시나리오 통과. distill/factory-home/hooks.json 무변경.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"006a8408c5f3f436c48c7a8cc7f133cbba71bae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/006a8408c5f3f436c48c7a8cc7f133cbba71bae5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/a217321db4bca7f361eab3a102bc3ddd61bdfd5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=