l_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/8b1ae2064cdf57f7a1cb1f86e7d294c1132ab27e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T04:15:07Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T04:15:07Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): 큐 전체를 git_root별로 처리하는 --all 드레인 모드 추가 (0.8.0)\n\n세션 요약을 git repo 밖(중립 경로)에서 요청하면 resolveGitRoot fallback이\ncwd를 그대로 반환해 레포 스코프 --drain이 매칭 0건 → \"처리할 세션 이력 없음\"으로\n끝나던 문제를 해결한다. 저장은 사용자 레벨(머신당 1큐)로 통합돼 있으나 처리만\n레포 스코프였던 불일치가 원인.\n\n- distill-session.mjs: drain의 그룹 처리 코어를 distillGroup()으로 추출(순수\n  리팩터, --drain 하위호환 유지)하고, 큐 전체를 git_root별로 그룹핑해 각 그룹을\n  자기 레포 기준으로 처리하는 drainAll()/--all 모드 신설. git_root 없는 구버전\n  항목은 큐 잔류 + 로그.\n- session-feedback-summarizer.md: 1단계 라우팅 — git repo 밖/전체 요청이면\n  --all, 특정 레포 한정이면 --drain.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f123cc306c6ffba1426e6336e2d5831f816ec33f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/f123cc306c6ffba1426e6336e2d5831f816ec33f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/8b1ae2064cdf57f7a1cb1f86e7d294c1132ab27e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":