"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/af6c133a88cba009a46de9b765f73cba6d25b95b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T07:10:00Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T07:10:00Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): 같은 커밋의 여러 델타를 병합해 커밋당 기록 1개로 (0.7.0)\n\n한 세션에서 git commit 을 여러 번(커밋·amend·reset 후 재커밋) 실행하면 capture 가 같은\nsha 에 여러 델타 구간을 큐에 쌓아, summarizer 가 이를 여러 digest 로 처리하면서 .md 가\n<sha>.md·<sha>-r2.md·<sha>-r3.md 로 쪼개지고 distill --drain 출력이 부풀어 요약 토큰이\n과소모됐다. 실측: 4482cbf·b9f808c 가 각각 3개 델타(offset 연속)로 잡혔다.\n\n■ 병합 지점 = distill drain (capture 아님)\n- capture 는 커밋 임계 경로의 append-only 라 공유 큐 read-modify-write 가 \"가볍고\n  커밋을 막지 않는다\" 규칙과 경합한다. drain 은 이미 큐를 재작성하고 임계 경로 밖에서\n  돌므로 병합을 여기에 둔다. capture 는 건드리지 않는다(큐 스키마·워터마크 불변).\n\n■ 변경\n- distillWindow 를 collectLines(여러 구간을 offset 순 concat) + distillLines(라인→digest)\n  로 분리하고 distillCommit(entries, meta) 추가. 단일 구간 CLI 하위호환 래퍼 유지.\n- commitExists(gitRoot, sha): git rev-parse 로 amend/reset 고아 sha 판별(캐시).\n- drain 재작성: 같은 (git_root, commit) 을 하나의 digest 로 병합. amend/reset 로 사라진\n  고아 커밋 델타는 offset 상 뒤따르는 실 커밋에 fold-forward, 뒤 커밋이 없는 말미 고아는\n  큐에 남겨 다음 drain 으로 미룬다(작업 유실·존재하지 않는 커밋 전송 둘 다 방지).\n  distill 실패는 그룹 단위 롤백으로 큐에 남긴다.\n\n합성 큐(실제 live sha)로 병합·fold-forward·말미 고아 잔류·커밋당 metrics 1개를 실측 검증.\noutput-format 의 digest 정의와 -r2 규칙 적용 범위를 병합 의미에 맞게 갱신.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7730407f23019f02eb464e349753a0ed605f4b52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/7730407f23019f02eb464e349753a0ed605f4b52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/af6c133a88cba009a46de9b765f73cba6d25b95b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/af6c133a88cba009a46de9b765f73cba6d25b95b","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKGFmNmMxMzNhODhjYmEwMDlhNDZkZTliNzY1ZjczY2JhNmQyNWI5NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/7d9998c44637576d53fdd703f3dc9df44b610eee","sha":"7d9998c44637576d53fdd703f3dc9df44b610eee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/7d9998c44637576d53fdd703f3dc9df44b610eee"}],"sha":"af6c133a88cba009a46de9b765f73cba6d25b95b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketP