im-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/33f784300b84cd6077058dd70bb51e4accbc14e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T06:33:45Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T06:33:45Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): 전송·정리를 summarizer 워크플로로 통합하고 실패 로그 도입 (0.6.0)\n\n■ 전송·정리 통합 (Stop 훅 제거)\n- 요약을 요청한 그 자리에서 요약→전송→로컬 정리까지 완결한다. summarizer 4단계로\n  push-sessions.mjs 를 호출(전송 로직은 스크립트에 그대로 — 에이전트에 인라인하지\n  않아 얇은 정의 유지)하고, Stop 훅은 제거해 매턴 스캔 오버헤드를 없앤다.\n- 정리: 전송 성공(created/updated/unchanged)한 .md·metrics.json 만 로컬 삭제하고\n  빈 projectSlug 디렉터리도 정리한다. 서버 DB 가 진실의 원천이라 로컬은 전송용 임시다.\n- 재시도 안전망 보존: 실패·거부분은 로컬에 남겨 다음 요약 때 push 가 자동 재시도한다.\n  안전망이 Stop 훅에서 \"다음 요약\"으로 옮겨갈 뿐, 데이터 유실은 없다.\n\n■ 실패 로그 (~/.agent-factory/errors.jsonl)\n- capture·distill·push 가 지금까지 모든 실패를 조용히 삼켜(exit 0) \"왜 안 올라왔는지\"\n  진단할 수 없던 문제를 해소. factory-home 의 appendLog 로 JSONL 한 줄씩 남긴다\n  (1MB 초과 시 앞 절반 폐기). 로그 쓰기 실패도 삼켜 흐름은 여전히 막지 않는다.\n- push: network/서버 응답/거부(skipped), capture: transcript·git root 못 찾음,\n  distill: distill 실패·metrics 사이드카 실패.\n\n격리 홈에서 성공(전송→삭제→로그없음)·실패(전송실패→잔류→network 로그) 양 케이스 실측.\nREADME·에이전트 정의·hooks.json 을 새 흐름에 맞게 갱신.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8824fb187691af75191f0008a85516b2c0b4b06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/d8824fb187691af75191f0008a85516b2c0b4b06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/33f784300b84cd6077058dd70bb51e4accbc14e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/33f784300b84cd6077058dd70bb51e4accbc14e9","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDMzZjc4NDMwMGI4NGNkNjA3NzA1OGRkNzBiYjUxZTRhY2NiYzE0ZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/b9f808cc89bc227757f3c46f3354c0885be56363","sha":"b9f8