-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/b9f808cc89bc227757f3c46f3354c0885be56363","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/b9f808cc89bc227757f3c46f3354c0885be56363","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKGI5ZjgwOGNjODliYzIyNzc1N2YzYzQ2ZjMzNTRjMDg4NWJlNTYzNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e","sha":"4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8","sha":"6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8"}],"sha":"b9f808cc89bc227757f3c46f3354c0885be56363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/b9f808cc89bc227757f3c46f3354c0885be56363"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T06:13:02Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T06:13:02Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): 세션 기록을 사용자 레벨로 이전하고 distill timeline 유계화 (0.5.0)\n\n두 개선을 함께 적용한다(같은 파일·파이프라인을 공유).\n\n■ 세션 기록·계량치를 사용자 레벨로 이전\n- .md·metrics.json 을 작업 레포가 아니라 ~/.agent-factory/sessions/<projectSlug>/ 에 둔다.\n  팀 공유는 Observer 서버 DB 가 담당하므로 레포 저장은 남의 레포 오염·개인 회고\n  프라이버시 노출·서버와의 이중 저장·레포 간 분산만 낳는다. 이제 레포엔 아무것도 안 남는다.\n- 파일이 레포 밖에 있으므로 어느 프로젝트인지 metrics.json(권위)·.md frontmatter(폴백)의\n  project_path 로 밝힌다. push 는 파일 위치가 아니라 내용에서 프로젝트를 복원해\n  payload.projectPath 로 보낸다 → 서버(record-service)는 무변경.\n- factory-home 에 SESSIONS_DIR·projectSlug(basename-경로해시8)·projectSessionsDir 헬퍼.\n  distill(쓰기)·summarizer(digest.sessions_dir 로 쓰기)·push(읽기)가 단일 규약을 공유.\n- projectSlug 하위 디렉터리로 레포 간 sha7 충돌 회피. 슬러그 계산은 distill 이 하고\n  summarizer(LLM)는 digest.sessions_dir 를 그대로 쓴다.\n\n■ distill timeline 유계화\n- TIMELINE_LIMIT(400)+boundTimeline: 연속 동일 tool_use 를 repeat 로 접고 → 성공 stdout\n  폐기 → P1 초과분 폐기. P0(user/assistant 텍스트·에러)는 절대 폐기하지 않는 soft cap.\n- signals·cost_tokens·agent_costs 는 상한과 무관하게 항상 완전. timeline_meta 로 절단 노출.\n- 큰 델타(세션 전체가 한 커밋에 잡힌 경우)에서 digest 가 부풀어 summarizer 토큰이\n  과소모되던 문제를 막는다(실측 142KB→유계).\n\n리소스(output-format·feedback-rubric)와 README·에이전트 정의를 새 위치·repeat·\ntimeline_meta 규약에 맞게 갱신. 격리 홈에서 capture→distill→push→서버 적재 end-to-end 확인.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c0b0e367a00dc5cb0b6883b0fcc4be2092c5f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/0c0b0e367a00dc5cb0b6883b0fcc4be2092c5f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDZhNmNlNDIzYmI3MDJmMWEzYTVhYTRhZWQzY2IyODg2M2Y4ZDViZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e","sha":"4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e"}],"sha":"6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/6a6ce423bb702f1a3a5aa4aed3cb28863f8d5bd8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T05:18:31Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T05:18:31Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(agent-factory): 에이전트별 결정론적 계량치를 metrics.json 사이드카로 수집·전송\n\nSub-agents·Plugins 화면이 커밋 요약(.md)만으로는 채울 수 없는 토큰·호출·에러\n데이터를 확보하기 위해, distill 이 이미 읽는 JSONL 에서 attributionAgent 별\n계량치를 결정론적으로 뽑아 사이드카로 내보낸다. 원본은 여전히 서버로 보내지 않는다.\n\n- distill: attributionAgent 별 토큰(input/output/cache)·tool_calls·errors 집계,\n  Agent 도구 호출로 subagent_type 별 spawn 수 계산 → <sha>.metrics.json 저장\n- push-sessions: .md 와 같은 sha7 prefix 의 짝 metrics.json 을 함께 POST,\n  전송 상태 해시에 metrics 도 포함(계량치만 갱신된 경우도 재전송)\n- 계량치는 LLM(summarizer)을 거치지 않는다 — 토큰·비용은 정확해야 의미가 있어\n  사람용 요약 .md 와 기계 정밀 계량치를 파일로 분리한다\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e12a21a3cec3877de907bb84bcc7233abe532c3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/e12a21a3cec3877de907bb84bcc7233abe532c3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDQ0ODJjYmY2OTViOTIwNWZhYTNhOGY2OGEyNTg0ZDNiMTRmZWQ2NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052","sha":"8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052"}],"sha":"4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/4482cbf695b9205faa3a8f68a2584d3b14fed64e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T04:26:44Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T04:26:44Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"fix(hooks): 버전 자동 상승이 macOS에서 조용히 실패하던 문제 수정\n\npre-commit 훅의 버전 bump가 sed -E \"0,/re/ s//repl/\" 를 썼는데, 0,/re/ 주소는\nGNU sed 확장이라 macOS 의 BSD sed 에서는 에러 없이 no-op 되고 exit 0 을 반환했다.\n&& mv 가 원본(미변경)을 도로 덮어쓰고, 뒤이은 echo 는 성공 여부와 무관하게 항상\n찍혀 ''버전 올렸다''고 거짓 보고했다. 그 결과 macOS 사용자는 커밋마다 버전이 소리\n없이 누락돼, 명시 버전 표준(version 을 올려야 /plugin update 로 갱신됨)이 조용히\n무너졌다. CI 등 GNU sed 환경에서만 정상 동작해 드러나지 않았다.\n\n- 치환을 node 로 교체(BSD/GNU 무관, 검증기도 이미 전제하는 런타임). 첫 version 만\n  텍스트 치환해 JSON 포맷을 보존한다.\n- 치환 후 파일이 실제로 new_ver 로 바뀌었는지 검증하는 가드 추가 — 조용한 실패가\n  재발하면 커밋을 중단하고 수동 상승을 요구한다.\n- node 부재 시에도 조용히 넘어가지 않고 커밋을 중단한다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d3c4668658baa1425ac1b7afc4944daf088f809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/4d3c4668658baa1425ac1b7afc4944daf088f809"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDhjOTU5YTA5OWMzODZhNzllNWU2Zjc1ODVhMGRhODBjM2RkOWEwNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/aa29c46629f6f7d7ff7f653700577d394b04a206","sha":"aa29c46629f6f7d7ff7f653700577d394b04a206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/aa29c46629f6f7d7ff7f653700577d394b04a206"}],"sha":"8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/8c959a099c386a79e5e6f7585a0da80c3dd9a052"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/aa29c46629f6f7d7ff7f653700577d394b04a206/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T04:23:42Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T04:23:42Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"docs(claude-code-hooks): 공통 입력 필드 표를 실제 스펙에 맞게 보강\n\n기존 문서는 hook stdin 공통 필드를 session_id·cwd·hook_event_name 3개로만\n적어, 구현자가 세션 JSONL 경로를 직접 찾는 우회 구현을 하게 만들었다. 실제로는\ntranscript_path가 모든 훅에 공통 제공된다. permission_mode·prompt_id·effort,\n서브에이전트의 agent_id·agent_type까지 표로 보강하고, 세션 JSONL은\ntranscript_path를 쓰라는 주의를 덧붙인다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24322e43318c992d22f21dd3788507cef0a26ea3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/24322e43318c992d22f21dd3788507cef0a26ea3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/aa29c46629f6f7d7ff7f653700577d394b04a206","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gi