.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/fe220bb9b01574e2311faf7b9fafd3f78ce01b59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/f824039b4ebc2fd457d73b6c736484d89f5e6d48/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:19:19Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:19:19Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(scripts): 정의 파일 검증기 도입 및 pre-commit 훅 연결\n\n빌드가 없는 저장소라 정의 파일의 정합성이 커밋 시점에 검증되지 않았다.\n의존성 0의 Node 검증기 4종을 추가하고 기존 버전 자동 상승 훅에 연결한다.\n\n- validate-manifests: marketplace.json ↔ plugin.json 동기화, 이름 3자 일치,\n  SemVer, 미등재 플러그인 (양방향)\n- validate-agents: 필수 frontmatter, 파일명 = name, model 허용값,\n  description 리터럴 블록 스칼라 금지, tools 미선언 경고\n- validate-skills: SKILL.md 존재, 디렉터리명 = name, description 규격\n- validate-personal-paths: /Users/<name> 하드코딩 검출 (설계 원칙 2 강제)\n\n훅은 버전 상승 이후에 검증한다 — 훅이 방금 고친 plugin.json 도 검사 대상이다.\nERROR 는 커밋을 막고 WARN 은 통과시킨다. 우회는 SKIP_VALIDATE=1.\n\nCLAUDE.md 에는 훅이 자동 실행한다는 사실만 남기고 상세는 scripts/README.md 로\n분리했다. 검증 강제는 훅이 결정론적으로 하므로 상시 컨텍스트에 명령형 지시를\n중복으로 두지 않는다.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0a0193e72a924badfbccf9965dd5b4be11bc163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/c0a0193e72a924badfbccf9965dd5b4be11bc163"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/f824039b4ebc2fd457d73b6c736484d89f5e6d48","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/f824039b4ebc2fd457d73b6c736484d89f5e6d48","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKGY4MjQwMzliNGViYzJmZDQ1N2Q3M2I2YzczNjQ4NGQ4OWY1ZTZkNDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84","sha":"464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84"}],"sha":"f824039b4ebc2fd457d73b6c736484d89f5e6d48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/f824039b4ebc2fd457d73b6c736484d89f5e6d48"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:06:09Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T09:06:09Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"docs(test-authoring): RTL 실전 함정 4종 문서화\n\na2a feature 컴포넌트에 테스트를 붙이며 실제로 부딪힌 함정을 examples.md에\n추가한다. 넷 다 인프라 문제가 단언 실패로 위장해, 모르면 단언을 약화시키는\n쪽으로 잘못 고치게 되는 것들이다.\n\n- RTL 자동 cleanup은 vitest globals가 꺼져 있으면 등록되지 않는다\n  → DOM 누적으로 getByText가 multiple elements 실패. setup에서 명시적 cleanup.\n  (부수: @testing-library/jest-dom은 @testing-library/dom을 peer로 요구)\n- userEvent.setup()이 navigator.clipboard를 자체 스텁으로 교체한다\n  → 클립보드 목은 setup 이후에 설치해야 한다.\n- 디자인 시스템 다이얼로그는 헤더 X와 푸터 버튼의 접근명이 겹칠 수 있다\n  → getByRole 대신 findAllByRole + 인덱스. 클래스 셀렉터 우회는 구현 결합.\n- throwOnError 훅은 캐시 주입으로 제어되지 않는다\n  → setQueryData 대신 해당 훅만 교체.\n\nSKILL.md의 RTL 섹션에서 이 절을 가리키도록 연결했다.\n콘텐츠 보강이므로 version 1.2.0 → 1.2.1 (patch).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1028f3beb47a35a13ce73b05ce121ac47402791f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/1028f3beb47a35a13ce73b05ce121ac47402791f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84","node_id":"C_kwDOTLKJxdoAKDQ2NGEyZTMwYmExMGRiM2MwZDVkNjUyMjM3NWZhZTUyZTQ4ZGFhODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commit/cbad94fd2e5ba911eb63a26df22fbe5e9203a322","sha":"cbad94fd2e5ba911eb63a26df22fbe5e9203a322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/cbad94fd2e5ba911eb63a26df22fbe5e9203a322"}],"sha":"464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/464a2e30ba10db3c0d5d6522375fae52e48daa84"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/commits/cbad94fd2e5ba911eb63a26df22fbe5e9203a322/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:01:50Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T07:01:50Z","email":"rlatmddnjs0103@naver.com","name":"Kim-soung-won"},"message":"feat(frontend-support-plugin): 테스트 저술 skill + writer/reviewer 에이전트 추가\n\n도메인 스킬·함수 계약 기반 단위 테스트 워크플로를 skill 1 + agent 2로 구성.\n\n- skills/test-authoring: 테스트 단언 유도 규약(이원화). 도메인 행위는\n  _scenario/_api/_domain 스킬에서, 스킬 없는 순수 로직은 함수 계약(불변식\n  우선·에러 문자열 결합 최소화)에서 유도. test/ 미러 컨벤션, RTL 하니스 주의,\n  스킬 기반 선행 게이트(domain-skill-reviewer) 명시.\n- agents/test-writer: 대상 모듈 1개에 테스트를 작성→vitest 실행→요약 반환.\n  격리 컨텍스트 병렬 fan-out 워커. 규약은 test-authoring 스킬을 Read해 위임.\n- agents/test-reviewer: change-detector·약한 단언 감사, 수정 없이 리포트만\n  (수정은 test-writer). domain-skill-manager↔reviewer 짝 패턴 차용.\n\n에이전트 본문은 얇게, 절차·출력형식은 resources로 분리.\nskill+에이전트 2종 추가(기능 추가)로 version 1.1.0 → 1.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f75d2a34363f4dbd4c95e80bf7d505659fc318aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/trees/f75d2a34363f4dbd4c95e80bf7d505659fc318aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kim-soung-won/ksw-claude-marketPlace/git/commits/cbad94fd2e5ba911eb63a26df22fbe5e9203a322","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105148570?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Kim-soung-won","id":105148570,"login":"Kim-soung-won","node_id":"U_kgDOBkRwmg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kim-soung-won/subscriptions","type":