/users/vageez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vageez","id":37623247,"login":"vageez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIzMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/runtime-module-composition.dev/commits/0340d87f547af2f16c150956790b4eb7aca7e95f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:54:40Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:54:40Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"message":"Simplify the existing-app guide to one host-only walkthrough\n\nRemoved the generic \"slice''s shape\" and \"Hello\" wiring examples —\nshowing the slice-side factory code here risked implying a host\nintegrator needs to write that code themselves, when this guide is\nabout the host side only. The real pricing-plans example is now the\nsingle walkthrough, right after the \"why\" section, with the import-map\nstep explaining what its key and value each represent. The slice-side\ncontract is left to the API Reference, linked from where the factory\nis first mentioned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b39fa0bf050d3e5db183f9cc182b559ede83c585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/runtime-module-composition.dev/git/trees/b39fa0bf050d3e5db183f9cc182b559ede83c585"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/runtime-module-composition.dev/git/commits/0340d87f547af2f16c150956