scriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/runtime-module-composition.dev/commits/3b9b45b75b2d10cff9416410b34d9958fa4feea2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:04:30Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:04:30Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"message":"Document sliceName and the hosted-import-map ordering-safety plugin\n\nReflects two recent rmc-toolkit changes: defineSliceBuild()''s new\nrequired sliceName option (determines the dist/{sliceName} production\noutput path), and includeHostedImportMap()''s new Plugin[] return\nwrapping vite-plugin-js-importmap-script for dev-mode ordering safety.\nAlso documents two previously-exported-but-undocumented core helpers,\nresolveImportMapSpecifier() and splitPackageSpecifier().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86fab37892c278e76c92739a9a2120591f6bcd50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/runtime-module-composition.dev/git/trees/86fab37892c278e76c92739a9a2120591f6bcd50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/runtime-module-composition.dev/git/commits/3b9b45b75b2d10cff9416410b34d9958fa4feea2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37623247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vageez","id":37623247,"login":"vageez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIzMj