https://api.github.com/users/vageez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/rmc-toolkit/commits/372843ae5871f8d4c7902a1e0f2258c41c832c34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:41:55Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:41:55Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"message":"Tighten createVueAdapter comments per code review\n\n- Name the actual mechanism that makes the separate watch() safe (no\n  immediate: true, so it can''t fire before onMounted assigns observable)\n  instead of describing it as registration-order coincidence.\n- Note that assigning status.value inside the subscribe callback is safe\n  outside Vue''s reactive tracking context, matching an externally-triggered\n  ref update like a WebSocket handler.","tree":{"sha":"b67b919245c9b9a8ac3a69672648f563b4de524d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/rmc-toolkit/git/trees/b67b919245c9b9a8ac3a69672648f563b4de524d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/rmc-toolkit/git/commits/372843ae5871f8d4c7902a1e0f2258c41c832c34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37623247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vageez","id":37623247,"login":"vageez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIzMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.