.com/u/37623247?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vageez","id":37623247,"login":"vageez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NjIzMjQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vageez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/rmc-toolkit/commits/ceaee0f2dbdbbf37cddf49faefa7d32be8ac4474/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T18:15:04Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T18:15:04Z","email":"37623247+vageez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Angelo Vagenas"},"message":"Fix a real TypeScript error in host.test.ts''s mockImplementation reassignment\n\nvitest run doesn''t type-check (esbuild strips types without checking\nthem), so this went undetected since Task 3: vi.fn(async () => { throw\n... }) infers a Promise<never> call signature from its always-throwing\nimplementation, which conflicted with a later mockImplementation()\nreturning an actual value. Pin the mock''s call signature explicitly via\nvi.fn<...>() so both implementations type-check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b210f5da129938c5c12fda747d3c2252283418d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/runtime-module-composition/rmc-toolkit/git/trees/0b210f5da129938c5c12fda747d3c22