e ClaimGuard base URL into one file, add temp debug panel\n\nCLAIMGUARD_BASE_URL now lives in src/config.js alone (was duplicated as\nDEFAULT_BASE_URL across three files) -- one place to edit last-minute,\nnow http://localhost:3001 to match the dashboard''s new default port.\n\nClaimGuardHomeCard also gets a temporary debug block on fetch failure\n(clearly marked for later removal) showing the exact URL attempted and\nthe raw error, distinguishing a wrong URL/CORS rejection (TypeError, no\nHTTP status) from a real HTTP error from the dashboard''s own API route.","tree":{"sha":"57c45eb0072c874f6e38ca047100b98775525b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/trees/57c45eb0072c874f6e38ca047100b98775525b62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/commits/1a6cfe7eeaf7da4aba9695947394b4ee2ff9a40e","verification":{"payload":"tree 57c45eb0072c874f6e38ca047100b98775525b62\nparent d6e98c32b5047225d0a2b1133b065b06bdfadfbe\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783151518 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783151518 +0000\n\nConsolidate ClaimGuard base URL into one file, add temp debug panel\n\nCLAIMGUARD_BASE_URL now lives in src/config.js alone (was duplicated as\nDEFAULT_BASE_URL across three files) -- one place to edit last-minute,\nnow http://localhost:3001 to match the dashboard''s new default port.\n\nClaimGuardHomeCard also gets a temporary debug block on fetch failure\n(clearly marked for later removal) showing the exact URL attempted and\nthe raw error, distinguishing a wrong URL/CORS rejection (TypeError, no\nHTTP status) from a real HTTP error from the dashboard''s own API route.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHsHd9UP\ndoEUoSSHnLDAQKyvwwffzWskQ39CPVPNlHd4TV421+j2zcTL0DQnsvkZKmuo9Rud1xHiOMQ7z