abel, enabled, action} objects the claim module\npasses via its own `actions` prop; a plain object there crashed the\nclaims list page render (\"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading\n''props'')\" as the searcher mounted). The claim-detail MasterPanel\nalready provides the \"Run AI Analysis\" button, so dropping the\nlist-level action loses no real capability.","tree":{"sha":"17aaca90ff05552cece6d6db534f9086bd0ca530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/trees/17aaca90ff05552cece6d6db534f9086bd0ca530"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/commits/643dcb68efaf764d318c0449ccef7670f88f7758","verification":{"payload":"tree 17aaca90ff05552cece6d6db534f9086bd0ca530\nparent bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783122002 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783122002 +0000\n\nRemove claim.SelectionAction contribution -- it white-screened the claims list\n\nfe-core renders contributions under claim.SelectionAction differently\nthan the plain {label, enabled, action} objects the claim module\npasses via its own `actions` prop; a plain object there crashed the\nclaims list page render (\"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading\n''props'')\" as the searcher mounted). The claim-detail MasterPanel\nalready provides the \"Run AI Analysis\" button, so dropping the\nlist-level action loses no real capability.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPkCBdp8\nOQO4opqUEsYc0ErMfaQyGJoEfayDBjog4UbKKy8HOJJrmx3EYkoePUCMibO8SWTz73DfXepg8xE+\n6w0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T23:40:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/643dcb68efaf764d318c0449ccef7670f88f7758","node_id":"C_kwDOTM5KlNoAKDY0M2RjYjY4ZWZhZjc2NGQzMThjMDQ0OWNjZWY3NjcwZjg4Zjc3NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b","sha":"bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b"}],"sha":"643dcb68efaf764d318c0449ccef7670f88f7758","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/643dcb68efaf764d318c0449ccef7670f88f7758"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:17:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T23:17:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix i18n keys showing raw; expand home card content\n\nTwo bugs, one cause: openIMIS''s FormattedMessage looks up\n`module + \".\" + id` against a FLAT message dict whose keys already\ncarry the module prefix (matching openimis-fe-claim_js''s en.json,\ne.g. \"claim.mainMenu\"). The home card and about page were passing\nid=\"claimguard.home.title\" *with* module=\"claimguard\", so lookups\nbecame \"claimguard.claimguard.home.title\" -> not found -> the raw key\nrendered on screen. Flattened en.json to prefixed flat keys and\ndropped the redundant \"claimguard.\" from every id (the panel was\nalready correct, which is why only the home card/about page showed\nraw keys).\n\nAlso expands the home card body into real explanatory copy (fraud\nsignals it catches, the three ways to reach ClaimGuard from openIMIS)\ninstead of the one-liner.","tree":{"sha":"d7d87e68374c8091ef1ced1eed3cae554ae0f338","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/trees/d7d87e68374c8091ef1ced1eed3cae554ae0f338"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/commits/bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b","verification":{"payload":"tree d7d87e68374c8091ef1ced1eed3cae554ae0f338\nparent 1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783120646 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783120646 +0000\n\nFix i18n keys showing raw; expand home card content\n\nTwo bugs, one cause: openIMIS''s FormattedMessage looks up\n`module + \".\" + id` against a FLAT message dict whose keys already\ncarry the module prefix (matching openimis-fe-claim_js''s en.json,\ne.g. \"claim.mainMenu\"). The home card and about page were passing\nid=\"claimguard.home.title\" *with* module=\"claimguard\", so lookups\nbecame \"claimguard.claimguard.home.title\" -> not found -> the raw key\nrendered on screen. Flattened en.json to prefixed flat keys and\ndropped the redundant \"claimguard.\" from every id (the panel was\nalready correct, which is why only the home card/about page showed\nraw keys).\n\nAlso expands the home card body into real explanatory copy (fraud\nsignals it catches, the three ways to reach ClaimGuard from openIMIS)\ninstead of the one-liner.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC7hl88H\n1t5lL7uJWSapClZIdKqCfDUiugcsNw/PYBZ/IN6gLJWXp24W7ahROdVsMutAfVwFcc6Gjpdcihia\nDQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T23:17:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b","node_id":"C_kwDOTM5KlNoAKGJjYWM3YjY1NzcxOTY3NzIzNzI2OGJlZDkxNTBmNzk3ZmZiNWU4N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd","sha":"1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd"}],"sha":"bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/bcac7b657719677237268bed9150f797ffb5e87b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T21:46:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T21:46:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add home page card and claims-list AI-analysis action\n\nTwo more integration points, both confirmed real extension points\n(not guesses):\n\n- \"home.HomePage.Blocks\" -- openimis-fe-home_js''s HomePageContainer\n  renders every contribution here right after the \"Welcome <name>\"\n  heading on the post-login landing page. Adds a simple ClaimGuard\n  card with a link to the dashboard.\n\n- \"claim.SelectionAction\" -- a generic Searcher-level (fe-core)\n  toolbar-action extension point, the same one the claim module''s own\n  \"Submit all\"/\"Delete selected\" buttons use on the claims list.\n  Select exactly one claim -> \"Get AI Analysis (ClaimGuard)\" appears,\n  opens that claim in ClaimGuard with ?autoAnalyze=1.\n\nDeliberately not a literal inline per-row button in the claims table\n-- ClaimSearcher.jsx''s row rendering (itemFormatters) is hardcoded\nwith no extension point at all, so that would require forking\nopenimis-fe-claim_js itself and a second full rebuild cycle. This\nselection-action gets the same practical outcome (pick a claim from\nthe list, jump straight to its ClaimGuard analysis) using an\nextension point that already exists.","tree":{"sha":"4ad63d7bbd82236601996ba9092f701140a48a34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/trees/4ad63d7bbd82236601996ba9092f701140a48a34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/commits/1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ad63d7bbd82236601996ba9092f701140a48a34\nparent b6348c5de1746d252c913f06b7dfb57a4326fd3d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783115181 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783115181 +0000\n\nAdd home page card and claims-list AI-analysis action\n\nTwo more integration points, both confirmed real extension points\n(not guesses):\n\n- \"home.HomePage.Blocks\" -- openimis-fe-home_js''s HomePageContainer\n  renders every contribution here right after the \"Welcome <name>\"\n  heading on the post-login landing page. Adds a simple ClaimGuard\n  card with a link to the dashboard.\n\n- \"claim.SelectionAction\" -- a generic Searcher-level (fe-core)\n  toolbar-action extension point, the same one the claim module''s own\n  \"Submit all\"/\"Delete selected\" buttons use on the claims list.\n  Select exactly one claim -> \"Get AI Analysis (ClaimGuard)\" appears,\n  opens that claim in ClaimGuard with ?autoAnalyze=1.\n\nDeliberately not a literal inline per-row button in the claims table\n-- ClaimSearcher.jsx''s row rendering (itemFormatters) is hardcoded\nwith no extension point at all, so that would require forking\nopenimis-fe-claim_js itself and a second full rebuild cycle. This\nselection-action gets the same practical outcome (pick a claim from\nthe list, jump straight to its ClaimGuard analysis) using an\nextension point that already exists.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFVTqKUH\nRLRCYKoJzmIaoeqYpBZNVwyU5z1cB/hBBaZUeuGn3oA9MpCWZVeMJIiM8tHvZExMKMB7pB/NhDQT\nYQ8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T21:46:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd","node_id":"C_kwDOTM5KlNoAKDFjMjQ0N2NmZTA5YWNkOThjMzI0NzQyOGVkY2IxNDY3YjBlNjljZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/b6348c5de1746d252c913f06b7dfb57a4326fd3d","sha":"b6348c5de1746d252c913f06b7dfb57a4326fd3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/b6348c5de1746d252c913f06b7dfb57a4326fd3d"}],"sha":"1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/1c2447cfe09acd98c3247428edcb1467b0e69cdd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commits/b6348c5de1746d252c913f06b7dfb57a4326fd3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-03T20:04:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-03T20:04:54Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add missing prepare script -- dist/ was never getting built on install\n\nnpm installs this package straight from its git source (no prebuilt\ndist/ committed, correctly gitignored), so package.json''s main/module\nfields (dist/index.cjs.js, dist/index.es.js) pointed at files that\nnever existed after a plain git-based npm install -- only \"npm run\nbuild\" run manually would create them. Real openIMIS modules (e.g.\nfe-claim) rely on npm''s prepare lifecycle hook to build automatically\nright after a git install; this package was missing that hook, which\nis exactly why Vite''s dependency resolution failed on\n\"fe-claimguard\" with every other @openimis/fe-* module resolving\nfine.","tree":{"sha":"7c0c2e0ecce971f6610afc0bb45ed1557461412d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/trees/7c0c2e0ecce971f6610afc0bb45ed1557461412d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/git/commits/b6348c5de1746d252c913f06b7dfb57a4326fd3d","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c0c2e0ecce971f6610afc0bb45ed1557461412d\nparent bf724124d26ce93e6d4e725f85e2cb5190ce9c3b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783109094 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783109094 +0000\n\nAdd missing prepare script -- dist/ was never getting built on install\n\nnpm installs this package straight from its git source (no prebuilt\ndist/ committed, correctly gitignored), so package.json''s main/module\nfields (dist/index.cjs.js, dist/index.es.js) pointed at files that\nnever existed after a plain git-based npm install -- only \"npm run\nbuild\" run manually would create them. Real openIMIS modules (e.g.\nfe-claim) rely on npm''s prepare lifecycle hook to build automatically\nright after a git install; this package was missing that hook, which\nis exactly why Vite''s dependency resolution failed on\n\"fe-claimguard\" with every other @openimis/fe-* module resolving\nfine.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAe2Oy+U\nJYITm7aL+YsZI5b19whdaLyZLG9/ausHDmrqBv6ZDxCZqgZ5Bg4xo/lvGY6yp7gc9YmRSQrdhaD+\nrAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-03T20:04:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/b6348c5de1746d252c913f06b7dfb57a4326fd3d","node_id":"C_kwDOTM5KlNoAKGI2MzQ4YzVkZTE3NDZkMjUyYzkxM2YwNmI3ZGZiNTdhNDMyNmZkM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chaldeastudios/openimis-claimguard-module/commit/bf724124d26ce93e6d4e725f8