/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/3d6f5db94eb66833b4f374deec2109cdc8bb736b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:49:49Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:49:49Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(library): show the place name in photo metadata\n\n\"Boston, Massachusetts\" in the details panel and lightbox, above the\ncoordinates and the map link.\n\nPast 5 km it reads \"near Gorham, New Hampshire\" — reverse geocoding returns the\nclosest populated place, and for a photo in open country that town is context,\nnot a location. Outside the US the country is shown instead of an\nadministrative region most readers wouldn''t recognise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d13698288e9195d1663b7de010f924c04872ea61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/d13698288e9195d1663b7de010f924c04872ea61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/3d6f5db94eb66833b4f374deec2109cdc8bb736b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/3d6f5db94eb66833b4f374deec2109cdc8bb736b","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDNkNmY1ZGI5NGViNjY4MzNiNGYzNzRkZWVjMjEwOWNkYzhiYjczNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632","sha":"bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632"}],"sha":"3d6f5db94eb66833b4f374deec2109cdc8bb736b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/3d6f5db94eb66833b4f374deec2109cdc8bb736b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:49:49Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:49:49Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(geo): store the nearest place on each photo\n\nphotos.city/region/country/place_distance_km (migration 0014), filled during\nscans and by the GPS backfill, and exposed on PhotoRead.\n\nGeocoding happens where scan results are persisted, never inside process_file:\nthe lookup tree is ~100 MB, so building it per worker would multiply that by\nthe worker count. The backfill geocodes one batch per chunk rather than one\ncall per photo.\n\nStored rather than derived per request because these columns are what a future\ngroup-by-location filters on, and it keeps the read path a plain column select.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"966c14ebb1667a1292510635d20fc8120a9ac747","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/966c14ebb1667a1292510635d20fc8120a9ac747"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGJiNWU2ZTMzZWJlZWUwYTdjYjVjMWZkZjcxZjJjMWNhZmJhN2E2MzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/21fdaf1424d9ab13745ebdc5f6031a14449f409a","sha":"21fdaf1424d9ab13745ebdc5f6031a14449f409a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/21fdaf1424d9ab13745ebdc5f6031a14449f409a"}],"sha":"bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/bb5e6e33ebeee0a7cb5c1fdf71f2c1cafba7a632"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/21fdaf1424d9ab13745ebdc5f6031a14449f409a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:49:49Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:49:49Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(geo): offline reverse geocoding for photo coordinates\n\nTurns coordinates into a nearest-place name with a k-d tree over ~150k bundled\nGeoNames cities. A web geocoding API was never a candidate: the coordinates of\nsomeone''s photos are exactly what a local-first app must not send anywhere.\nnumpy and scipy were already present via ImageHash, so the cost is the 7.5 MB\ndataset.\n\nTwo honesty constraints are built into the API rather than left to callers:\n\n- It returns the nearest *known* place, which in open country is not where the\n  photo was taken — measured against this library, the median distance is\n  13.5 km. distance_km is therefore part of Place.\n- Past PLACE_MAX_KM (default 100) it returns nothing. Naming a city 400 km\n  across an ocean is worse than admitting we don''t know.\n\nreverse_geocoder.search is called with mode=1 because the default forks a\nprocess pool. Tests run against the real dataset — a mocked k-d tree would\nprove nothing about whether the names are right.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bcca1a9907c81e7f102832a05ea291ca9604f16d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/bcca1a9907c81e7f102832a05ea291ca9604f16d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/21fdaf1424d9ab13745ebdc5f6031a14449f409a","verification":{"payload":n