"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/ed38e8ece04ca0a6e20e914fae2beb7486e5574e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:30:05Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T00:30:05Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"docs: record the indexing and dedupe rules, refresh status\n\nARCHITECTURE gains the indexing strategy (why each composite leads with status\nand ends with id, why the model and migration must agree) and the two rules\nbounding dedupe cost. Also corrects two claims verified stale: a thumb_status\ncolumn that exists in no migration or model, and a \"Cleanup\" view that is\nactually /quarantine.\n\nTASKS had no entry for anything after PR 7.2 — eight feature and fix commits\nalready on main — and Phase 7 was the only phase missing its completion marker.\n\nTest counts: 111 -> 153 frontend, 166 -> 176 backend.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6adaf3438645a6344a90003c32938d580d68d32f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/6adaf3438645a6344a90003c32938d580d68d32f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/ed38e8ece04ca0a6e20e914fae2beb7486e5574e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://