name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(library): shift and cmd click on grid tiles\n\nThe tile click handler now receives the MouseEvent, so shiftKey/metaKey reach\nthe store. The selected ring keys off selectedIds, and a check badge sits at\nthe tile''s top-left because the marked ring deliberately overrides the selected\none — without it a selected-and-marked photo gave no feedback.\n\nuser-select: none on the grid stops shift+click dragging a text selection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4d97a4ba4b19692c15c85555e4c969a42b2899c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/f4d97a4ba4b19692c15c85555e4c969a42b2899c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/520437c121389f7f607917539e75e2ab5e1137f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/520437c121389f7f607917539e75e2ab5e1137f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDUyMDQzN2MxMjEzODlmN2Y2MDc5MTc1MzllNzVlMmFiNWUxMTM3ZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42","sha":"cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42"}],"sha":"520437c121389f7f607917539e75e2ab5e1137f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/520437c121389f7f607917539e75e2ab5e1137f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:21:00Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:21:00Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(library): multi-selection state with shift-range and bulk mark\n\nAdds selectedIds + an anchor to the library store. clickPhoto() is the single\nentry point for grid clicks: plain selects one and sets the anchor, shift adds\nthe run from the anchor (additive, so a scattered cmd-click set survives),\ncmd/ctrl toggles one. setMarkedForSelection() flags the whole selection\noptimistically in batches of 500.\n\nSelection clears in fetchCurrentPage(), which covers paging, page-size and\nevery filter/sort change — a bulk action can never reach photos that are no\nlonger on screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6eb3c22a2a8b6fcf1f88bb6f84a481f16362eacb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/6eb3c22a2a8b6fcf1f88bb6f84a481f16362eacb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGNmNjBmNWY0ZDYxZDA3NTVmZWI3ZjljNGEwMjUzZjZhZDgzZWNhNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242","sha":"5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242"}],"sha":"cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/cf60f5f4d61d0755feb7f9c4a0253f6ad83eca42"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T20:03:56Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T20:03:56Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"test(organize): pin that source folders are never pruned\n\nOrganize moves photos out of source folders, leaving them empty. The app\nhas always left those folders alone — it only creates directories and\nmoves files — but nothing pinned that, and unrequested ''tidying'' had\nremoved two of the user''s emptied folders by hand.\n\nAdds a hard rule to CLAUDE.md (never delete the user''s directories, even\nempty ones, without an explicit request naming the path) and a regression\ntest asserting a nested source tree survives an organize run. The test\nwas mutation-checked: adding an rmdir to the executor makes it fail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c0908ec605dad66c6ada499901611dba055aa95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/8c0908ec605dad66c6ada499901611dba055aa95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDVhYjlhYmJkNDk2MjRmODVkMTI3MmY3YjZhNDVhN2IwNjczNTkyNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304","sha":"c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304"}],"sha":"5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/5ab9abbd49624f85d1272f7b6a45a7b067359242"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T17:25:47Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T17:25:47Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"fix(organize): remember destination and mode, surface them before committing\n\nA run went to the wrong place because both key settings were invisible\ndefaults: mode silently stayed on ''keep'', and the destination was\nrecomputed each visit as ''<first root>/Organized'' — so adding a folder\nthat sorted first silently retargeted the run at the folder being\norganized.\n\n- Destination, mode, rename and skip-duplicates now persist to\n  localStorage (aperture-organize-prefs), matching the theme store''s\n  pattern; discarding a working set no longer forgets them. The\n  first-run fallback prefers an existing /Organized root over whichever\n  folder happens to sort first.\n- build_plan reports destination_inside_source; the Destination card\n  warns when the destination sits inside a folder being organized.\n  A warning, not a refusal — the layout is legal, just rarely intended.\n- The preview panel now states ''Moving into <path>'' and a Structure row\n  (''Keep folder names'' / ''Year / Month folders'' / ''Camera model\n  folders''), so the mode is visible where the user commits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0aa58d3de3e4c54e959b13be847ee9f4427c0d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/0aa58d3de3e4c54e959b13be847ee9f4427c0d08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGM1OGZiZDkzMDk4OTkyNjk0NzMyNTE3MGY5OGEzZjBlMjYxMTkzMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5","sha":"d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5"}],"sha":"c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/c58fbd930989926947325170f98a3f0e26119304"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:55:41Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:55:41Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"docs: thorough README rewrite with architecture mermaid diagram\n\nBrings the README up to the Phase 7 state (organize, GPS groundwork,\nfolder filtering) and adds: a high-level mermaid architecture diagram\n(SPA -> FastAPI layers/jobs/files -> Postgres + filesystem), annotated\nrepo layout, full environment-variable table from config.py, scan\npipeline and duplicate-detection walkthroughs, organize workflow and\nsafety model, testing/quality-gate commands, and an updated\nlimitations/roadmap section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"689e4c944dca903e9a0e5a2af9f4cb56e3222750","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/689e4c944dca903e9a0e5a2af9f4cb56e3222750"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGQ1ODg2NzQwNGZhN2U3MzBkZDRjZjQ0NjY0Y2JjZDk4YTdhMjJhZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/c01ad4a89424d6336508ed49834c16cd236aeda4","sha":"c01ad4a89424d6336508ed49834c16cd236aeda4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/c01ad4a89424d6336508ed49834c16cd236aeda4"}],"sha":"d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/d58867404fa7e730dd4cf44664cbcd98a7a22af5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/c01ad4a89424d6336508ed49834c16cd236aeda4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:13:39Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T00:13:39Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(library): clicking a folder filters the grid to that folder\n\nFolder rows previously only toggled the organize checkbox — clicking a\nfolder did nothing visible. Now the row filters the Library grid to that\nfolder (recursive, via the existing backend folder filter), highlights\nthe active row, and shows the folder name in the subheader with an\n''× All photos'' clear button; clicking the same folder again shows all\nphotos. The checkbox keeps its ''selected for organizing'' role and now\nresponds only to direct clicks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d62787c3b7af1ba9b5c0852333383c4b226f72b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/8d62787c3b7af1ba9b5c0852333383c4b226f72b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/c01ad4a89424d6336508ed49834c16cd236aeda4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/c01ad4a89424d6336508ed49834c16cd236aeda4","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGMwMWFkNGE4OTQyNGQ2MzM2NTA4ZWQ0OTgzNGMxNmNkMjM2YWVkYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/839e36e618cf1d75c95bd630e07e8c49b4c3af4e","sha":"839e36e618cf1d75c95bd630e07e8c49b4c3af4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/839e36e618cf1d75c95bd630e07e8c49b4c3af4e"}],"sha":"