roundwork for a future group-by-location feature: the scanner now reads\nthe EXIF GPS IFD (previously never fetched), converts DMS rationals to\nsigned decimal degrees, and stores them in new photos.latitude/longitude\ndouble-precision columns (migration 0012). Because rescans skip unchanged\nfiles, POST /api/maintenance/backfill-gps walks already-indexed photos in\nid-cursor chunks reading only EXIF headers. No location UI yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e79cd86ad3a839bedec4090c6b4e3d1170c5234c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/e79cd86ad3a839bedec4090c6b4e3d1170c5234c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/649aca5b101257eedf9f0273a3819ce6c49f3665","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/649aca5b101257eedf9f0273a3819ce6c49f3665","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDY0OWFjYTViMTAxMjU3ZWVkZjlmMDI3M2EzODE5Y2U2YzQ5ZjM2NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6","sha":"39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6"}],"sha":"649aca5b101257eedf9f0273a3819ce6c49f3665","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/649aca5b101257eedf9f0273a3819ce6c49f3665"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:31:17Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:31:17Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(frontend): organize view\n\nReplaces the Phase 7 placeholder with the designed Organize screen:\nworking-set rail fed by the Library''s folder checkboxes, destination\ncard with Browse picker and Keep/By date/By camera segmented control,\nrename and skip-duplicates toggle cards with live preview data, and a\npreview rail with example destinations, summary table, progress bar\nwhile running, and a success banner on completion. Visuals recreated\nfrom Organize.dc.html using existing tokens plus the handoff''s success\nbanner colors; the design''s Tags card is out of scope for v1.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a983bf44c1425d923bdfe3b60609557f73b3b814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/a983bf44c1425d923bdfe3b60609557f73b3b814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDM5ZDNkNWVkMzljN2FjYzZhYmRhNjQ5ODJmN2I5NzYyMGU2YWJlYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2","sha":"4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2"}],"sha":"39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/39d3d5ed39c7acc6abda64982f7b97620e6abec6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:25:25Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:25:25Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(frontend): organize api client and store\n\nTyped client for /api/organize (preview/start/poll) and a Pinia store\nthat owns destination/mode/rename/skip-duplicates state, keeps the\nworking set in the library store''s folder checkboxes (single source of\ntruth, with a new uncheckSubtree action), debounces server previews by\n300ms, and polls a started run at 1s until it completes — refreshing the\nfolder tree and grid whose paths just changed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d20e30d8c5d2e09856329b05489c59dcafb3a4c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/d20e30d8c5d2e09856329b05489c59dcafb3a4c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDRlMzhiMTg0Y2U2MzRlNDZkYTEwN2M3ZDAxNjI1ZWI4NTY0NGZjYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88","sha":"b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88"}],"sha":"4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/4e38b184ce634e46da107c7d01625eb85644fcc2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:19:12Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:19:12Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(backend): organize preview/start/poll API\n\nPOST /api/organize/preview dry-runs the shared plan builder (counts,\nexample destinations, rename example) with zero side effects. POST\n/api/organize (202) validates up front, refuses concurrent scans or\norganize runs, and queues the background job; GET endpoints poll run\nstate. Interrupted runs are marked failed on startup alongside scans.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c6b1600d58ff04ce62cdb0945de83b695be18cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/2c6b1600d58ff04ce62cdb0945de83b695be18cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGI3MWFiM2NlYjc1ZWU1ZDNjZDEyMDhhOGUwMDg2MDkyNDFiMWNlODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416","sha":"be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416"}],"sha":"b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/b71ab3ceb75ee5d3cd1208a8e008609241b1ce88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:16:13Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T23:16:13Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(backend): organize plan builder, executor and run model\n\nPhysical organize (Phase 7): move photos into a destination structure by\ndate (Year/Month, Undated fallback), camera, or keeping folder structure.\nbuild_plan is shared by preview and execute so they can never disagree;\nplanning is pure DB work (no per-file disk access) to stay sub-second at\n50k+ photos. Executor validates paths against approved roots, never\noverwrites (numeric suffixes), audits every move (op=organize), commits in\nchunks of 200, and updates photo.path/filename/root_id transactionally.\nSkip-duplicates moves only exact-group keepers; rename uses the capture\ntimestamp with same-second collision counters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b87060d80be4a9fcb20873b443f915e99720c0b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/b87060d80be4a9fcb20873b443f915e99720c0b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGJlMTFlNzUxNTJhZGRiOTA1MWViNTNmYmE5YmUwNmU1OTkzZWQ0MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714","sha":"e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714"}],"sha":"be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/be11e75152addb9051eb53fba9be06e5993ed416"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:01:00Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T01:01:00Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"perf: incremental duplicate groups + instant/debounced lightbox previews\n\nTwo performance problems that get much worse as the library grows toward 70k+:\n\nQuarantine/restore were re-deriving ALL duplicate groups (exact + LSH-similar +\nclustering + DB sync) over every active photo on every batch — a scan-weight,\nO(k^2)-per-band op run for a lightweight status change.\n- new app/dedupe/incremental.py: remove_photos_from_groups (prune membership,\n  delete groups left with <2 active members, repoint keeper) and\n  add_photos_to_groups (re-form exact groups for restored photos; similar\n  reconciled on next scan). O(affected), not O(library).\n- quarantine -> prune, restore -> re-add; delete needs nothing (already pruned\n  at quarantine). _groups_fully_covered pre-flight now queries only the groups\n  containing the target photos instead of walking the whole table.\n- Result (live, ~5.5k library): warm quarantine batch ~100 ms, was seconds\n  every time. rebuild_duplicate_groups stays for the post-scan path.\n\nFull-screen previews were generated on-demand (2048px decode+resize+encode) on a\nsingle-process server; fast navigation piled up abandoned generations.\n- PhotoLightbox now shows the already-cached 512px thumbnail instantly as a\n  placeholder and only requests the full preview after a ~150 ms debounce\n  (settling), so skimming fires zero preview generations; neighbors prefetched\n  on settle. Storage/work scale with what you view, not library size.\n- guarded scrollIntoView for jsdom.\n\nTests: incremental group correctness (shrink/dissolve/keeper/restore/delete);\nlightbox placeholder + debounce (thumbnail instant, preview deferred, no request\nwhile skimming).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e55321e3c3053ce91e4ab92564c3a90aaa597f42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/e55321e3c3053ce91e4ab92564c3a90aaa597f42"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGU1NGRhZWU5MTU5Njg1MGE4ZjBjNWY4NTVlM2VkMmJmZmU4MGM3MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/b1c0f8f17108331e29d04824ef55e79b9f2b5080","sha":"b1c0f8f17108331e29d04824ef55e79b9f2b5080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/b1c0f8f17108331e29d04824ef55e79b9f2b5080"}],"sha":"e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/e54daee91596850a8f0c5f855e3ed2bffe80c714"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/b1c0f8f17108331e29d04824ef55e79b9f2b5080/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:37:09Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T00:37:09Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat: photo deletion workflow — mark from Library, remove-both, cache fix\n\nAdds a full path for getting rid of unwanted photos and fixes a staleness bug\nfound while testing it.\n\nMark for deletion (Library):\n- marked_for_deletion flag on photos (migration 0010); POST /api/photos/mark\n  and /unmark; the removal work-list (/api/photos/marked) unions Library marks\n  and duplicate ''remove'' decisions; quarantining a photo clears its flag\n- mark toggle + badge on grid tiles and in the lightbox; marked photos stay\n  visible with a red ring; ''N marked · review'' link and a new ''Cleanup'' nav item\n\nRemove both (duplicate review):\n- decisions endpoint accepts force to mark every member of a group for removal;\n  ''Remove both'' button behind a strong-confirmation dialog; >2-photo groups\n  re-anchor on a surviving member\n\nFix: API reads served stale from the browser HTTP cache after a mutation (e.g.\nquarantining didn''t move photos into the In-Quarantine section until refresh) —\nthe client now uses cache: ''no-store'' for API JSON; images keep immutable caching.\n\nTests: photo marking, force remove-all, remove-both flows, quarantine-refreshes-\nthe-view reproduction; docs updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4af8aaeb8d04527076409ece75c67d6e462863d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/b4af8aaeb8d04527076409ece75c67d6e462863d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/b1c0f8f17108331e29d04824ef55e79b9f2b5080","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseit