url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/3e36f439df3445b17ff9d6a3277eadc0ee4fc58d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:03:31Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:03:31Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(stats): reset button for the lifetime deletion counter\n\nLets the user zero the Deleted / Space-saved tally and start fresh, without\ntouching the library.\n\n- POST /api/file-operations/reset clears audit rows for removed files\n  (photo_id IS NULL) — every delete record plus stale quarantine records — and\n  keeps rows for photos that still exist, so restore is unaffected\n- Home dashboard: ''Reset deletion counter'' button + confirmation dialog that\n  refreshes the cards on confirm\n- tests: reset zeroes the tally and clears removed-file history; records for a\n  currently-quarantined photo survive and restore still works; dashboard\n  confirm/cancel flow\n- docs: audit-log reset note in ARCHITECTURE.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"677eaaf72c6e9a9ee09bc7f62ac7e6b1e05de016","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/677eaaf72c6e9a9ee09bc7f62ac7e6b1e05de016"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/3e36f439df3445b17ff9d6a3277eadc0ee4fc58d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/3e36f439df3445b17ff9d6a3277eadc0ee4fc58d","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDNlMzZmNDM5ZGYzNDQ1YjE3ZmY5ZDZhMzI3N2VhZGMwZWU0ZmM1OGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/f52ad036e7ad8d37d359cb79786716a88ac974ed","sha":"f52ad036e7ad8d37d359cb79786716a88ac974ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/f52ad036e7ad8d37d359cb79786716a88ac974ed"}],"sha":"3e36f439df3445b17ff9d6a3277eadc0ee4fc58d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/3e36f439df3445b17ff9d6a3277eadc0ee4fc58d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/f52ad036e7ad8d37d359cb79786716a88ac974ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:29:00Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T20:29:00Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(stats): lifetime tally of photos deleted and disk space reclaimed\n\nA running, permanent total that survives rescans and rebuilding the library,\nso the dashboard always shows disk used, image count, deleted count, and space\nsaved.\n\n- file_operations records size_bytes at operation time (migration 0009), so\n  the tally survives after the photo row is deleted\n- /api/stats adds deleted_count and space_saved_bytes, computed from the\n  append-only audit log (count exact; byte total accrues from deletions\n  recorded after size tracking was added)\n- Home dashboard: DELETED and SPACE SAVED cards; stat grid reflows via auto-fit\n- tests: tally accrues and persists after photo rows are gone; running total\n  across multiple deletions; Home renders the cards (and dashes when offline)\n- docs: audit-log/tally note in ARCHITECTURE.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"398249931d3d74271d4d9fc668e7a5b5c0bd1e65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/398249931d3d74271d4d9fc668e7a5b5c0bd1e65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/f52ad036e7ad8d37d359cb79786716a88ac974ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/fo