antine page: marked-for-removal work-list with full details and a\n  confirmation dialog before quarantining; 409 group-wipe responses open a\n  separate strong-warning dialog that retries with force\n- quarantine browser: select, restore, or permanently delete (danger dialog\n  gated on typing DELETE); per-batch success/failure notice with item errors\n- append-only audit history table (op, path, timestamp)\n- ConfirmDialog component (themed modal per design tokens, optional\n  type-to-confirm)\n- link from Duplicates summary (''apply removals'')\n- 9 vitest tests: force flow, confirm=true only from the store, dialog gating\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"405560a21b65c01001e6ed84ef9380dd77e0883a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/405560a21b65c01001e6ed84ef9380dd77e0883a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/a0de919de7a0efe9fd5fefee90a4e8d29a211186","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_