mlink-resolving validation; every mutating op checks\n  fully-resolved containment (roots for sources, quarantine dir for targets)\n- FileManagementService (the only code that moves user files):\n  * quarantine: mirror absolute path under QUARANTINE_DIR (unique, reversible\n    slot), never overwrite, per-item results with batch id, refuses to wipe\n    every remaining active member of a duplicate group without force (409)\n  * restore: back to the recorded original path, no overwrite, revalidated\n  * permanent delete: confirm=true required, quarantined-only, target must\n    resolve inside the quarantine dir (tamper-proof), photo row dropped while\n    the audit row survives via SET NULL\n- file_operations append-only audit (migration 0008) + paginated endpoint\n- GET /api/duplicates/marked: active photos with remove decisions\n- duplicate groups rebuilt after successful quarantine/restore batches\n- 17 safety tests incl. path traversal, symlink escape, tampered audit row,\n  no-overwrite on restore, whole-group force gate, round-trip byte equality\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c581f5ee914bc8a821b3aebb4c63c50099f3dfd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/c581f5ee914bc8a821b3aebb4c63c50099f3dfd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/fd638d01a7ae7a3774846f5983a1ff07d1e88948","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organiz