/similar segmented filter, group\n  cards (member thumbs, kind + status badges, reclaimable bytes, review /\n  not-duplicates actions), empty state\n- DuplicateCompare per design: A/B preview panes with keeper/duplicate tags,\n  conic-gradient similarity dial, diff table with differing rows highlighted,\n  progress bar with pair counter and resolved/freed chip\n- adaptation noted in TASKS: single-click decide instead of the design''s\n  confirm step (decisions reversible; deletion is Phase 6)\n- 8 vitest review-flow tests; docs: LSH bit_count cast + rebuild notes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c2cdaa315ea975a4dad4243e3004c99c6b24053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/3c2cdaa315ea975a4dad4243e3004c99c6b24053"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/b2a14d2dfd1978c3c86a4233989b8d32541668ed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoap