STORED) with indexes; pigeonhole-complete candidate lookup\n  for Hamming distance <= 7\n- dedupe/similarity: banding + union-find over distinct hash values\n  (identical hashes collapse to one representative), configurable threshold\n  (SIMILAR_HAMMING_THRESHOLD, default 6), purely byte-identical components\n  excluded (exact groups own those), always labeled ''visually similar''\n- similar groups join the post-scan rebuild alongside exact groups; scored\n  per member by distance to the suggested keeper\n- GET /api/photos/{id}/similar: SQL-side band lookup verified with\n  bit_count((phash # x)::bit(64))\n- test image generator reworked: seeded low-frequency blocks (cross-seed\n  pHash distance ~30+, resize distance 0) replacing degenerate flat colors\n- 11 new tests: banding pigeonhole property, signed round-trip, union-find\n  transitivity, threshold edge, exact+similar coexistence, SQL sibling lookup\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"556a6ebd1aded54463b00b8f55fffa839e93cac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/556a6ebd1aded54463b00b8f55fffa839e93cac7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/553f492f76b44c4646e20696ab38d77a5b48edbd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"h