s\n- Scan screen phases: setup (sources from scan-roots API with add/remove,\n  selection count) → scanning (1s polling, progress bar, 4 stat tiles,\n  current path, cancel) → done (summary + open library / review duplicates);\n  resumes watching an already-running scan on mount\n- library shimmer loading skeleton per the States design\n- client: JSON error detail extraction, 204 handling, requestJson helper\n- 4 scan-store tests (progress polling, completion, failure, start rejection)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c391f98e01f804c5c7e455d7d74fb9083a3228bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/c391f98e01f804c5c7e455d7d74fb9083a3228bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/06a95fb7d4ce474eb0b7bf06542848a607e11715","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/06a95fb7d4ce474eb0b7bf06542848a607e11715","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDA