ox per design: dark overlay, position counter, prev/next with\n  end clamping, ←/→/Esc keyboard nav, centered metadata row (ISO from EXIF\n  detail, cached per photo), 64px filmstrip windowed ±12 around the current\n  index with auto-centering; paging forward tops up the photo runway\n- top bar on Library: group-by segmented (Folders/Date/Camera) and debounced\n  filename search with live total in the placeholder\n- library no-results state with clear-filters action\n- 5 new vitest tests (keyboard nav, clamping, filmstrip jump, close)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"314316ef875521905254af817dc6fa4fdfe753f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/314316ef875521905254af817dc6fa4fdfe753f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/dad20a95dbad885cbe4149cb09bbc176bb0f6a9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/dad20a95dbad885cbe4149cb09bbc176bb0f6a9c","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGRhZDIwYTk1ZGJhZDg4NWNiZTQxNDljYjA5YmJjMTc2YmIwZjZhOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d","sha":"3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d"}],"sha":"dad20a95dbad885cbe4149cb09bbc176bb0f6a9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/dad20a95dbad885cbe4149cb09bbc176bb0f6a9c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:57:14Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:57:14Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat: library core — folder tree, filtered photo listing, grid with infinite scroll\n\nbackend:\n- GET /api/folders: tree derived from photo paths, counts rolled up to\n  ancestors, depth/parent/has_children per node\n- GET /api/photos filters: folder (recursive), type (jpg/jpeg + tif/tiff +\n  heic/heif canonicalized), camera, filename search, six sort orders\n- GET /api/photos/facets: file-type and camera counts for the filter panel\n- 6 new API behavior tests\n\nfrontend:\n- library Pinia store: paged loading, append-on-scroll, filter/sort state,\n  folder expand/check state with double-count-safe selection totals\n- FolderTree per design (chevron/checkbox/marker/mono counts, indent\n  12+18*depth, selected-for-organizing card)\n- PhotoGrid: sections per group key, minmax(112px,1fr) tiles, lazy-loaded\n  thumbnails, content-visibility, IntersectionObserver infinite scroll\n- LibraryView: sidebar + subheader (sort select, tile-size slider) + states\n  (loading/empty/error with retry)\n- 9 new vitest tests (grouping, paging, filters, error path, totals)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b3f0e06495f2ffbc608851d843b798745c80d97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/1b3f0e06495f2ffbc608851d843b798745c80d97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDNlNWUwZGM4MDA3MzQ3MGIwZjI2OTEwODkzYTRmOWNlYmQ2Nzc1MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e","sha":"f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e"}],"sha":"3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/3e5e0dc80073470b0f26910893a4f9cebd67751d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:50:20Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:50:20Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(backend): thumbnails and perceptual hash in the scan pipeline\n\n- content-addressed webp cache keyed by sha256 (identical files share one\n  thumbnail; content change = new key); atomic writes; wipe-and-rebuild safe\n- 64-bit pHash (ImageHash) stored signed in photos.phash (migration 0005)\n- EXIF orientation applied before dimensions/pHash/thumbnail\n- one decode per file now feeds metadata + pHash + 512px grid thumbnail\n- GET /api/photos/{id}/thumbnail and /preview (2048px, generated on first\n  request): served by id only, immutable cache headers, 404 for unreadable\n- 9 behavior tests incl. hash-distance sanity and on-demand regeneration\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f5eba68df1ca3623dabc3251451540a760fe3af1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/f5eba68df1ca3623dabc3251451540a760fe3af1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGY0OTdhYzdjNjYzMWJkYzM2MDhlZDJmZTMzNzFjMDE1MGRiYTNmN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb","sha":"a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb"}],"sha":"f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/f497ac7c6631bdc3608ed2fe3371c0150dba3f7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:44:42Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:44:42Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(backend): incremental rescan, move detection, basic photos API\n\n- deleted files flagged status=missing, rows retained (never purged by scans)\n- moved/renamed files paired with same-sha256 additions after the walk; the\n  original Photo row keeps its id and is retargeted to the new path/root\n  (files_moved counter, migration 0004)\n- reappearing files revert to active\n- interrupted (pending/running) scans marked failed at app startup with a\n  clear re-run message; disabled in tests via RECOVER_SCANS_ON_STARTUP\n- GET /api/photos (pagination, captured_at ordering, status filter) and\n  GET /api/photos/{id} (sha256, exif, last_error) as the basic gallery data\n- 9 new behavior tests; live-verified: 13-file scan with corrupt file, then\n  move+delete rescan → 11 unchanged / 1 moved / 1 missing / 0 added\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c993c6599c9702b761669698e201426c3706fb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/1c993c6599c9702b761669698e201426c3706fb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKGE3YWFjZDUzODRmMTBiY2NlNDY1MDE1YmMxYjI2ODQ1Y2ExMWYyZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1","sha":"1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1"}],"sha":"a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/a7aacd5384f10bcce465015bc1b26845ca11f2fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:39:05Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:39:05Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(backend): scan pipeline — metadata, processing, job runner, progress API\n\n- Photo/Scan/ScanError models + migration 0003\n- metadata extraction (Pillow + pillow-heif): dimensions, EXIF capture date\n  (DateTimeOriginal with DateTime fallback), camera, JSON-safe EXIF dict\n- single-pass processing: one read feeds SHA-256 and decode; corrupt files\n  indexed with last_error instead of aborting\n- ThreadJobRunner (single worker, queue-shaped interface) + InlineJobRunner\n  for deterministic tests; CPU-bound work in an optional ProcessPoolExecutor\n- scan execution: per-root change detection via in-memory path index,\n  skip-unchanged (size+mtime), batched commits (progress + data atomic),\n  cancellation honored at batch boundaries\n- API: POST/GET /api/scans, GET /{id}, POST /{id}/cancel, paginated /errors;\n  409 when a scan is active, 422 for no roots / unknown root ids\n- 20 new behavior tests (metadata + full scan flows via API)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02401046cf785915e9939b7c4f6e1bf7bcaaa9f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/02401046cf785915e9939b7c4f6e1bf7bcaaa9f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1","node_id":"C_kwDOTNFs2doAKDFlOGJkYzQ5Nzc3ZWM3OGFlMGY3NGYzNTVlZDAzYjY1YmE0NWJjZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin/photoapp/commit/0b3b59fc9c3a750cbcc7e778514c4af76710b50a","sha":"0b3b59fc9c3a750cbcc7e778514c4af76710b50a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/0b3b59fc9c3a750cbcc7e778514c4af76710b50a"}],"sha":"1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/1e8bdc49777ec78ae0f74f355ed03b65ba45bcd1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/commits/0b3b59fc9c3a750cbcc7e778514c4af76710b50a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:31:10Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T01:31:10Z","email":"tseitzinger@gmail.com","name":"tseitzin"},"message":"feat(backend): streaming file-discovery walker\n\n- generator over os.scandir: constant memory at 100k+ files\n- symlinks never followed (files or dirs); (st_dev, st_ino) visited-set as\n  extra cycle/bind-mount guard; hidden entries skipped\n- per-entry OSErrors yielded as DiscoveryError without aborting the walk\n- supported extensions: jpg/jpeg/png/gif/webp/heic/heif/tif/tiff (RAW excluded)\n- 8 behavior tests incl. symlink cycle and unreadable directory\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2baaea220c14d378b81da91f9ba7bdb66893553b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/2baaea220c14d378b81da91f9ba7bdb66893553b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/0b3b59fc9c3a750cbcc7e778514c4af76710b50a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_adm