ec as CSS custom\n  properties on [data-theme]\n- Pinia theme store persisted to localStorage[''aperture-theme''], system\n  preference fallback\n- AppTopBar per design (logo, nav with active chip, sun/moon segmented, avatar)\n- routes: home/library/duplicates/organize/scan with placeholder views\n- typed API client (ApiError, status 0 = unreachable) + health endpoint module\n- offline banner with retry when the backend is unreachable\n- vitest: theme persistence/restore, client error mapping, health path\n- gates: 7 tests, eslint+oxlint, vue-tsc, vite build all green; CORS verified\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52cc4fd0feee9050ccfe4a229fb53b13b5a94bb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/trees/52cc4fd0feee9050ccfe4a229fb53b13b5a94bb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tseitzin/photoapp/git/commits/5b940b51bad547f4f7bcd7a436c86e4cef3af446","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30446692?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tseitzin","id":30446692,"login":"tseitzin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNDQ2Njky","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tseitzin","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.