hub.com/users/Omoshlawi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omoshlawi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omoshlawi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Omoshlawi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jpomaloh202122/emrs/commits/cced861f816fde0eae1ae5db034a5ddf3e999140/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T08:54:37Z","email":"98098891+Omoshlawi@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Laurent Ouma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-26T08:54:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix 2fa bugs (#1511)\n\n* Fix: 2FA Bypass by url change fixed;Not persisting session before 2FA\n\n* Enhance Two-Factor Authentication Flow with Header Management\n\n- Refactored the login component to include authentication headers for two-factor verification.\n- Updated the OTP countdown component to handle asynchronous resend actions.\n- Modified the two-factor authentication component to accept headers for OTP requests.\n- Adjusted the OTP resource to utilize headers for sending and verifying OTPs.\n- Improved the provider details fetching to include headers for enhanced security.\n\n* Enhance Login Tests with Two-Factor Authentication Mocks\n- Fix failing test on login component\n- Updated login tests to include mocks for two-factor authentication resources.\n- Improved session handling in tests to reflect authenticated state.\n- Added connectivity checks and adjusted API request expectations for login submissions.\n- Refactored test setup to ensure consistent mock states before each test case.\n\n* Remove mock phone number used for testing, now using provider phone number\n\n* rename name to patient name","tree":{"sha":"c40de46490aa16a6e758c9cd35dc423b9b75bbeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jpomaloh202122/emrs/git/trees/c40de46490aa16a6e758c9cd35dc423b9b75bbeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jpomaloh2