g phone numbers and national ID.\n\n* Implement Two-Factor Authentication Enhancements\n\n* Added support for dynamic OTP handling in the Two-Factor Authentication component.\n* Introduced a new OTP resource for managing OTP requests and verifications.\n* Enhanced the OTP countdown component with a resend button and state management.\n* Updated provider details resource to include patient name and added phone number sanitization.\n* Refactored the Two-Factor Authentication component to improve loading states and error handling.\n\n* Refactor Two-Factor Authentication Integration\n\n* Renamed the two-factor authentication component to `twoFactorAuthenticationModal` for clarity.\n* Updated routing to remove direct navigation to the Two-Factor Authentication component and instead utilize a modal.\n* Enhanced the Login component to trigger the Two-Factor Authentication modal upon successful login.\n* Adjusted the Two-Factor Authentication component to accept props for redirection and closing functionality.\n* Cleaned up styles for improved layout and responsiveness.","tree":{"sha":"00269beab924bf6f5959d7b2d7eee3d911dd2a93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jpomaloh202122/emrs/git/trees/00269beab924bf6f5959d7b2d7eee3d911dd2a93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jpomaloh202122/emrs/git/commits/de7380eff61817c2baa2d77eccdb35bc40180467","verification":{"payload":"tree 00269beab924bf6f5959d7b2d7eee3d911dd2a93\nparent 0c725b84a67566ad82f119d1ea042fe85d570032\nauthor Laurent Ouma <98098891+Omoshlawi@users.noreply.github.com> 1763443923 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763443923 +0300\n\nRefactor 2fa to use Modal and send OTP To Provider Telephone (#1496)\n\n* Enhance Two-Factor Authentication with Provider Details\n\n* Updated config schema to include attribute types for phone numbers and national ID.\n* Refactored Two-Factor Authentication component to utilize new provider details resource.\n* Added a new resource for fetching provider details, including phone numbers and national ID.\n\n* Implement Two-Factor Authentication Enhancements\n\n* Added support for dynamic OTP handling in the Two-Factor Authentication component.\n* Introduced a new OTP resource for managing OTP requests and verifications.\n* Enhanced the OTP countdown component with a resend button and state management.\n* Updated provider details resource to include patient name and added phone number sanitization.\n* Refactored the Two-Factor Authentication component to improve loading states and error handling.\n\n* Refactor Two-Factor Authentication Integration\n\n* Renamed the two-factor authentication component to `twoFactorAuthenticationModal` for clarity.\n* Updated routing to remove direct navigation to the Two-Factor Authentication component and instead utilize a modal.\n* Enhanced the Login component to trigger the Two-Factor Authentication modal upon successful login.\n* Adjusted the Two-Factor Authentication component to accept props for redirection and closing functionality.\n* Cleaned up styles for improved layout and responsiveness.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpHATTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATEEQALFC/kOL6nbjO/xLiF0OAcdy\n4853qUG8GCfdXyDgM7xmVqhU9R4S1oNhJG4TN4hXpoWwT6CD+f3somXTzMmjyrql\nDJ965EK+ueFW6ZfXHd4J+dzzdtTFnX62+ulkshJN4inA2QKyeevW19UkqlmUc/QS\nhE0TNk4irxVLFA9j925y0pIIty7ySgTpz1YkcHl1JyVsMxn4gEyRWoU1KBH8Y4N7\nXTIJURDng1ilpT+XLCo1y+zDwMe79/DH1Rf7aga+2l0qSuDxmLeTiiw0lSavmvF4\njv4xjVEmAmtEM71sJlHgiOAyBITtGCjVGyDRi+tDLmyxDxDwzHWrfq0ZGgyK04Gk\ns2UeGP6wFspAxjQszhMMgRLxZV78P9BDCK0kpXuFQY89fMQgodkkpGA1mJ4eWL45\nIs6Gk5aOnRuq5WkxjmE4P5J8vZ1b43PiIkIbX6Uufgqmje+X5+gs4Iw4xIaKpSNo\ns2lJ1KiQe5I1zw+BBKDMwaoOa6bp3nV/y+89uHPnUwIPAfcd1lgrdRg4q2EUATsv\nkP+4GgOh0fvWxhjtievaN44BibiFy9zAnr5Vc5ViiNery16E+HT3T/hpWqK1cXUe\nmZ4ofU/77a1HGLZmzScj4aeCj+pAMmM0yyZ1588v+6vbPN9k5sLpMGD1Pu5JPsHe\nVRN/PcEisFfVz1oCO03p\n=Ceyx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T09:22:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_