l","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kushaledx/openedx/commits/576774fa69a7dba6c5557dfade82a79033faccf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-06T21:52:04Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T19:40:04Z","email":"feanil@axim.org","name":"Feanil Patel"},"message":"fix: remove unused imports from django_comment_client/tests/test_utils.py\n\nTwo imports were genuinely unused:\n- `Mock, patch` from unittest.mock: the file uses `mock.Mock()` and\n  `mock.patch()` via the `mock` module imported on the line above,\n  never the bare names.\n- `CommentClientMaintenanceError`: imported but never referenced in\n  the file or re-exported to other modules.\n\nBoth were kept with noqa suppressions that are no longer needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70d024ad4445f3d86738a97a66de09121e39cd9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kushaledx/openedx/git/trees/70d024ad4445f3d86738a97a66de09121e39cd9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kushaledx/openedx/git/commits/576774fa69a7dba6c5557dfade82a79033faccf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/feanil","id":781561,"login":"feanil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTU2MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feanil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fe