ormick","id":3628148,"login":"kdmccormick","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MjgxNDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kdmccormick","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kushaledx/openedx/commits/4629823a058c6ed66119f34d37db4ce3d5f8fff5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T13:15:51Z","email":"kyle@axim.org","name":"Kyle McCormick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T13:15:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: Remove no-op ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST definition (#38245)\n\nThis line was likely added here with the intent of defining an\nedx-toggles-style FeatureToggle object. Instead, it just\ndeclares a local variable named ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST,\nwhereas the actual check occurs at either of:\n\n* settings.ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST  # new way\n* settings.FEATURES[''ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST'']  # old way\n\nThe toggle annotation has already been correctly updated\nto reflect that the toggle default is effectively False.","tree":{"sha":"019bbee0b777e8ee50df6fcf385416f8e807bd23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kushaledx/openedx/git/trees/019bbee0b777e8ee50df6fcf385416f8e807bd23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kushaledx/openedx/git/commits/4629823a058c6ed66119f34d37db4ce3d5f8fff5","verification":{"payload":"tree 019bbee0b777e8ee50df6fcf385416f8e807bd23\nparent d866d7ece8547adfb90260bf9f8b1a642d4ea851\nauthor Kyle McCormick <kyle@axim.org> 1774962951 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774962951 -0400\n\nrefactor: Remove no-op ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST definition (#38245)\n\nThis line was likely added here with the intent of defining an\nedx-toggles-style FeatureToggle object. Instead, it just\ndeclares a local variable named ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST,\nwhereas the actual check occurs at either of:\n\n* settings.ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST  # new way\n* settings.FEATURES[''ENABLE_FORUM_DAILY_DIGEST'']  # old way\n\nThe toggle annotation has already been correctly updated\nto reflect that the toggle default is effectively False.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpy8kHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxw0QAHKODZ9fGiqtVp1rifZ7QOGA\n9x2msl+4pTs+Dx9EnHt1ABFdnR+ZaTfamspDzbrbNKd4SYEILr8hSfESaK4QeAjh\nGHxVS/uBx6T//OUu01DPmUxB+KVS7Rx77BF/HL7N4EWcl6L10XUd6fuYcaruABpf\nHRZp7VfnHjVX49lQposywlBZrfH8/C2VxwcDO4GofVsFR2tXuevAme84T1FEoZga\n0xoGJTk+QbZKOme1hXvLoKLhoqbOu6K/zERGLB4Hbmr9ROWV9KevNe49M3cxuPvI\nmnvG3sCu38ZJW3Lha8FndEFpTChyOHWz/Hf/0reP8at9JmTWoH3I0Uo3SikyaOnv\nVeUF5K7JwNElDPIQSCj4HzUox2KxsyJDCPghDqTkFAqR32DW+PNx/APLwNdJOLBz\nKVvRhJ9MkHF2q++LEBBAfqQ48ZHjgWpNzixmrynUrW9imgYJBlb4hc1X+OVvKp1m\nzX2xuNRylvTfASFo9UK88C+43Ij9wG+wIhrtM8V2w3WZ7yy13+qsuXcN/g1Ze4fP\nrKzFcThqn1mrHuk08oN6jdpWUXAs3GqvRXhBmG2ekKj4GEJF+OyJl4/0pJ6kESvN\nSxjj9CZ5UOT4A6/nFB2Tsw6AiRPARjpzKGFK4wdfyIT8PKvoVBgfdiyeOAcu7o+E\nCX90WZu7CcrpHH0KQkIW\n=EyaL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-04T11:33:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events"