thub.com/Theus03","id":54069108,"login":"Theus03","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0MDY5MTA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theus03/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theus03/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theus03/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theus03/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theus03/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Theus03","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/41d8d060d647b132a06befab06b4febbe983b1c7","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDQxZDhkMDYwZDY0N2IxMzJhMDZiZWZhYjA2YjRmZWJiZTk4M2IxYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a","sha":"abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a"}],"sha":"41d8d060d647b132a06befab06b4febbe983b1c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/41d8d060d647b132a06befab06b4febbe983b1c7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:00:19Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T16:00:19Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"feat: Redesign admin panel visual style — dashboard/gamified look\n\nRestyle apps/admin (same content, funnels, and data — visual only):\nsidebar navigation, dashboard stat tiles (clients/systems/pending\nactivities/ideas counts), pill-style tabs with count badges, rounded\nwhite cards with shadows on a cooler admin-only background, and a\nsmall inline icon set (no new dependency).\n\nAlso surfaces CRM actions that already existed on the backend but had\nno UI: delete client, delete system, delete backlog item, delete idea,\nplus a quick status pill in the client modal header so switching\nfunnel stage doesn''t require opening the Informações tab.\n\nFixes along the way: Client.resolver''s `clients` query wasn''t\nincluding nested improvements/ideas needed by the new stats row,\nand useUpdateClientStatus only invalidated the clients list cache,\nnot the single-client cache the modal reads from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f3c81ab93d7cf6bdb2cd45603c407b03f3a4dc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/7f3c81ab93d7cf6bdb2cd45603c407b03f3a4dc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKGFiY2NmYjUyMjViZDY1ODU4NTE1NjU1NThlNzcwZDFkNmExYjc2NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2","sha":"0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2"}],"sha":"abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/abccfb5225bd6585851565558e770d1d6a1b766a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:46:10Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T20:46:10Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"feat: Redesign admin panel as a Kanban board with client modal\n\nReplace the list-based client/system pages with a Kanban board (6-stage\nfunnel: Prospecção → Negociação → Ativo → Manutenção → Pausado →\nEncerrado, one color per stage, drag-and-drop to move clients between\nstages). Clicking a card opens a modal instead of navigating — one tab\nper system, each with a Backlog (activities with estimated due dates)\nand an Ideias checklist for ongoing feature suggestions. Also adds an\noptional client logo (URL) shown on cards/modal, and widens the admin\nlayout to fill the screen instead of the public site''s 900px container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a09b39bdcd0057d81b2245e0e2eead36e604f74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/9a09b39bdcd0057d81b2245e0e2eead36e604f74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDBlOWU0MDJhNDI5NzVhMWM2ZGU1NWNiYjhmMmVkZjMxYzQwMzY2ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6","sha":"31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6"}],"sha":"0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/0e9e402a42975a1c6de55cbb8f2edf31c40366d2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:04:41Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:04:41Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"fix: Add SPA rewrite so apps/admin client-side routes don''t 404\n\napps/admin is a client-side-routed SPA (react-router-dom), but Vercel\nwas only serving the literal /index.html file — direct navigation to\n/login or any other route returned 404. Rewrite all non-filesystem\npaths to /index.html so the router can take over; /api/graphql keeps\nworking since Vercel matches filesystem functions before rewrites.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4addee5cb5b23e4b78765056f04f06dd83ecb9de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/4addee5cb5b23e4b78765056f04f06dd83ecb9de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDMxZjNiNzFmZTgwOWZjZDk0MWM2YzdmMTI3ZWUxYWQwNzJmZmMzYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e","sha":"a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e"}],"sha":"31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/31f3b71fe809fcd941c6c7f127ee1ad072ffc3a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:35:47Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T15:35:47Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"fix: Declare dist/** as cacheable output for the build task in Turborepo\n\nVercel''s Remote Caching for Turborepo was enabled without turbo.json\ndeclaring outputs for the build task, so a cache hit only replayed logs\nwithout restoring the compiled dist/ files. On apps/admin''s first\ndeploy this left @portfolio/api/dist missing when Vercel''s Node\nfunction builder tried to resolve it, crashing every /api/graphql\nrequest. Also pass through the CRM''s runtime env vars so Vercel''s\nbuild doesn''t warn about them being invisible to turbo.json.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"813431067b3d5bb4a2926c64eb8e713a1155b485","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/813431067b3d5bb4a2926c64eb8e713a1155b485"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKGEzMTk5YWIxODZkZGFlYjc1NmNkN2Y3OWM5Zjk0NDE4MTE3MGVlNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f","sha":"3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f"}],"sha":"a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/a3199ab186ddaeb756cd7f79c9f944181170ee4e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T16:52:07Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T16:52:07Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"feat: Add mini-CRM admin panel for client/system/improvement tracking\n\nNew apps/admin (private, login-protected) lets Matheus register clients,\ntrack status, and manage multiple systems/sites/apps per client plus\nplanned future improvements per system. Backend adds Prisma+Postgres,\nsingle-user JWT auth, and CRUD resolvers alongside the existing\nJSON-based public portfolio API (unchanged).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d3ab10791a1a679335e5fee6d57fa9259b139203","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/d3ab10791a1a679335e5fee6d57fa9259b139203"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDNkZDFhOWZmMGVkNDgyYTcwNTc1MDRiM2FmODExZTRhMmY5ZDJjMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e","sha":"62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e"}],"sha":"3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/3dd1a9ff0ed482a7057504b3af811e4a2f9d2c0f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T15:35:23Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T15:35:23Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"feat: Foram feitos ajustes dentro do projeto","tree":{"sha":"78c0d0bebcfb9ca01ce033a894c819728847e703","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/78c0d0bebcfb9ca01ce033a894c819728847e703"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDYyZTQ2MTUyNzc0MDcwNGY3NTU4NjQwYTM5MzRmODFkNDBlNTkwMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a","sha":"19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a"}],"sha":"62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/62e461527740704f7558640a3934f81d40e5902e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T22:04:40Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T22:04:40Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"Move Kria projects into timeline description, add Uspery projects\n\nThe Kria Tecnologia work (Metrô Bahia, Waze, RabbitMQ microservices)\nno longer gets standalone project cards — it''s now a richer\ndescription on the Kria timeline entry, expanded to mention the\nactual systems (Metrô Bahia, VLT Carioca, ViaQuatro, Metrô BH).\nThe Projects section now features the two Uspery projects instead\n(CriativamenteCare and the Finatech sales/CRM system), pulled from\nthe LinkedIn profile export.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9362abc82208d32bea908f429231bc4e2321c24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/f9362abc82208d32bea908f429231bc4e2321c24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDE5Y2E3NGYwZDk0YTY1ZmI5ODcwM2ZkYjk5NmNhNjMxMzI1ZGY1NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e","sha":"2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e"}],"sha":"19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/19ca74f0d94a65fb98703fdb996ca631325df55a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T18:11:54Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T18:11:54Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"Fix GraphQL API crash in production (Vercel)\n\n@portfolio/api pointed \"main\" at raw src/index.ts, which only works\nwhen consumed by TS-aware tooling (Vite, tsx) — the deployed Vercel\nfunction runs plain Node, which can''t execute .ts directly, causing\nevery /api/graphql request to fail with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND. Compile\nthe package to real JS via tsc and point main/types at dist/, and make\nthe Vercel build command run through Turborepo so @portfolio/api (and\nany other workspace deps) actually build before apps/web does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"86bf8dff4fd227018658258e03b875078dc44976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/86bf8dff4fd227018658258e03b875078dc44976"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDJhZmNiMzliN2RhMDEyZmVjOTk2NzVmMTM5OTg1NjAxMzIyOTU1OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98","sha":"9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98"}],"sha":"2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/2afcb39b7da012fec99675f1399856013229558e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-04T17:51:50Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-04T17:51:50Z","email":"matheus@kria.com.br","name":"Matheus Leite"},"message":"Migrate portfolio to a React/TypeScript/GraphQL monorepo\n\nRestructure the single-file portfolio-matheus.html into a real project:\nindependently versioned micro-frontend packages per section, a TypeGraphQL\nAPI serving content from versioned JSON, shared UI/types/graphql-client\npackages, Jest + Cypress test coverage, and CI/release workflows. All\noriginal content (projects, timeline, skills, certs, contact) is preserved\nin apps/api/src/content/*.json for easy future edits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f0d2c7082705016289211f7aa2bcb31b9207e54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/trees/7f0d2c7082705016289211f7aa2bcb31b9207e54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/git/commits/9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Theus03/MyWebSite/commit/9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98","node_id":"C_kwDOTNrA0NoAKDljNmM3MzQ0MWY0NDUxOGVlZjZmYmZmMTIzMDNiOGQ2MjA1YjdiOTg","parents":[],"sha":"9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits/9c6c73441f44518eef6fbff12303b8d6205b7b98"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/Theus03/MyWebSite/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=41d8d060d647b132a06befab06b4febbe983b1c7&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A01%3A03.726Z"}');
