hub.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-decision-studio/commits/0da5ddd147c05716b562015af36ffdb5a91f4ce1"}],"sha":"aa9cf0eb5538d096f5b361fb14a6b501af0b1503","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-decision-studio/commits/aa9cf0eb5538d096f5b361fb14a6b501af0b1503"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-decision-studio/commits/0da5ddd147c05716b562015af36ffdb5a91f4ce1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:54:50Z","email":"brett@pukekos.co.nz","name":"Brett Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T04:54:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(schema): host schemas at schema.workspec.io and align apiVersion group to workspec.io (#2)\n\n* chore(schema): host schemas at schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1\n\nMove the canonical JSON Schema URL from\nhttps://schemas.fieldstate.io/workspec/v1alpha1/ to\nhttps://schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1/ (subdomain + drop the now-redundant\n/workspec/ path segment).\n\n- SCHEMA_BASE_URL is the single source of truth; regenerated json-schema/\n  $id via `pnpm gen:schema` (drift test asserts equality).\n- Update every $schema directive header (examples, docs, fixtures) and the\n  URL assertions in the schema tests.\n- pages.yml now lays the site out under _site/v1alpha1/ and claims the\n  schema.workspec.io CNAME; interim Pages URL tail becomes /v1alpha1/.\n\nThe apiVersion group (workspec.fieldstate.io/v1alpha1) is a separate,\nnon-URL identifier and is intentionally left unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(pages): use relative links in the schema index\n\nAddresses the PR #2 review comment: the index.html links were root-absolute\n(/v1alpha1/...), which resolve correctly on the custom-domain root but break on\nthe interim project-pages URL (fieldstatenz.github.io/workspec-decision-studio/),\nwhere /v1alpha1/... points at the domain root and misses the repo path segment.\nRelative links (v1alpha1/...) resolve correctly in both hosting modes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018fNZdxNZR2pf6qpWWXEohy\n\n* chore(schema): align apiVersion group with workspec.io\n\nThe schema host moved to schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1, so the artifact\napiVersion group should shed the old fieldstate.io namespace too. The\nKubernetes-style discriminant is now `workspec.io/v1alpha1` (the org''s\nown DNS domain as the API group; the `schema.` subdomain is only where\nthe JSON Schema files are served).\n\nSweeps the single source of truth (packages/schema/src/constants.ts),\nits constants test, every artifact''s `apiVersion:` header (examples,\ndocs/decisions, invalid fixtures), the hardcoded literals in the test\nsuites, the prose in README/schema spec, and the regenerated\njson-schema/*.json (drift test green).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018fNZdxNZR2pf6qpWWXEohy\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb90cb9fbdbd016a1204c205b35e8bbea0eef1c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-decision-studio/git/trees/bb90cb9fbdbd016a1204c205b35e8bbea0eef1c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FieldstateNZ/workspec-decision-studio/git/commits/0da5ddd147c05716b562015af36ffdb5a91f4ce1","verification":{"payload":"tree bb90cb9fbdbd016a1204c205b35e8bbea0eef1c1\nparent 9cfe22f51c763665457720818bba9bc3ba8b0e33\nauthor Brett Smith <brett@pukekos.co.nz> 1783313690 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783313690 +1200\n\nchore(schema): host schemas at schema.workspec.io and align apiVersion group to workspec.io (#2)\n\n* chore(schema): host schemas at schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1\n\nMove the canonical JSON Schema URL from\nhttps://schemas.fieldstate.io/workspec/v1alpha1/ to\nhttps://schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1/ (subdomain + drop the now-redundant\n/workspec/ path segment).\n\n- SCHEMA_BASE_URL is the single source of truth; regenerated json-schema/\n  $id via `pnpm gen:schema` (drift test asserts equality).\n- Update every $schema directive header (examples, docs, fixtures) and the\n  URL assertions in the schema tests.\n- pages.yml now lays the site out under _site/v1alpha1/ and claims the\n  schema.workspec.io CNAME; interim Pages URL tail becomes /v1alpha1/.\n\nThe apiVersion group (workspec.fieldstate.io/v1alpha1) is a separate,\nnon-URL identifier and is intentionally left unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* ci(pages): use relative links in the schema index\n\nAddresses the PR #2 review comment: the index.html links were root-absolute\n(/v1alpha1/...), which resolve correctly on the custom-domain root but break on\nthe interim project-pages URL (fieldstatenz.github.io/workspec-decision-studio/),\nwhere /v1alpha1/... points at the domain root and misses the repo path segment.\nRelative links (v1alpha1/...) resolve correctly in both hosting modes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018fNZdxNZR2pf6qpWWXEohy\n\n* chore(schema): align apiVersion group with workspec.io\n\nThe schema host moved to schema.workspec.io/v1alpha1, so the artifact\napiVersion group should shed the old fieldstate.io namespace too. The\nKubernetes-style discriminant is now `workspec.io/v1alpha1` (the org''s\nown DNS domain as the API group; the `schema.` subdomain is only where\nthe JSON Schema files are served).\n\nSweeps the single source of truth (packages/schema/src/constants.ts),\nits constants test, every artifact''s `apiVersion:` header (examples,\ndocs/decisions, invalid fixtures), the hardcoded literals in the test\nsuites, the prose in README/schema spec, and the regenerated\njson-schema/*.json (drift test green).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018fNZdxNZR2pf6qpWWXEohy\