E, and\n  expo-supabase-starter / exposupabasestarter across app.json and\n  package.json, instead of carrying the paid edition''s name.\n- Drop internal dev tooling that shouldn''t ship in a template: .claude/,\n  .claudeignore and AGENTS.md, now gitignored along with CLAUDE.md and\n  context.md.\n\nVerified: install, jest 9/9, typecheck (both configs), web export.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb2dcc504bf5f22f0705a6afaaaa91a59cf05fe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guidondor/expo-supabase-starter/git/trees/fb2dcc504bf5f22f0705a6afaaaa91a59cf05fe3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Guidondor/expo-supabase-starter/git/commits/04d5d36ee3bd78af868c996dfd108d461f9a5b45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131815957?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Guidondor","id":131815957,"login":"Guidondor","node_id":"U_kgDOB9taFQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Guidondor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Guidondor/expo-supabase-starter/commit/04d5d36ee3bd78af868c996dfd108d461f9a5b45","node_id":"C_kwDOTN4GENoAKDA0ZDVkMzZlZTNiZDc4YWY4NjhjOTk2ZGZkMTA4ZDQ2MWY5YTViNDU","parents":[{"html_url