"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/5f745cb1da843ae24c7cffe54382b9a8f5c2be67","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDVmNzQ1Y2IxZGE4NDNhZTI0YzdjZmZlNTQzODJiOWE4ZjVjMmJlNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/65086607b0b4485d2d84ac67203f37628fe20e1d","sha":"65086607b0b4485d2d84ac67203f37628fe20e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/65086607b0b4485d2d84ac67203f37628fe20e1d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13","sha":"8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13"}],"sha":"5f745cb1da843ae24c7cffe54382b9a8f5c2be67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/5f745cb1da843ae24c7cffe54382b9a8f5c2be67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:34:48Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T04:34:48Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"节点列表按最新清单来：更新 manifest 到 retain 语义，清掉 arcthumb 出局后的三处接缝与两处悬空登记\n\n用户 2026-10-07 指示「节点列表按照最新的来」。toml 两边逐行 diff 为空；manifest 的语义差只有一处 —— kisaki 从 hold-unmigrated 变 retain-rewrite（与「kisaki 就是原来的 czkawka 节点，恢复就行」同源）。schemaVersion 仍是 2，51 条记录、id 集合两边完全一致。\n\n按最新线删掉 arcthumb 出局残留：packages/arcthumb-native、native/arcthumb-core、native/arcthumb-node、packages/image-native；并摘掉清单尺点名的三处接缝（build-native-assets.ts 的 arcthumb 条目与其 info 分支、smoke-embedded.mjs 的 arcthumb 条目）。\n\n删包留下两处会静默坏掉下游的登记，一并修：package.json 的 dependencies 仍引已不存在的 @xiranite/arcthumb-native（移除后重跑 install rc=0，锁文件随构建器一起重写，不按 hunk 切）；native/Cargo.toml 的 members 仍列 arcthumb-core/arcthumb-node —— 这条更硬，目录没了 cargo 直接坏，改成只剩 czkawka-core/czkawka-node，用 cargo metadata rc=0 证明图是通的。\n\n判据：audit:target-node-manifest 由 2 FAIL 降到 1 FAIL（剩下的必须条目：kisaki 定为 retain 但 packages/nodes/kisaki 还没有目录，这正是下一步）；install/generate(27 节点)/build:packages 全 rc=0；cargo metadata rc=0；尺 tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json 仍 357，对基线新增 0、消失 41。清单其余是 WARN（removed 节点的非阻塞提及），不挡路。","tree":{"sha":"ac51035dbadbd3014a6faae456cbd25a187d8028","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/ac51035dbadbd3014a6faae456cbd25a187d8028"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDhhODRlYjJhMGFhYzA2ZWNhYzUwN2E3MmMzOWUyNmJlNDRjMzJkMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da","sha":"f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da"}],"sha":"8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/8a84eb2a0aac06ecac507a72c39e26be44c32d13"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:27:15Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T18:27:15Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"口径(b) 第一步：27 个 node 包逐包嫁接到新版 TS 面（每包自带构建门，全绿）\n\nGUI 依赖 @xiranite/node-<id>/{core,definition,help,interaction} 这些基线没有的子路径，而上一轮\"只搬纯数据叶子文件\"把包搬成了半新半旧（新 core.ts 引 ./paths.js 却没带它），所以改成逐包做门。\n\n每包的做法：src 下所有非测试的 .ts/.tsx 取新版，但两处例外 —— (1) 引 node:/bun:/@xiranite/host-capabilities/@xiranite/quickjs 的文件（platform.ts 那一类）留基线，(2) 终端面 cli.ts/Tui.tsx 留基线（本轮目标是 GUI）；package.json 的 exports 只增缺的键、基线已有键一字不改，且只有当解析到的源文件真存在才增键。增键那处我修了自己的 bug：b.setdefault(''exports'',{}) or {} 在基线包没有 exports 字段时会返回一个新的空字典，键全写进垃圾里，上一轮那 232 条 Cannot find module 其实是这个 bug 加 dist 没造出来。\n\n门与结果：每包立刻跑 bun run --cwd packages/nodes/<id> build，不过就把该包源文件与新增 exports 键整批退回基线并重新编译确认。PASS 27（bandia…trename），FAIL 2（clipm、linedup）已整包退回。clipm 本来就在 xiranite.build.toml 的 disabled 里。\n\n判据：generate:node-registries rc=0（27 节点，跳过 clipm/lata）、build:packages:incremental rc=0（这条战役里第一次全量 rc=0）、尺 tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json 与基线错误集按文本求差集 = 总数 357、新增 0、消失 41。\n\n未做：src/ 的 GUI 层还没叠（第三步的整层搬运当时整体回滚了），下一步在这个绿色 node 面之上叠加再量；kisaki 仍不在树里。","tree":{"sha":"106088b87718661c473649de54e3353c1d4a2f4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/106088b87718661c473649de54e3353c1d4a2f4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKGYxZGMwMmEyNzYwNjM5MGRmZTAwNjVjMDAwODRlMjZmOWYwOGM2ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/aa3808eed3c89621147faaaa0707ea9964035aa2","sha":"aa3808eed3c89621147faaaa0707ea9964035aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/aa3808eed3c89621147faaaa0707ea9964035aa2"}],"sha":"f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/f1dc02a27606390dfe0065c00084e26f9f08c6da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/65086607b0b4485d2d84ac67203f37628fe20e1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:14:16Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:15:00Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"把主线内容回退到 abbeaf95（Wails v3 + Bun 启动链路仍在役）的状态，树等于 wails-bun-restore\n\n纯内容回退：树整体覆盖成从 abbeaf95 起步、带三层前端搬运的那条分支；历史一笔没丢（上一笔 merge -s ours 把 wails-bun-restore 认作已合并，回退前 2746 笔全部仍可达、不可达旧提交 0）。\n\n回退后主线里有什么（逐个 cat-file 实测，不写推测）：Wails v3 alpha.98 + Bun 子进程后端的启动链路完整（Go 文件 101 个，bun_runtime.go / local_backend.go / service.go / desktop/node-runner-cli.ts 都在）；同时基线本身是混合态——crates/ 有 143 个文件、含 xiranite-desktop、xiranite-api、xiranite-quickjs-executor、xiranite-core、nodes/ 等 12 个顶层 crate，还有一处 tauri.conf.json。Rust 那半在删 Wails 之前就已动工，所以这笔回退不等于回到「干净的旧架构」。\n\n基线之后才加、因此本树里确实没有的：crates/quickjs-realm、crates/quickjs-host-protocol（ADR-0078 的那次拆分）、crates/xiranite-loopback-host、packages/host-capabilities、src/backend/adapters/tauri.ts。\n\n保留的前端（回退分支三笔已验提交）：src/styles、src/lib/design-theme（md3/mondrian/wuling 三份配方）、packages/ui、packages/contract，依赖 @material/material-color-utilities@0.4.0。判据 bunx tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json 与基线错误集按错误文本求差集：总数 358、新增 0、消失 40；install / generate:node-registries / build:packages 全 rc=0。\n\n修掉基线自身一处不可构建：xiranite.build.toml 的 disabled 列了当时并不存在的 kisaki，generate:node-registries 因此在 resolveNodeFilter 抛 Unknown node id（出处：主仓现状与后来 912a40a4）。\n\n明确没带回来的：src/backend/** 留基线的 wails.ts 传输；src/main.tsx 与 src/components/modules/hostApi.ts 的 tauri 那半按 hunk 剥掉；整层 src/ 其余 UI（桶2 两轮都因 node 包 exports 与 core 的类型耦合未过判据）；kisaki 节点在 wip-kisaki-restore@0409fcfb（15 条新红、三处阻塞记在那笔里）。\n\n本笔只改提交说明：上一版写「crates/ 与 Tauri、QuickJS 执行器整层不在树里」是错的，树内容一字未动（覆盖后校验 master 树 == wails-bun-restore 树 bb8df8a9，差异文件数 0）。","tree":{"sha":"bb8df8a9618692e076d291b2d1b1a05d0c9f3e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/bb8df8a9618692e076d291b2d1b1a05d0c9f3e27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/65086607b0b4485d2d84ac67203f37628fe20e1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/65086607b0b4485d2d84ac67203f37628fe20e1d","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDY1MDg2NjA3YjBiNDQ4NWQyZDg0YWM2NzIwM2YzNzYyOGZlMjB