wing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/e3d0db590c47eea9888da55c72bb6ffe9b7b49b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:26:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:26:17Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"单独拆出 contract：纯类型与纯函数层搬进 Wails+Bun 基线（尺上新增 0、消掉 40 条既存红）\n\n从 wip-kisaki-restore 里把这一层单独摘出来验，因为它不引 node:* 也不引宿主 API，是 UI 读的数据契约。基线的 packages/contract/src 只有 1 个文件，新版有 8 个；泛型约束放宽（NodeStateCapability/NodePreset 的 TData extends Record<string, unknown> 那一族）正是基线 40 条 TS2344 的来源，所以搬完是净改善而非新增风险。exports 不用动：基线只有 \".\"，增量比对下来待补键为 0。\n\n判据（本机 macOS arm64，串行）：尺 = bunx tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json，与基线 base.msgs 按错误文本求差集 —— 总数 358、新增 0、消失 40（消失的全是 BitvCardState/ClassfCardState 这类不满足 Record<string, unknown> 约束的既存红）。管路回归 generate:node-registries rc=0（27 节点，跳过 clipm/lata）、build:packages:incremental rc=0。\n\n两处必须说明的证据缺口，不许读成全绿：\n1. 这个包的 test 脚本就是 npm run build（tsc），零断言，所以那个 rc=0 不是测试证据。\n2. 它的 4 个 test 文件在本分支上没有任何 runner 能收：根 vitest 的 include 只有 src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}，传 packages/contract 过滤成 No test files found；改 --root packages/contract 跑，4 个文件全在加载期死于 i18next 的 Connector.prepareLoading（Tests: no tests）。因此 contract 的运行时行为在本分支是 compile-verified only，这条缺口早于本次搬运存在，不在本笔修复。\n\n顺带清掉一个自己造的坑：切回本分支后 packages/nodes/kisaki 只剩 gitignored 的 dist 残留 130 个文件，生成器按目录枚举却读不到 package.json，报 ENOENT 让 generate rc=1 —— 与本步无关，删掉残留后归零。","tree":{"sha":"83f4e58c8b985b66283740c6f25c5f7302370142","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/83f4e58c8b985b66283740c6f25c5f7302370142"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/e3d0db590c47eea9888da55c72bb6ffe9b7b49b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/e3d0db590c47eea9888da55c72bb6ffe9b7b49b2","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKGUzZDBkYjU5MGM0N2VlYTk4ODhkYTU1YzcyYmI2ZmZlOWI3YjQ5YjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/7452da699fa34c4d168c3991ef045caafc398343","sha":"7452da699fa34c4d168c3991ef045caafc398343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/7452da699fa34c4d168c3991ef045caafc398343"}],"sha":"e3d0db590c47eea9888da55c72bb6ffe9b7b49b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/e3d0db590c47eea9888da55c72bb6ffe9b7b49b2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/7452da699fa34c4d168c3991ef045caafc398343/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:10:03Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:10:03Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"回退战役·桶1：把视觉与主题层搬回 Wails+Bun 基线（类型尺与基线等集）\n\n基线用 abbeaf95（= 82d2be46^，删掉 Wails+Go+Bun 启动链路那笔的父提交），落点在本 worktree 的 wails-bun-restore 分支；主工作区那 918 条别的 lane 的在飞改动一条没碰。\n\n先修基线自身的一处不可构建：xiranite.build.toml:9 的 disabled 列了 kisaki，而该提交上没有 packages/nodes/kisaki（它是后来 912a40a4 才找回来的），generate:node-registries 因此在 resolveNodeFilter 直接抛 Unknown node id。改成 [\"clipm\",\"lata\"] —— 出处是主仓现状与后来收敛的那笔，不是我编的值；clipm 与 lata 两个目录都在，只有 kisaki 是空指。修后生成 27 个节点、跳过 2 个，rc=0。\n\n搬入：src/styles（30）+ src/lib/design-theme（25，含 md3/mondrian/wuling 三份配方）+ packages/ui（5）。bun.lock 按整份重生成提交，不按 hunk 切；它顺带纠正了基线上那几个已不存在节点包的残留条目。\n\n验证（本机 macOS arm64，串行）：build:packages:incremental rc=0；尺是 tsgo --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json。基线 398 条既存红，搬完仍 398 条，按错误文本求差集新增 0、消失 0。中途一度净新增 9 条，两类都是依赖而非逻辑：@material/material-color-utilities 缺（MD3 那批新引的包，按主仓锁到 0.4.0）与 packages/ui/src/tokens 缺（桶间依赖边，故 packages/ui 必须与本桶同批）——补后归零。\n\n后续桶按同一判据走：UI 一律保留，混合提交拆开只搬 UI 那半（已算出 545 笔里纯 UI 74、纯架构 221、混合 33），node/宿主侧与 28 个 platform.ts 保持基线版本。","tree":{"sha":"d613da7d84444e2d514ab70b6e72d51d68759c93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/d613da7d84444e2d514ab70b6e72d51d68759c93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/7452da699fa34c4d168c3991ef045caafc398343","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/7452da699fa34c4d168c3991ef045caafc3