rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/0cc2d7f261a95e01b48c423491fdecb2ac80b02b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:18:45Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:18:45Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(test): backend/services/repository 的 test 脚本在没开 globstar 的 shell 里一个测试都不收\n\n脚本写的是未加引号的 src/**/*.test.ts，而三个包的测试文件全在 src 的第一层；bash/sh 默认不开 globstar，这条展开成 src/*/*.test.ts（零命中）于是原样交给 vitest 当字符串过滤器，结果是 No test files found、rc=1——门禁看着红过、也看着绿过（0 个文件时某些 shell 会展开成功），但从来没跑过任何一个用例。改成房内写法 vitest run src --maxWorkers=1（repository 保留 && bun run build）。\n\n本机实测三对：旧写法 services/backend/repository 都打印 No test files found；新写法 services 6 个文件全绿、repository rc=0（含 build）、backend 收到 12 个文件，10 passed / 1 skipped / 1 failed。那条 failed 是 src/nodeRunner.integration.test.ts 的 cleanf 往返（断言 totalRemoved 2、undoPersistent true，实际 success false），属被这行脚本遮蔽的真实状态，不是本次改动引入的回归——改前它连跑都没跑。backend 因此仍返回 rc=1，但原因从「没测到」换成了「测到了」；根因待查（cleanf 的 mac 删除/撤销路径）。","tree":{"sha":"03718966367332d26f69ce98f3473c874e11811b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/03718966367332d26f69ce98f3473c874e11811b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/0cc2d7f261a95e01b48c423491fdecb2ac80b02b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.c