/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/75b46df116abc2fd20e5c152cfb21bd64e79932f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:18:35Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T13:18:35Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"docs(findz-roadmap): 端到端含落点投递的实测结论 + 两处只有跑全链路才现形的问题\n\n- 全链路跑通：真实仓内 Go 内核 + 宿主解析落点，500 归档 / 621-758 次 run 内往返 / 0 残留，索引确实落在宿主指定目录\n- 抓到 PathContext::data_dir() 不认 XIRANITE_DATA_DIR（只有 config_path 认）⇒ 可移植装机会「配置搬走、索引没搬」；已加 host_data_root 并配正控测，修复后有运行期证据\n- 抓到第二次「旧产物骗人」：staged/findz 早于 indexDirEnv，首轮看似 env 失效；规则：改语义前先重编被验二进制\n- 探针在平台缓存留下的三个索引文件按 mtime 核对后清掉","tree":{"sha":"79fcdf92be2b0dbfdacfcabff11bb0355b9febe4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/79fcdf92be2b0dbfdacfcabff11bb0355b9febe4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/75b46df116abc2fd20e5c152cfb21bd64e79932f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u