"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/d37a7c2cf1c55f9c3a9da85fa6c74af4da08fb9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:58:16Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:58:16Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(clipm): 设备词表补 mps，未配置时的默认改成跟随本机能力\n\nmac 上 clipm 的 worker 原本硬默认 cuda：settings 里 DevicePreference(env, CUDA)、mcp-client 里 XIRANITE_CLIPM_DEVICE 缺省注入 cuda，于是一台 Apple Silicon 机器要么在 encoder 装载时抛 CUDA unavailable，要么把不可用的设备报成已选中。现在词表由 Pydantic 一份定义（cuda|mps|cpu）经 contracts:generate 出 schema 与 TS 类型，Python 侧新增 device_support 只做一件事——问本机有什么（torch 实测 2.4.0，mps True、cuda False），没配置就按 discrete GPU、Apple MPS、CPU 取第一个；空字符串不再被当成非法值，但拼错的值仍旧直接失败不静默换设备。EnvironmentStatus 加可选 mps_available，service 回读、migration 与 TS 侧 configure 校验都有对应的拒绝分支（旧 worker 不带该字段按未知处理即拒绝），cli env status 那行同时披露 CUDA 与 MPS。顺带修掉 DEFAULT_RUNTIME_ROOT 写死 D 盘：mac/Linux 上它不是绝对路径，未注入 runtime root 时 from_environment 直接抛错。","tree":{"sha":"ef13382223db683746240ff0e0d0439c4022df5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/ef13382223db683746240ff0e0d0439c4022df5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/d37a7c2cf1c55f9c3a9da85fa6c74af4da08fb9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","rec