nite/commit/38ca3ee15f7c665f8a3a863345533684bfffde9f","sha":"38ca3ee15f7c665f8a3a863345533684bfffde9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/38ca3ee15f7c665f8a3a863345533684bfffde9f"}],"sha":"ca6446678e53e02f3c5fa4264fab2dfe5d590a6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/ca6446678e53e02f3c5fa4264fab2dfe5d590a6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/38ca3ee15f7c665f8a3a863345533684bfffde9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:53:24Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:53:24Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(advanced-theme): 旧 localStorage 快照没有 mondrian 字段时，切到风格派会当场崩——把解析器接进 hydrate 与唯一写入点\n\n实机崩溃是 DesignThemeSection 读 config.mondrian.accent 报 undefined is not an object。根因不是那条 JSX：designTheme 是嵌套配置，而它有两个「半成品」入口，两个都绕过了 normalizeDesignThemeConfig —— ① zustand persist 从 localStorage hydrate 时走的是浅合并，磁盘上那份是加 mondrian 字段之前写的；② 设置页切配方用 {...config, id} 展开，会把当前缺字的形状原样带走。sanitizeUiPreferences 只覆盖「宿主 → store」那一路，localStorage 这一路没人管。\n\n修法是两处边界各过一次同一个解析器：persist 的 merge 选项接上导出并单测的 mergePersistedWorkspaceUi（顺带把合并点从匿名闭包里拿出来，否则测不到接线）；setDesignTheme 作为唯一写入点自己也归一化。没有给 JSX 加可选链——那只会把「store 里有半成品」这件事从崩溃降级成静默的空面板。\n\n三条新测试都跑过双向：去掉 merge 里的归一化 → hydrate 那条与 spread 那条一起红（expected undefined to deeply equal {accent, lineWeight}）；把 merge 选项整行摘掉 → 「接线」那条红，报的正是「persist 的 merge 没有接线」。接线那条不是直接调函数，而是把旧形状写进 localStorage、vi.resetModules() 后重新 import store 再读 designTheme，所以匿名合并函数没被调用也会被发现。夹具自带反空对照（先断言磁盘那份的 designTheme 键集合里没有 mondrian）。\n\n验证（串行）：store 单测 9/9（persistedUiPreferences）、src/store 全目录 35/36（唯一红是既存 workspaceBackendLifecycle 的内联 i18n 夹具，与本轮无关，本轮改动前后同名同点）、DesignThemeSection.browser 6/6；tsc -p tsconfig.app.json 在本轮文件上 0 错（workspaceStore 那条 alphabetIndex/laneWorkspacePreferences 缺初值是别的 lane 的既存债）；并 curl 在跑的 vite 确认 127.0.0.1:1420 上 serve 出来的 workspaceStore 模块里 merge: mergePersistedWorkspaceUi 真的在（用户侧只需重载页面，hydrate 会把旧快照补全）。","tree":{"sha":"a5f61a77fa25c0129792d89f0121acda6025e2a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/a5f61a77fa25c0129792d89f0121acda6025e2a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/38ca3ee15f7c665f8a3a863345533684bfffde9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_ev