thub.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/a47ac83c2b5c083d7cb582004f685b2721fc3c26/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:40:05Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:40:05Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"docs(findz-roadmap): 拆解落地后复验——80 全绿、clippy 唯一命中在别人新加的文件\n\n- §3.4b/3.4c 记 P1 实现与真实 Go 内核端到端（500 归档 271 ms、702-857 次往返、0 残留）\n- 记 §6.4/§6.6 已对齐：sidecar 作用域定为一次 run；databasePath 前提用真实内核验穿（传则核心照收＝洞真存在，不传则自派生并回读），真正控制点是持有者把宿主数据根映射进子进程 env（核心只认 LOCALAPPDATA）\n- 记一次 flake 的归属二分（红在 proc_operations 的 2 s 固定轮询预算，没动他们的文件）与新增的进程组组长守卫测\n- 代码仍未提交：接线目标 machine.rs/host_services.rs 是并发拆解刚重建的新文件，属他们未提交的成果","tree":{"sha":"e529f402866fd0b5c5980c2b4d27c12db6b0b2a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/e529f402866fd0b5c5980c2b4d27c12db6b0b2a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/a47ac83c2b5c083d7cb582004f685b2721fc3c26","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlo