.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(data-table): 算子词表统一到 niko 那一份实现，顺带修好「Is empty」过滤器\n\n- 上一轮我撤回改名是因为怕改到 bandia / NodeRunHistoryView 的过滤器语义。这轮把证据查完了，结论相反：全仓只有 niko-table 注册 filterFns（src/components/niko-table/core/data-table-root.tsx:645），老 src/config/data-table.ts 里的 isEmpty / isNotEmpty 从来没有实现方；而我修好 parsers.ts 的真断链之后，URL 解析层的 zod 枚举源就是 niko 的 config，老名字连解析都过不去。所以那是个坏掉的开关，不是可用的语义。\n- 于是把老 config 的 12 处算子值改成 empty / not.empty，并让 getValidFilters 跟上（src/lib/data-table.ts:121-122 那两个比较此前恒为假：老 UI 的「为空」筛选会被当成未填完整而丢掉）。注释同步说明算子名与实现同源。\n- 另一份 isEmpty/isNotEmpty 没动：packages/shared 的规则引擎（rules-engine.ts:58-59 真的 addOperator 实现了它们，RuleTreeEditor 与 rules.operators.* 文案是那一套词表），与表格筛选无关。\n- 真尺 132，data-table/parsers/types 这一片错误清零；对上一稳定态逐条比对新增 0。\n- 行为核对：src/hooks + src/nodes/bandia 跑同一把测，改动前后都是 1 红 12 绿，那条 bandia「uses the shared configuration-management workflow」在退回 HEAD 复跑时同样红（基线红，已用镜像路径备份并 cmp 确认恢复一致）；vite build rc=0。","tree":{"sha":"6d40328ae2d37825f53b3b6156439a001fb6fbd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/6d40328ae2d37825f53b3b6156439a001fb6fbd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/b4d04c1908685aef5f5886b8f6cf53c802736032","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.git