"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/05f28c470b6bc6bccccd231499a95403da4b3a76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:22:40Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:22:40Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(types): 修掉 src/lib/parsers.ts 指向已删模块的真断链，并去掉重复的 ColumnMeta 声明\n\n- parsers.ts 从 \"@/components/data-table/data-table\" 要 dataTableConfig / ExtendedColumnFilter / ExtendedColumnSort，而这三者早在七月的 niko-table 替换里搬走了（现分别在 niko-table/config/data-table.ts 与 niko-table/types）。老路径只剩一个不导出它们的模块 ⇒ 这不是风格问题：浏览器 ESM 在链接期就报「does not provide an export named」，任何 use-data-table → parsers 的视图都会当场炸。重接后 TS2305 x3 清零。\n- src/types/data-table.ts 的 module augmentation 与 niko-table/types 的那份重复声明 options/icon（类型还不一样）⇒ TS2717 x2。把这两个字段交还给 niko 那份，单一真源。\n- 一个我试了但撤回的修法，证据留在提交里：老 src/config/data-table.ts 的算子叫 isEmpty/isNotEmpty，niko-table 的叫 empty/not.empty。统一到 niko 那一份能让 TS2367 x2（lib/data-table.ts:121-122 那两个永假的比较，也就是老 UI 的「Is empty」在 getValidFilters 里从来不算有效）一起消失，实测 138 到 132、错误集新增 0；但 bandia/ResultPanels 与 NodeRunHistoryView 仍在用老 config 那条链，改名会改它们的过滤器语义，所以我撤回改名，把「谁拥有这张表的算子词表」交回来定。\n- 顺带说明当前状态：parsers.ts 现在用 niko 的 dataTableConfig 做 zod 枚举来源，因此老 UI 若还往 URL 里写 isEmpty，会被 parser 判无效丢弃（这比原来的链接期崩溃好，但不是最终形态）。","tree":{"sha":"a42c1d620259b79399e0d4bcd830e47050d236a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/a42c1d620259b79399e0d4bcd830e47050d236a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/05f28c470b6bc6bccccd231499a95403da4b3a76","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/05f28c470b6bc6bccccd231499a95403da4b3a76","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDA1ZjI4YzQ3MGI2YmM2YmNjY2NkMjMxNDk5YTk1NDAzZGE0YjNhNzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/9c96f4e617a614858a73d12a65d0680c715ec510","sha":"9c96f4e617a61485