"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/5ebc6761b99ed3c1ab99764d17a860a96b88d3ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:17:37Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(clipm): 用必填的 workId 做判别并写出归一化形状，workspace-state 9 条清零\n\n- 那簇错误全在 ScoreLibraryResult | WorkScoreResult 的收窄上：两个形状里的 works/failures 都是可选字段，所以 \"works\" in value 不能把联合切开，而 asScoreLibraryResult 本来就在做「把可选数组归一化成真数组」这件事，却把结果类型写回带可选字段的 ScoreLibraryResult —— 类型没表达出它自己的保证，于是 mergeScoreResult 里 4 条 TS18048。改成新增 NormalizedScoreLibraryResult（Omit 掉这两个可选字段再声明为必选），并改用 WorkScoreResult 上必填的 workId 做判别，收窄就成立了（TS2322/TS2339/TS2345 各归位）。\n- 两处行为口径如实写明：1) clipmResultPatch 的 switch 补尾部 return {}，未列出的 action 从「返回 undefined」变成「空 patch」，调用方少一个隐式判空；2) 原来走 \"works\" in value 分支时，一个 works 字段整个缺席的聚合结果会掉进单行 work 分支被伪造成一条作品，现在按 workId 判别会正确留在聚合分支。这是判别方式改变带来的顺带纠正，不是我另加的功能。\n- 真尺 147 到 138，逐条比对新增 0（比对里出现的 2 条 design-theme 是另一会话正在 D+?? 搬那个目录，行号随他们的文件漂移）。\n- 验证：src/nodes/clipm/workspace-state.test.ts 2 绿；真 Chromium 的 clipm entry+Component 浏览器测 15 条全绿（scoreWorks/mergeScoreResult 都在 GUI 路径上被跑到）。","tree":{"sha":"fb042c19cbedb8ac0ed5ae41c414002b058b3749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/fb042c19cbedb8ac0ed5ae41c414002b058b3749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/5ebc6761b99ed3c1ab99764d17a860a96b88d3ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/5ebc6761b99ed3c1ab99764d17a860a96b88d3ae","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDVlYmM2NzYxYjk5ZWQzYzFhYjk5NzY0ZDE3YTg2MGE5NmI4OGQzYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf","sha":"7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf"}],"sha":"5ebc6761b99ed3c1ab99764d17a860a96b88d3ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/5ebc6761b99ed3c1ab99764d17a860a96b88d3ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:16:28Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"test(cli-runtime): 共享的内存 CLI host 默认不再继承操作者自己的 xiranite.config.toml——换台机器就红的那类问题根在helper层，不在各节点测试里\n\n现象是实测到的：加载器在用户的 xiranite.config.toml 里有 [nodes.<id>] 覆盖时，会往 stderr 打一行「配置: 从 … 加载 — 覆盖字段: …」。packages/nodes/trename 的 CLI 测断言 stderr 必须为空（toBe(\"\")），于是在我这台 mac 上红、在没有那个块的机器上绿（trename 自己那份已按 bitv/enginev 的写法单独指到 artifacts/test-runs 下不存在的文件）。这次处理共用出口：packages/cli-runtime/src/testing.ts 的 createMemoryCliHost 本来就有 configPath 选项，但**不传就等于继承**——所以补一个默认：没有显式 configPath 也没有显式 env 时，把 XIRANITE_CONFIG_PATH 指到一个不存在的 fixture，让加载器读到「零覆盖」。调用方显式给的 configPath 或 env 仍然优先（三条断言分别钉住）。\n\n判据不是靠推理凑的：把 helper 改回原来的继承写法，两条断言立刻红（实测），恢复后绿。这一步顺带纠正我自己第一次写的那条断言——我拿「不含 process.env.HOME」当隔离证据，可仓库本身就装在 $HOME 下面，于是断言恒红；改成等值比较 join(cwd, \"artifacts/test-runs/cli-runtime-missing-config.toml\") 才是我要说的那件事。\n\n也如实记下这条改变的**边界**：今天没有任何消费者测试会因为继承而红。recycleu/src/cli.test.ts 是这个 helper 的两个消费者之一，它的断言是 toContain(...)，多一行提示不会翻；我把 XIRANITE_CONFIG_PATH 指回真 live 配置复跑，它照样绿。所以这条是「把已知会让下一台机器变红的口子关掉」，不是修一个当下的红——真正的当下红是 trename 那条，已在另一笔提交里按同一写法修掉。\n\n验证：packages/cli-runtime bun run test 9 个文件全绿；packages/nodes/recycleu bun run test 5 个文件全绿（含改前改后各一次）。","tree":{"sha":"c77940dc8ab24dbc11785eb692497ab621258157","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/c77940dc8ab24dbc11785eb692497ab621258157"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDdkNTM0ZDkxYmNmNzhiNzJmODMxNDhjMmM0MDIxOWY0MTc4YTZlYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/cc61df142a7c2b5042ced38a61f850b409172730","sha":"cc61df142a7c2b5042ced38a61f850b409172730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/cc61df142a7c2b5042ced38a61f850b409172730"}],"sha":"7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/7d534d91bcf78b72f83148c2c40219f4178a6ebf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/cc61df142a7c2b5042ced38a61f850b409172730/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:14:37Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(scripted)+feat(audit): 字节上界变成清单里可填的一列 maxLiveBytes——18 个跑不起来的节点从此有一句人话可以填\n\n上一笔 §21.1 附注写『剩下那 10 个要等一个不编数字的上界来源』，但当时生成器的拒绝文案已经在叫『state the ceiling in the manifest』而清单里根本没有这一列——指着一扇不存在的门。现在补的是门不是数：docs/xiranite-target-node-manifest.json 每条 retain-rewrite 记录带 maxLiveBytes: number | null，生成器按『清单列 → wasm 时代 plugins/<id>/manifest.toml 的 memory_max_pages×64KiB → 点名拒绝』解析(scripts/lib/node-ceiling.ts 的 resolveCeiling)，一个数都没替谁填(填了就是这层替资源策略做主)。注册数照旧 6/18，签入表只有那 10 条 reason 的措辞变化、成员一字未动。\n\n门禁三条(audit:target-node-manifest)：① maxLiveBytes 只许正整数或 null——0 是宿主读作『未声明』的那个拼写(lib.rs:108-111 明写 must treat as a refusal to schedule, not as unlimited)，把它当限制写就是下一个假绿；② 写了数必须带 maxLiveBytes: <来源> 证据行，来源不明的上界就是魔法数(偏小砸节点、偏大删掉限制)；③ 一行披露按名单点出两个来源都没有的保留节点，现量 22 个：bandia/bitv/classf/cleanf/crashu/dissolvef/encodeb/enginev/findz/formatv/gifu/kisaki/linku/marku/migratef/mvz/rawfilter/recycleu/repacku/sleept/smartzip/trename。填完这张单子 embed 自动把表涨回去，不需要再改代码。\n\n测试四条并入 scripts/audit-target-node-manifest.test.ts(走 CI 已有的 test:target-node-manifest；新开 package.json 脚本键不可取，那份文件此刻是 MM 别的泳道在飞)：优先序、缺源必须拒且两处填法都点名、0/-1/1024.5/NaN/Infinity 一律拒而不回退、加一条形状对照『生成器 emit 的是解析后的 ceilingBytes 而不是裸 pages』。夹具两侧都动：ceilingSources 默认给满(别条规则的夹具不被这条噪音干扰)、单点清空才出披露行，另加 removed/hold-unmigrated 不许被列进名单。\n\n顺手记一条自己的破口：把 programsById 改名 declaredById 时漏了两处引用，其中一处是别的会话刚加的 pendingSites(embed-node-bundles.ts:208)——类型检查看不见、是 embed --check 当场把 ReferenceError 报出来的；纪律是改生成器必须当场真跑一次生产者再 --check。这一轮还实测到工作树竞争：scripts/embed-node-bundles.ts 被另一条会话整份写回成 HEAD，我刚落的改动凭空消失，而上面那条形状对照测试直接变红把它抓出来——那条测试的价值就在这儿，不是装饰。\n\n实测：bun test scripts/audit-target-node-manifest.test.ts 22 pass/0 fail、bun run test:target-node-manifest 26 pass、bun scripts/embed-node-bundles.ts(生产者真跑一次) registered 6/18 refused、--check OK、cargo test -p xiranite-scripted-nodes -j1 10 passed(3/2/2/3)、audit:target-node-manifest 只剩那条 movea FAIL(quickjs-parity-cases.ts 正在别的泳道暂存删除)。","tree":{"sha":"497a7556656a1f9c286645f3772bb6b746215bfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/497a7556656a1f9c286645f3772bb6b746215bfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlo