ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/240a8515bc915a416dbe5d3e73601161825f4796/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:13:40Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"refactor(nodes-shared): 控制器内部改写走运行时字段窄通道，该文件 10 条错误清零\n\n- src/nodes/shared/useNodeCardController.ts 的 7 条 TS2345 是同一个 TS 限制：TState 是泛型，字面量 { logs } / { phase: \"running\" } 没法被证明满足 Partial<TState>。加一条内部 patchRuntime(patch: Partial<NodeCardRuntimeState<TData>))，它只写 TState 约束里保证存在的那几个运行时字段，公开 patch(Partial<TState>) 的签名与所有消费者都不动。那处 cast 是泛型可证明但表达不出来的唯一断点，注释写明了。\n- 另两条 TS2536（keyof TState 索引 Record）改成用 String(field) 做键、局部累加器直接是 Record，出口一次性给回 Partial<TState>；TS6196 那个从没被用到的 TData 泛型参数从 NodeCardControllerOptions 摘掉（该类型只有本文件用，无外部消费者）。\n- 真尺：156 到 147，逐条比对消失 14；\"新增 5\" 全部落在 src/lib/design-theme/**，而那个目录此刻是另一会话 D + ?? 的搬家中间态（apply.ts/contract.ts/md3/resolve.test.ts），与本次无关。\n- 行为不变的证据：gifu/smartzip/trename 三个消费者测试改动前后都是 1 红 38 绿，且那条红（trename 找不到「配置管理」按钮）在退回 HEAD 复跑时同样出现；恢复自己的文件用镜像路径备份并 cmp 过。vite build rc=0。","tree":{"sha":"0726612e1783e14481eddee686ee64ef276ae6d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/0726612e1783e14481eddee686ee64ef276ae6d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/240a8515bc915a416dbe5d3e73601161825f4796","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/240a8515bc915a416dbe5d3e73601161825f4796","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDI0MGE4NTE1YmM5MTVhNDE2ZGJlNWQzZTczNjAxMTYxODI1ZjQ3OTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/01041f3804e52cce006423c034e73714af21de81","sha":"01041f3804e52cce006423c034e73714af21de81","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/01041f3804e52cce006423c034e73714af21de81"}],"sha":"240a8515bc915a416dbe5d3e73601161825f4796","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/240a8515bc915a416dbe5d3e73601161825f4796"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/01041f3804e52cce006423c034e73714af21de81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:11:31Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(clipm): torch 的 CUDA 钉版按平台分臂——原来那一条让 mac 与非 x86_64 Linux 上整个环境不可解析\n\n实测不是推断：torch==2.4.0+cu121 在 darwin/arm64 上 uv 直接报 \"Because there is no version of torch==2.4.0+cu121 ... unsatisfiable\"（PyPI 没有 macOS 的 +cu121 本地版本），而同一台机上普通 torch==2.4.0 可解析。marker 分臂后 uv lock 通过（78 包）、uv lock --check 通过，且 uv sync --dry-run --frozen 在这台 mac 上答 \"+ torch==2.4.0\" —— 改之前这一步走不到。\n\n分臂口径：CUDA 轮子存在之处（win32 与 linux x86_64）继续钉 pytorch-cu121，RTX 4060 pilot 基线一字不变；macOS 与非 x86_64 Linux 走 PyPI 的 torch（自带 macOS arm64 轮子）。[tool.uv.sources] 那条带同一 marker，否则显式索引会把 mac 也拽回 cu121。\n\n一条会坑到所有人的环境事实：这台机 ~/.config/uv/uv.toml 把默认索引配成清华镜像，而 uv.lock 把索引 URL 写死在每个 source 里 —— 我第一次直接 uv lock 就把锁从 0 处镜像地址变成 431 处，等于悄悄把全队 Python 解析改指镜像站（--default-index 与 UV_DEFAULT_INDEX 都没盖过它）。重锁要用 UV_CONFIG_FILE 指一个空配置文件才回到 pypi.org。本条最终锁差 45/14，只动 torch 相关，0 处镜像地址。\n\n没做：mps 不在 clipm 设备词表里（core.ts:78、mcp-client.ts:54/82、interaction.ts:36/94/138/209 全是 \"cuda\" | \"cpu\"），mac 装起来后仍要显式选 CPU；加 mps 要同批改四处 TS 契约 + 帮助字典 + Python 侧校验，且运行时在这台机验不了（要装 torch 并预置 SIGLIP2 模型缓存，local_files_only=True）。另立任务。","tree":{"sha":"e5fe7c578413d0f84fa7e3c67705a63dcf4c21ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/e5fe7c578413d0f84fa7e3c67705a63dcf4c21ea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/01041f3804e52cce006423c034e73714af21de81","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/01041f3804e52cce006423c034e73714af21de81","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDAxMDQxZjM4MDRlNTJjY2UwMDY0MjNjMDM0ZTczNzE0YWYyMWRlODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/d4546c130e6e618293b5a517a1afde994c095ef6","sha":"d4546c130e