m/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/57127e40c75524222cb3c14c566abfdd4ef7e6e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:06:37Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(theming): 高级主题让位组件皮肤 + 补间距 token 与设置侧栏的抽屉化，顺手把我写坏的东西修回\n\n优先级按用户 2026-10-05 的裁定改成 组件皮肤 > 高级主题。落地不是玩层叠，而是不再声明：scripts/md3-yield-to-skins.ts 用 postcss 从 src/index.css 现读每个皮肤族声明过的 (data-slot,属性) 组合（含 background 到 background-color 的简写展开），把 MD3 层撞上的一律摘掉——32 处改动，tabs/segmented/slider/滚动条/字段标题/switch 上色让位，switch 尺寸与圆角保留（皮肤没声明尺寸，不算冲突）。组件 allowlist 随之前后各算一次：29 到 28 集（slider 出局）。事后由 src/styles/design/skinPriority.test.ts 做结构判据（不靠数值巧合，带植入冲突必须被抓到的证伪夹具），bun run audit:design-skin-priority 4 passed。\n\n我自己造的三个洞如实记下并修掉：(1) 先用正则按逗号切选择器，把 :has([a],[b]) 切碎产出坏 CSS，直到 Tailwind 报 Missing opening ( 才发现，退回提交版改用 AST 重做；(2) 我那条 pill 到 9999px 的断言是空过——组件自带 rounded-full，摘掉 MD3 也一样，故判据改成开/关 MD3 值必须一致并在同一测试里加正控（卡片 12px 必须随摘属性消失）；(3) 插入型 Edit 两次没带 old_string 全文，一次把 zh.json 插成重复键、一次吃掉文档一条 bullet，都已按内容核对修回。\n\n另外三件与主题无关的真实缺陷（用户批准做成不分主题都生效）：设置侧栏低于 11px 的 8/9/10px 字号抬到地板值、把文字 ✓ 换成 lucide Check 图标、去掉对不存在 tabpanel 的 role=tablist/tab 假 ARIA 并补 focus-visible 环；ThemeSettings 测试桩缺 designTheme 字段导致 6 条崩，改成从契约取默认值而非手抄形状。\n\n验证：门禁 audit:md3-tokens rc=0、token 双向 7 passed、皮肤优先级 4 passed；单测 185/187（2 条红已隔离为本轮之外：BackendStatusBanner 测试桩缺 hostReason、设置搜索对 /操作栏/ 命中三项的歧义查询——两次退回我改动的对照实验都照样红，且三个匹配项都不是我加的字段）；浏览器 14+14+4 passed；tsc -p tsconfig.app.json 我文件 0 错；check:source-size passed；vite build rc=0，产物含 234 条 MD3 规则与抽屉 token。设置侧栏抽屉化见 docs/advanced-design-theme-md3.md。","tree":{"sha":"ab61242abc79af4de48449a33205b53fdee0dc91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/ab61242abc79af4de48449a33205b53fdee0dc91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/57127e40c75524222cb3c14c566abfdd4ef7e6e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/5712