low/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/0442fbc66b224ae24e800e4e4e99d1bd39197d3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:53:32Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T12:20:22Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"docs(migration): §26 完成审计——四条判据全部现读现测、不引记忆值，结论是目标未达成：① 出货宿主 from_registrations 只有 [dissolvef, kisaki] 两个(未达成)；② tauri 3.0.0-alpha.4 在工作树与 HEAD 都已落地、macOS check/test rc=0，但 Windows 仍缺 icons/icon.ico(版本侧达成、平台侧未)；③ CI 里 ''run: cargo'' 从今天的 0 涨到 6，可这个 job 一次都没真跑过(禁 push、本机无 act)——『写了 job』不等于『门禁生效』，只算部分；④ HEAD 成员表里 crates/nodes/ 仍 3 处命中，一份节点两份实现没解决，audit:node-registry 那 2 条 BOTH FAIL 是有意的红。附注把『6』这个数字的性质写死：它不是能力上限而是数据缺口——字节上界全树只有 plugins/<id>/manifest.toml 的 memory_max_pages 一处来源(全树 rg 五个候选字段名只命中两份图像解码文件)，只剩 6 份，而 node-registry/src/lib.rs:108-111 明写 0 是『未声明⇒宿主必须拒绝调度』不是『无上限』；上一版我把其余 18 个注册了进去，那 10 个 id 会在第一次 operation 才失败，正是本仓禁的『绿而假』，所以 opq 主动撤回到 6 并把理由写进 UNREGISTERED_BUNDLES。同时声明本节取代 §25 里的『16 registered』。下一步按代价排：定 18 个节点的字节上界(清单一条字段)→表自动涨回去、builtin-host 停迁后接 scripted_registry()、trash 那 4 个 bundle 两条路、Windows 图标与让 rust-host 真跑一次(要 push 授权)","tree":{"sha":"b78848db6af9b8b4a16acbff23ef9fa2c407d74e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/b78848db6af9b8b4a16acbff23ef9fa2c407d74e"},"url":"