error 一字不改），service.handle 仍是唯一分派点；串行 ⇒ 响应按顺序配对，requestId 继续只当幂等键\n- 帧帽 1 MiB：读的时候就在管住，超限回一帧 request_too_large 而不是把管道卡住\n- 排空谓词是 err==ErrBufferFull：触发上限的那一块经常已经带了行尾换行，那时再排空会把下一帧整条吃掉——这条由 serve_test.go 的两把分头尺钉住（一条走已读完分支、一条走 4 MiB 未读完分支）\n- ffi.go 的 main() 从空体改成按需 serve；c-shared 仍能编（产物 9,795,778 B），go test ./... 全绿含原有 1,182 行测试","tree":{"sha":"7bb1868b6787290d5360c7fe56d0d16ea022b41b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/7bb1868b6787290d5360c7fe56d0d16ea022b41b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/c0425c5aaf345e9b619afb57a2a03f8d9c60cbed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/c0425c5aaf345e9b619afb57a2a03f8d9c60cbed","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKGMwNDI1YzVhYWYzNDVlOWI2MTlhZmI1N2EyYTAzZjhkOWM2MGNiZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/3d495b66a826761b5c9f24a57cb76e1806f53e3e"