是不编数字，方向对)，但 0 不是『没有上限』而是『宿主拒绝调度』。于是签入表里 16 个 id 只有 6 个真能被跑起来，其余 10 个是列进宿主节点清单、第一次 operation 就失败的假绿。修法两条一起落：① 生成器把『拿不到字节上界』从『省略 budget』改成明确拒绝注册，理由写明 executor 拒 0 且本文件不编数；② 循环测试不许任何已注册 id 落在 RunError 臂(就是『宿主拒绝调度』那条路)，注释里记下这 10 个曾经就是这样漏过去的。另外这轮先手动跑过 quickjs-run 全表：16 个 bundle 在 realm 里全部求值成功(零 __esmMin 那类载入失败)、多数返回自己的节点级校验消息、logx 真查到 0 条事件、recycleu 答 idle——这条现在由测试固定下来，不再是口头结论。实测 cargo test --all-targets rc=0(3+2+2+3=10 passed)、clippy --all-targets --no-deps -D warnings rc=0；anchor 名单这次也照实缩到 6 个(那份手抄名单已经两次因漂移变红，这是它该由生成器接管的最直接证据)","tree":{"sha":"e50badc457763fa2e71432d29a573ecaa35d4c5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/e50badc457763fa2e71432d29a573ecaa35d4c5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/3d495b66a826761b5c9f24a57cb76e1806f53e3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/3d495b66a826761b5c9f24a57cb76e1806f53e3e","node_id":"C_kwDOTOJ3GdoAKDNkNDk1YjY2YTgyNjc2MWI1YzlmMjRhNTdjYjc2ZTE4MDZmNTNlM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commit/151b5ed51ef27dc2fce692082c2089459b8385e9","sha":"151b5ed51ef27dc2fce692082c2089459b8385e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/151b5ed51ef27dc2fce692082c2089459b8385e9"}],"sha":"3d495b66a826761b5c9f24a57cb76e1806f53e3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/3d495b66a826761b5c9f24a57cb76e1806f53e3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/151b5ed51ef27dc2fce692082c2089459b8385e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:49:10Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:49:10Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"ci(rust-host): 把 xiranite-core 的跨平台能力真正纳入门禁——那条 job 覆盖 ubuntu/windows/macos，但一个 cargo 步骤都没碰 core，而回收站/剪贴板/网络计数/电源动作这四个「关于别的操作系统」的断言全住在那儿\n\n加两步：\n1. cargo test --locked -p xiranite-core --lib -j 1（三家都跑）。覆盖不是宣称的：本机现跑输出里逐条数到 18 条能力测——clipboard 4 / network 3 / power 7 / trash_service 4，且 --lib 只含纯逻辑与假后端，不会去动机器的电源或真回收站。\n2. cargo test --locked -p xiranite-core --test trash_service -j 1（macOS + Ubuntu，windows-latest 明确排除）。这条是真打系统回收站的集成测。排除 Windows 的理由写在注释里、不是躲：那半边后端走 IFileOperation，需要 shell/COM 上下文，服务账号跑的 job 有没有上下文**没测过**，所以留成一条要在 Windows 上做的测量，而不是猜一个绿灯。Linux 侧 freedesktop 是纯文件操作（~/.local/share/Trash + .trashinfo），才有把握开。\n\n两步都按仓库既定的串行口径写 -j 1，与同 job 里其它 cargo 步骤一致。\n\n验证（本机等价，CI 不能推所以只能这样证）：YAML 用仓里自带的 yaml 包解析通过，rust-host 共 13 步、两条 if 条件都在（matrix.os != windows-latest / == macos-latest）；两条命令原样跑：--lib 70 条绿、--test trash_service 4 条绿（含「源文件消失且条目出现在 ~/.Trash」、「批量里含根路径必须整批不伤数据」两条真副作用断言）。\n\n顺带把那步 desktop 的注释改对：原文说 Windows 缺 crates/xiranite-desktop/icons/icon.ico 所以不加它——那份图标本轮已经进了仓（取自 build/windows/icon.ico，出货用过的那张，提交 49737b29），tauri-build 的无条件要求（src/lib.rs:913-931）在三家都已满足。但这步仍留 mac-only，理由换成实话：Windows 上没人重测过，而且桌面 crate 此刻在任何机器上都编不过（别的 lane 正在接 src/shell.rs，__tauri_command_name_* 未解析），照旧写「Windows 也绿」就是断言一个谁都没见过的绿灯。Linux 需要 webkit2gtk 系统库，本机无凭据。","tree":{"sha":"090d0be534887bf8948a37db688d63c55241488f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/090d0be534887bf8948a37db688d63c55241488f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/151b5ed51ef27dc2fce692082c2089459b8385e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOC