type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/commits/e2faedb17037f93eff290b59de70f577bebb8f18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:48:33Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:48:33Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"feat(theming): 设置侧栏 rail 按 MD3 navigation drawer 落一份独立层\n\n时间线隐喻（竖连线 + 编号圈 + ✓ + 10px/9px 标签）不是任何一套 M3 token 能表达的\n东西，用户判它设计不合格。这份层只消费引擎已经写进 :root 的变量：条目 = drawer\nactive-indicator-height 56dp / list one-line 56dp，前导图标 24dp（编号圈整体抑制），\n标签 drawer label-text-*（label-large 14px，子级同值、ADV 角标进 list overline），\n标题行从手写 uppercase tracking-[0.16em] 换成 drawer headline-*（title-small），\n选中项 = active-indicator-color(secondary-container) + corner-full +\nactive-label/icon-color + active-label-text-weight，三态覆盖层按 --md-sys-state-*-\nstate-layer-opacity 混 drawer 的 *-state-layer-color，条目平（elevation level0）。\n\n两条偏离写在文件头：container-width 360px 与 container-shape corner-large-end 是\nmodal drawer 的值，这条 docked rail 保留应用自己的 w-52，指示条内缩按 (360−336)/2\n的比例取；容器色取 modal-container-color(surface-container-low) 而不是 surface，\n否则与设置面板本体糊成一片。每块恰好一个维度门、无 !important、无 @layer、无\nvar(--md-*, …) fallback；headline 那条不写 font-family，因为 .font-mono 被\nindex.css:672 的无层 !important 钉住，皮肤表达的偏好让路。\n\n尺：md3-settings-nav.browser.test.tsx 14 passed（含 geometry/color/typography/shape/\nstates 五条维度对照 + native 无 data-app-design 的旧观感对照 + 焦点环不被这层改动\n的同 DOM 对照），bun run audit:design-theme-tokens 7 passed（新文件被双向门收录）。\nnavigation-rail 不在 MD3_EMITTED_COMPONENT_SETS，所以这层只用 drawer 与 list 两套 token。","tree":{"sha":"0eee18399643d456009a59b4dc0fcb22ecaa6088","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/0eee18399643d456009a59b4dc0fcb22ecaa6088"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/e2faedb17037f93eff290b59de70f577bebb8f18","verification":{"payload":null