":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:39:27Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:47:57Z","email":"3090253564@qq.com","name":"HibernalGlow"},"message":"fix(contract): TData 约束从 Record<string, unknown> 放宽到 object，TS2344 整簇归零\n\n- 那 47 条 TS2344 是同一个根因：contract 要求节点状态形状带索引签名，而各节点的 XxxCardState 是 interface（TS 里 interface 拿不到隐式索引签名，type 别名才有），于是每个节点文件都在同一个约束上红一次。逐个把 interface 改成 type 是给所有人埋坑，所以改约束本身。\n- 附带把 patchData 的 Partial<TData> & Record<string, unknown> 交集去掉（那正是索引签名的唯一实际来源，而且这个方法已标 deprecated，调用点本来就只传部分字段）。\n- 一个管路事实要记下：tsc 解析 @xiranite/contract 走的是 packages/contract/dist/index.d.ts（exports.types，且 dist 被 gitignore），所以只改 src 时真尺完全不动——我第一次试改就是这样（净 +3、TS2344 仍 47）。必须先重建该包（npx turbo build --filter=@xiranite/contract）才量得到。含义是 typecheck 那条脚本没有把包构建接进去，读到的可能是上一个 dist。\n- 实测：411 到 363（-48），TS2344 47 到 0，错误集逐条比对新增 0；vite build rc=0；classq/encodeb/kisaki/samea/timeu 单测 8 红 111 绿，那 8 条与 contract 无关（kisaki 基线红，前面已用退回 HEAD 的同一把测对照过）。","tree":{"sha":"f372e200eb00d1ea80112247d6322c4fb5420853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/trees/f372e200eb00d1ea80112247d6322c4fb5420853"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HibernalGlow/Xiranite/git/commits/210d9d706f6c45608237a624e9bcde727fd4da94","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/154863885?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/HibernalGlow","id":154863885,"login":"HibernalGlow","node_id":"U_kgDOCTsJDQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HibernalGlow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u