r into a hidden atlas-host-root\nand resolve mount() only when startDomHost reports ready, so the\nbootstrap placeholder is the only startup loader. startDomHost reports\nready once: when a route outlet or status anchor renders after the\ninfrastructure is ready, when an App placement changes state, when the\nruntime starts, or after the start error shows. A retried start keeps\nthe previous error on screen until the new attempt is ready.\n\nThe Host UI now only shows the start error, in its own status element.\nrenderHostLoading, RenderHostLoading, createHostUi, AtlasHostUi, and\nAtlasHostUiOptions are removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a6dfc1e0d9aee73aa226490dc519aa59c30d18e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/trees/4a6dfc1e0d9aee73aa226490dc519aa59c30d18e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/commits/d9baa52d77a22591177e0e6ff491070cf8ef9df5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62200832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bendaj11","id":62200832,"login":"bendaj11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjAwODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11","user_view_type":"public"},"h