62200832,"login":"bendaj11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjAwODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/commits/181df52a1d4d77ea66b5828fc507af1d8723db27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:39:55Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T06:39:55Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"message":"perf(bootstrap,runtime): shorten the host startup critical path\n\n- Let the browser HTTP cache serve content the loader verifies itself\n  (artifact manifests, host remote entries with integrity); on a failed\n  verification, refetch from the network before retrying.\n- Install the module shim, resolve the catalog, and ask the Columbus\n  bridge for overrides concurrently; settle the bridge on error replies\n  instead of waiting for its 2s timeout.\n- Resolve host and app overrides concurrently, share registry.json\n  requests, and keep errors in document order.\n- Start host stylesheets before the remote entry fetch and remove them\n  when the host fails to load.\n- Preconnect to a separate artifact registry origin.\n- Mount slot and route apps concurrently at startup, unmount on a failed\n  start, and reconcile slots once anchors are subscribed.\n- Validate bridge sessions instead of casting them, and fall back when\n  crypto.randomUUID is unavailable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a5ddab799662cc84ca756a66c157157fa0673e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/trees/1a5dda