i.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/commits/1246c68113074ce2e6e809de816ba6b5be5078d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:40:44Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T14:40:44Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"message":"perf(cli): parallelize publish uploads and add step progress output\n\nUpload and verify publication files with bounded concurrency\n(--parallel-uploads / ATLAS_PARALLEL_UPLOADS, default 16). The manifest\nstill uploads only after every payload, and registry writes still follow\nall uploads. Artifactory skips the redundant read-back pass because its\ncreate already verifies checksum and headers, allows creates on distinct\npaths to run concurrently, and verifies delivery in parallel.\n\nReplace \"...\" status lines with a step reporter: an in-place spinner on\nTTYs and one line per step start/finish in CI. Publish, deploy, and dev\nnow report plain-language steps with counts and durations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"946c76a300d09600b5bf2b9586ff0100e33afa3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/trees/946c76a300d09600b5bf2b9586ff0100e33afa3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/commits/1246c68113074ce2e6e809de816ba6b5be5078d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62200832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bendaj11","id":62200832,"login":"bendaj11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjAwODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/orgs","received_event