events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/commits/957869a470e189ef1305896f2a782a655b81f4a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:01:13Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:01:13Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"message":"chore: pre-release cleanup across packages\n\n- Move shared test builders into @atlas/testkit; atlas-only builders are\n  exported from the new @atlas/testkit/internal subpath. schema and sdk\n  reach testkit through root jest/tsconfig mapping to avoid a package cycle.\n  Builders keep random defaults; specs pin the fields their units branch on.\n- Move AtlasRuntimeOverride* types from runtime to schema so testkit can\n  share anOverrideDocument.\n- Replace root tests/ with the examples/e2e workspace; host-widgets now runs\n  on Playwright. Root test:e2e also runs cli, sdk and runtime e2e suites.\n- Build sdk federation-config entry points into dist instead of committing\n  generated files at the package root; declare typescript as optional peer.\n- Align react peer range, fix bootstrap README, add generators test script,\n  unify package test scripts, rename prepare-release tests to release.\n- Fix stale turbo globalDependencies, pnpm allowBuilds placeholders and\n  tooling tsconfig paths; drop machine-specific graphify hook paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6234804260d5862bc981e5014b81429d251ca474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/trees/6234804260d5862bc981e5014b81429d251ca474"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/commits/957869a470e189ef1