j11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"message":"test(sdk): close remaining coverage gaps\n\nAdd specs for the untested SDK error classes and widget input\nforwarding, and extend the existing suites to reach the branches that\nwere never exercised: navigate/replace option forwarding, history\ndeltas and unsubscribe paths in both host navigations, scoped\nnavigation reads, browser navigation back/dispose/global-window\ndefaults, router replace and no-op synchronization, Angular location\nstrategy forward/back/historyGo/getState, widget outlet controller\nloading-component remounts and post-destroy renders, React widget\nmount races, repeated query keys and empty host pathnames.\n\nSDK production sources now sit at 98.1% lines and 98.9% branches. The\nremainder is the WidgetOutlet directive, which needs Angular partial\ncompilation for its signal input, the default ApplicationConfig of\ncreateExportedWidget, which requires a zone.js global, and a\ndefensive container-ref guard that React never triggers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dad9d233f30d24238956b228aac20e114be30ef0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/trees/dad9d233f30d24238956b228aac20e114be30ef0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/commits/da751001300de50d320c9fdc058e1f0552bb38c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62200832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bendaj11","id":62200832,"login":"bendaj11","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMjAwODMy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/orgs","received