1018432be9dae8984ddf7a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:03:57Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T13:03:57Z","email":"bendaj11@gmail.com","name":"jbd"},"message":"refactor(sdk): production hardening — variance, casts, coverage, bundle\n\n- Restore method-style members on adapter contracts (RootAdapter, RouterLike,\n  AtlasNavigation, BrowserWindowLike, widget handles); the arrow-typed members\n  rejected real react-dom and React Router implementations\n- Type app element factories as ReactNode instead of unknown\n- Remove every avoidable cast: typed assignments, Reflect lookups, a symbol-keyed\n  React facade cache, an exported SharedModuleProxyPlugin type, real DOM nodes,\n  real Angular applications and a real Vite BuildEnvironment in tests.\n  Five generic-erasure casts remain at DI, context and facade boundaries\n- Cover the untested units: Angular defineApp/defineExportedWidget,\n  provideAtlasApp, createExportedWidget, the loading renderer,\n  createSharedModuleProxy hooks and the host-origin fallback\n- Drop declarationMap from the published build (maps pointed at unshipped sources):\n  dist 1.4M -> 928K, 115 fewer files\n- Document the error classes in the package README\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3be4bf44a04e8f59215fd029c56dc2938b00c88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/trees/b3be4bf44a04e8f59215fd029c56dc2938b00c88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bendaj11/atlas/git/commits/2bcf3ebe7e726cc741018432be9dae8984ddf7a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62200832?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bendaj11/following{/other_user