9f3fdbdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/f70824688b1a3be21b16f805810038829f3fdbdc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/811685e266264417b138dfa10e497dab3b83b262/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:48:29Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:48:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: gate production deps strictly and allowlist braces in the dev tree (#102)\n\nnpm audit started failing on main''s scheduled Security run (2026-10-05)\nand on every PR: braces <= 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm, CVE-2026-93687,\npublished 2026-09-18) has no patched release, and it reaches this repo\nonly through dev tooling — the shadcn CLI and eslint-config-next, via\nfast-glob and micromatch. `npm audit --omit=dev` reports 0.\n\nnpm audit cannot ignore a single advisory, so the job now runs two\nsteps: the production tree with --omit=dev and no exceptions, then the\nfull tree through scripts/audit.mjs, which fails on any high/critical\nadvisory that is not in its allowlist and prints a notice when an entry\nstops matching. Checked locally both ways: it passes with the entry and\nfails on the same advisory with an empty allowlist.","tree":{"sha":"a704bd135d171d377519b281b0ac99e4936adacf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/a704bd135d171d377519b281b0ac99e4936adacf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/811685e266264417b138dfa10e497dab3b83b262","verification":{"payload":"tree a704bd135d171d377519b281b0ac99e4936adacf\nparent 11ba671071ec1de77be907aa3bd3cf69184fecc1\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1791240509 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791240509 -0300\n\nci: gate production deps strictly and allowlist braces in the dev tree (#102)\n\nnpm audit started failing on main''s scheduled Security run (2026-10-05)\nand on every PR: braces <= 3.0.3 (GHSA-vfj7-8cjw-p6xm, CVE-2026-93687,\npublished 2026-09-18) has no patched release, and it reaches this repo\nonly through dev tooling — the shadcn CLI and eslint-config-next, via\nfast-glob and micromatch. `npm audit --omit=dev` reports 0.\n\nnpm audit cannot ignore a single advisory, so the job now runs two\nsteps: the production tree with --omit=dev and no exceptions, then the\nfull tree through scripts/audit.mjs, which fails on any high/critical\nadvisory that is not in its allowlist and prints a notice when an entry\nstops matching. Checked locally both ways: it passes with the entry and\nfails on the same advisory with an empty allowlist.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxCk9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAY0oQAFhM0tSLm+fkc9618NofreQM\nSuETH7oCxkiGsNDbvwgXwI6U0hYXXXDYiltSvEq0q4/235AYmJ+z1rmQafyW7zxn\nfmtkXQJ+3+t3aFkUW3au9qGn0lL0PbUewLDpcpCycP4LpYUgaUk3jAuKmktNs1Xg\njHL4D920L/zbkyeqi5kveQrA