ec1de77be907aa3bd3cf69184fecc1"}],"sha":"811685e266264417b138dfa10e497dab3b83b262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/811685e266264417b138dfa10e497dab3b83b262"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/11ba671071ec1de77be907aa3bd3cf69184fecc1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:36:47Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:36:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(seo): render the sitemap on demand so new posts reach it (#101)\n\nThe live sitemap stopped at the deploy''s build time: on 2026-10-05 its\nhome entry, stamped with `now` when the file is generated, still read\n2026-10-02T21:09:47Z, Vercel served it as a cache HIT with an Age over\nnine hours, and none of the four posts published since were listed.\n\nThe code asks for 60-second revalidation through getPosts'' fetch, and\nlocally that works: `next build` lists /sitemap.xml as ISR (1m) and\n`next start` serves it STALE, then regenerated, after 60 s. Why Vercel\nnever regenerates it was not found. force-dynamic stops depending on\nit: the route now runs per request, which only crawlers make.\n\nVerified with a production build against the production API: the route\ntable shows ƒ /sitemap.xml, and two requests a second apart returned\ndifferent home lastmod values and listed the new posts.","tree":{"sha":"c6c7aeba49b6a277d47d44452417263952f8ca23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/c6c7aeba49b6a277d47d44452417263952f8ca23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/11ba671071ec1de77be907aa3bd3cf69184fecc1","verification":{"payload":"tree c6c7aeba49b6a277d47d44452417263952f8ca23\nparent 49f848dc1f002c5c4b1dde507e1e7a96c0b34ea8\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1791239807 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791239807 -0300\n\nfix(seo): render the sitemap on demand so new posts reach it (#101)\n\nThe live sitemap stopped at the deploy''s build time: on 2026-10-05 its\nhome entry, stamped with `now` when the file is generated, still read\n2026-10-02T21:09:47Z, Vercel served it as a cache HIT with an Age over\nnine hours, and none of the four posts published since were listed.\n\nThe code asks for 60-second revalidation through getPosts'' fetch, and\nlocally that works: `next build` lists /sitemap.xml as ISR (1m) and\n`next start` serves it STALE, then regenerated, after 60 s. Why Vercel\nnever regenerates it was not found. force-dynamic stops depending on\nit: the route now runs per request, which only crawlers make.\n\nVerified with a production build against the production API: the route\ntable shows ƒ /sitemap.xml, and two requests a second apart returned\ndifferent home lastmod values and listed the new posts.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxCZ/CRC1a