","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/7d74e944f4068b626ab33ee956d397adbf03ca44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:30:09Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:30:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(readme): match hosting, rendering, auth and test setup to the code (#97)\n\nThe README still described an earlier version of the app:\n\n- vertex-api runs on AWS Lambda, not Render.\n- The canonical origin is a build-time constant in src/lib/site-url.ts,\n  not derived from the request''s Host header; NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL is a\n  local-development override only.\n- The admin panel lives in src/app/admin, outside the locale segment,\n  and proxy.ts gates /admin — there is no (blog-admin) group, /dashboard\n  or /profile route.\n- Public pages are prerendered and resolve the signed-in user on the\n  client through /api/me and CurrentUserProvider; auth state is not\n  threaded down from the server.\n- The Playwright suite does not need vertex-api and runs in CI against a\n  production build, with the federation specs in their own job.\n- rehype-pretty-code is installed but not used; posts are highlighted\n  with rehype-highlight.","tree":{"sha":"e920fdedd15e790e3e18cf41f7f3b5d10672ee95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/e920fdedd15e790e3e18cf41f7f3b5d10672ee95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/7d74e944f4068b626ab33ee956d397adbf03ca44","verification":{"payload":"tree e920fdedd15e790e3e18cf41f7f3b5d10672ee95\nparent fb8d024074c1aa4575596e1db0a2f24bfadfe3d7\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1790973009 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790973009 -0300\n\ndocs(readme): match hosting, rendering, auth and test setup to the code (#97)\n\nThe README still described an earlier version of the app:\n\n- vertex-api runs on AWS Lambda, not Render.\n- The canonical origin is a build-time constant in src/lib/site-url.ts,\n  not derived from the request''s Host header; NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL is a\n  local-development override only.\n- The admin panel lives in src/app/admin, outside the locale segment,\n  and proxy.ts gates /admin — there is no (blog-admin) group, /dashboard\n  or /profile route.\n- Public pages are prerendered and resolve the signed-in user on the\n  client through /api/me and CurrentUserProvider; auth state is not\n  threaded down from the server.\n- The Playwright suite does not need vertex-api and runs in CI against a\n  production build, with the federation specs in their own job.\n- rehype-pretty-code is installed but not used; posts are highlighted\n  with rehype-highlight.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwBRRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAziMQABy0xFMW46Tc/1ZqJV/5ULle\nNvxqNOQMkmJeGsB4doZ6He3JK9MUROPW+SgfWrKQ1TSWo2+HP/PFjFMfd7POaK5p\nf3qUr9qZMa6t+td850ypzd64vlNskqoD1ccpI7IcuwigDWiJ4BmhawiSHsQhVFwG\ntSWGU5tnErid4HGZdvL+PYGCMU40y2/FM2C7KB4PzNCybYUR0KRt4cmQe7Iz08Cl\nzWxg1JKztsS6So11Qxft6JUX8Pl1L4R2JrWpa3Pe4qGvsyaF+Me6OfYMbWBbjLMM\n3DJf0Pe833KeiRt170BFL0SHjWMTNL+BfHeASRLR3XNhzZrb+5g6UJhDKwqoBITF\nZ0mkGRNYkT3uRse+OQJ7cwJQcaHEfjJh63A/vmMRhoXqQ8wjJZ78P+AcOPwvmjiH\nAv7INnbe+Oc8vETAWSjhNbTEj13YIIkM+F6UZU/pjOZKOH5bwbreOy70U8l