i.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/fb8d024074c1aa4575596e1db0a2f24bfadfe3d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:15:14Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T20:15:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(auth): attribute the severed popup opener to the API''s COOP header (#96)\n\nThe comments around the OAuth popup blamed a strict\nCross-Origin-Opener-Policy on Google''s and GitHub''s own pages for\nsevering window.opener. Neither enforces one: Google sends only\nCross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only and GitHub sends no COOP. The cut\ncomes from vertex-api itself, whose Helmet registration sets\n`same-origin-allow-popups` on every response, so the popup''s first,\ncross-origin /auth/* redirect already moves it into a new browsing\ncontext group. Reproduced in Chromium with Playwright: a popup opened\nstraight at the provider keeps its opener; opened through\napi.samuelsantana.dev/auth/* it loses it.\n\nThe full reasoning now lives on OAUTH_BROADCAST_CHANNEL_NAME, and\nLoginModal, LinkGithubButton and the callback page state the corrected\ncause and point there.\n\nAlso fixes two stale facts in the same comment blocks:\n- LoginModal said the popup comes back \"with the token\"; it carries a\n  single-use exchange code that exchangeOAuthCodeAction trades for the\n  token server-to-server.\n- The API''s error filter is OAuthPopupExceptionFilter, not\n  GithubPopupExceptionFilter (renamed when Google linking landed).\n\nComment-only; no behavior change.","tree":{"sha":"5d927de563c5dadfcb571ef7f6c5f53d2dff2aed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/5d927de563c5dadfcb571ef7f6c5f53d2dff2aed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/fb8d024074c1aa4575596e1db0a2f24bfadfe3d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 5d927de563c5dadfcb571ef7f6c5f53d2dff2aed\nparent e676540c2df75e8a62c1a9732f6ab220e18a76c9\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1790972114 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790972114 -0300\n\ndocs(auth): attribute the severed popup opener to the API''s COOP header (#96)\n\nThe comments around the OAuth popup blamed a strict\nCross-Origin-Opener-Policy on Google''s and GitHub''s own pages for\nsevering window.opener. Neither enforces one: Google sends only\nCross-Origin-Opener-Policy-Report-Only and GitHub sends no COOP. The cut\ncomes from vertex-api itself, whose Helmet registration sets\n`same-origin-allow-popups` on every response, so the popup''s first,\ncross-origin /auth/* redirect already moves it into a new browsing\ncontext group. Reproduced in Chromium with Playwright: a popup opened\nstraight at the provider keeps its opener; opened through\napi.samuelsantana.dev/auth/* it loses it.\n\nThe full reasoning now lives on OAUTH_BROADCAST_CHANNEL_NAME, and\nLoginModal, LinkGithubButton and the callback page state the corrected\ncause and point there.\n\nAlso fixes two stale facts in the same comment blocks:\n- LoginModal said the popup comes back \"with the token\"; it carries a\n  single-use exchange code that exchangeOAuthCodeAction trades for the\n  token server-to-server.\n- The API''s error filter is OAuthPopupExceptionFilter, not\n  GithubPopupExceptionFilter (renamed when Google linking landed).\n\nComment-only; no behavior change.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwBDSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6B0QAFR9m2e4Z8TJG7+MROwWIwdo\ndycfjZhG1TikEx/WgmZmSQtIfVZXSLPC6aPdiaYDTrS2Fhoqri8PgCCr9DU1K9i0\npavihm8wVGYeOgcuVvRDN7VZJLK11NWsBvcTV2THOzkBPnNOv2spQoI7wdnI+wBl\nVzEEOqQ8PcJfIGEkjjtPISI+YGZTGc5GKH5Hx7Pz9eUchEMfsn7Q1HT10trs/9ky\nRgtDi2MOYn9aYXZx8ghJAt9fcrbnGtrFVsfFjLI8jI9j3qKj9Vu56k5VTBoAUVSM\n/cZmPtlWnKRG5aOiCr/+LdO66nVcUMNUOyZ6Kr8EfPKuQcwQKeucs1H6QCjbVnw2\nsLHo62abaxW0poy06MdGHcrBpM6bSXselfFd8uVEKjJ4VdwP99jcjIs/d1lmp8Lq\narK45wMkP4c55X8bu7xmXh87l28M0qDUBfKNFWCLaNlZVtIQe9M/PZa92yJ4WT+t\n+XgBcwA2GABQs3zs8HY7CEvdqEvebAl6WaeTjWHu16Fbx8E525sb89sBYNRf0lGO\nIDmOx4DxToXV52mH0fTucV6TckGD/YCKxZ8sVZHf5iDagfSxlkPY2OD9tuhE3//f\nfa0JjWfVNztmPoMmSi3b1x8AZIzMoRfqi7/ymSbRnR2UNmpMu17zsHre5jNFNUEW\ncdkejOO7S929J/jDXLR6\n=1/aV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T20:15:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.gith