x and @next/third-parties to ^16.3.8.\n- brace-expansion (high), fast-uri, hono and ip-address (moderate), all transitive:\n  npm audit fix, lockfile only.\n- vitest and @vitest/coverage-v8 (moderate, GHSA-82fw-gwwq-j7x9): ^4.1.11.\n\nnpm audit now reports 0 vulnerabilities. On 16.3.8 the build passes with the same route modes\n(every locale page static, revalidated every minute), lint shows only the two pre-existing\nReact Compiler warnings, and the unit (132) and e2e (19) suites pass.","tree":{"sha":"baaef8cb925bd51af82589c100edf58a8c82d9e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/baaef8cb925bd51af82589c100edf58a8c82d9e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/2e6c2f0b24dcb989881435a97944cdc9e5f60050","verification":{"payload":"tree baaef8cb925bd51af82589c100edf58a8c82d9e6\nparent 286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1790966500 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790966500 -0300\n\nfix(deps): clear the audit''s critical and high advisories (#94)\n\nnpm audit --audit-level=high failed on every pull request and on the weekly Security run:\n\n- next 16.2.11: three critical remote code execution advisories (GHSA-p293-qw3h-jr36 on\n  Windows hosts, GHSA-2xp9-vwfh-vxw4 in the image optimizer with AVIF, GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j\n  in next/og). This app runs on Linux, serves no AVIF and does not use next/og, so the exposure\n  was low, but the fix is outside the pinned version: next and eslint-config-next go to 16.3.8,\n  @next/mdx and @next/third-parties to ^16.3.8.\n- brace-expansion (high), fast-uri, hono and ip-address (moderate), all transitive:\n  npm audit fix, lockfile only.\n- vitest and @vitest/coverage-v8 (moderate, GHSA-82fw-gwwq-j7x9): ^4.1.11.\n\nnpm audit now reports 0 vulnerabilities. On 16.3.8 the build passes with the same route modes\n(every locale page static, revalidated every minute), lint shows only the two pre-existing\nReact Compiler warnings, and the unit (132) and e2e (19) suites pass.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv/rkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApygQAJZMJI7up4Lj3mtwyv8yr6dN\nGb/uxnc9L3Hc/MhUnCsQAeakXpmZZtYte1K1aHdrfyPEx9WVu43JMx9n2SEB2NSf\nB8soF4MSd6TUD40omqrmvYVjFDvjMpNWLG9NvmQ3p9KHtS93AbxrU77v+0hG/fXe\nZACxp9qQwMWOPLpiGwe/j+WPNcGGOH4CQFyJBurZV1MWAUjFR+EPtANobMIizXsm\nZLtkALhPgdROJomnxjlGoChcNYJKvp+VhHon+JPvEyNhnEWxMja19pBWML8YodBq\n14mFmmWJJevzu2pbd8iAdP7pi6P1qNoqeDwiTtVQZeirTHuNdz8P/rXb58vQCfyM\nGOK37/Yc15+4bHYGmatk8eY0s3bgS5vzm6iDqcyHR5WeibGs7HNbhEn2TB3p9mFN\nDnLa8DdZ0jy0u6KUfX8CstvFF1An8JUudC8jfIqkFBdjrhCqu/TaAM1WS5fqYH3u\ntYoKr3QNeGItceg/Rapp4bhcvZntU+LrDIvaetxuTySBgJtupehbjG4qx5I8RJev\ns1V4ZSz92ztkmHe/YWwjPFNu0hOgQKG03ZQo1UCftJfyQNNqW5Q5WBc5hvuw0jS6\nXAJVKxjs8/jaobhVPXsU62sK8lxsOmoooSQX7dB/W1TS+ESfBxsX3+EX4sAclQ1H\ncAs1fskD4t2R1Blv6YXi\n=Gfcx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T18:41:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/2e6c2f0b24dcb989881435a97944cdc9e5f60050","node_id":"C_kwDOTOZb-9oAKDJlNmMyZjBiMjRkY2I5ODk4ODE0MzVhOTc5NDRjZGM5ZTVmNjAwNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa","sha":"286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa"}],"sha":"2e6c2f0b24dcb989881435a97944cdc9e5f60050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/2e6c2f0b24dcb989881435a97944cdc9e5f60050"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:51:14Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T19:51:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci: move the actions off Node 20 (#92)\n\nEvery run in this repository carries the same annotation: actions/checkout,\nactions/setup-node and actions/cache declare Node 20, which GitHub deprecated\nand now force-runs on Node 24 anyway. The forcing is the warning''s point — it\nis a compatibility shim with an end date, not a permanent arrangement.\n\nThe majors are further ahead than the v4 pins suggest: checkout and setup-node\nare on v7, cache on v6. Each is exercised by this very pull request, since\nthese are the workflows that run it, so a break shows up here rather than on\nsome later branch.\n\nupload-artifact goes with them even though no annotation names it, because it\nsits behind `if: failure()` in the e2e job and has never executed. Left on v4,\nit would break on the first red run — when the artifact it uploads is the\nPlaywright report someone needs to read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2d637f0811c63532e39798f07ad07efeda1f7c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/d2d637f0811c63532e39798f07ad07efeda1f7c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa","verification":{"payload":"tree d2d637f0811c63532e39798f07ad07efeda1f7c6\nparent 5bf3c559b7d8a4f6920dc0dc71ab587a97c1ba50\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1788810674 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788810674 -0300\n\nci: move the actions off Node 20 (#92)\n\nEvery run in this repository carries the same annotation: actions/checkout,\nactions/setup-node and actions/cache declare Node 20, which GitHub deprecated\nand now force-runs on Node 24 anyway. The forcing is the warning''s point — it\nis a compatibility shim with an end date, not a permanent arrangement.\n\nThe majors are further ahead than the v4 pins suggest: checkout and setup-node\nare on v7, cache on v6. Each is exercised by this very pull request, since\nthese are the workflows that run it, so a break shows up here rather than on\nsome later branch.\n\nupload-artifact goes with them even though no annotation names it, because it\nsits behind `if: failure()` in the e2e job and has never executed. Left on v4,\nit would break on the first red run — when the artifact it uploads is the\nPlaywright report someone needs to read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnxWyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxhkQADpuFwsfFhgNoCdB9nLkyd6w\nL+7MA/5wdeLA2W0BtDjMVMIC0/wJzdB5v/pwoHrOmIMaE+2cjbOH3K1UoPCJEul0\n3hrgfj/zCpxbYLqGrPAjZYYH7hr28Sd6Y+qAX7IE1V6tWARqQcWj739zplTbijMf\nSQ8IlSv9dUwRNHYB4feroKYG+xZPNX/hymQKRakpO//cibfTvSHTR5gxYVgkMnMA\n+U3++sk4weYaWKOUa9Y6LWdynfdXUYWLhVTbqUXmY6ZejMehK/JAVYmyVUzEIlrK\nr6J2RWr5L3UIcj9iQq44wOJvIkIGQttyregfOvNVlWCXyJ5TOkH4Tvis9Lp37OCR\nkXFwsiHlLkEzDXFHqXArSS7Gdle7c0CGl1dMpJlNMCxLjA8RAt/+R/96EkZV3lP4\nYIVe4Q75hJElkkHK9mBNSeQaUebGN0lMyJNmCHQ8iGvZh1Dybxohhz91B3bKGG2l\nlfE0IdJvuHaI4CV9IySdgHF7r5uWEAgpQZgK2yItMp7KCAnMLQv8Ds0JsWCT7GQ0\nIMIJzJ/dNrn0Dlo9eMp2AtoNtzecHOHm8dLg2ojbnve0ro++/PumTKVohqlttl6q\nUCLtOblJfWKaItZKFa8ch97FYMm5gUV4fAyHQmThBGEUbcK/gkF0TeMIxiZos71i\n6Kz+TDlLScMUY1eI9Ggm\n=aB4b\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-07T19:51:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa","node_id":"C_kwDOTOZb-9oAKDI4NmM0ODUwNDAwYTgxMDIzNmMxNmIxNmJjMjUyNjkxZTFmYzhlYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/5bf3c559b7d8a4f6920dc0dc71ab587a97c1ba50","sha":"5bf3c559b7d8a4f6920dc0dc71ab587a97c1ba50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/5bf3c559b7d8a4f6920dc0dc71ab587a97c1ba50"}],"sha":"286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/286c4850400a810236c16b16bc252691e1fc8eaa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/5bf3c559b7d8a4f6920dc0dc71ab587a97c1ba50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:50:42Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T12:50:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: move shadcn to devDependencies (#91)\n\nshadcn is a code generator, not a library. Nothing imports it — the only\ntrace of it outside package.json is components.json, the config it reads\nwhen invoked as `npx shadcn add`. Sitting in `dependencies` it still\ndragged its whole CLI tree into the production install: @babel/core,\nexpress, @modelcontextprotocol/sdk and @dotenvx/dotenvx among them.\n\nMeasured from the lockfile, the production tree drops from 620 packages\nto 322 — 48% — with the total unchanged at 1112, since nothing is\nremoved, only reclassified. That is what `npm ci --omit=dev` installs in\nany consumer of this package, and what a container image built the usual\nway would carry.\n\nIt also shrinks what a production advisory has to be judged against: all\nthree packages flagged in the previous audit failure (browserslist, qs,\nfast-uri) reached the tree through shadcn or secretlint and are now\nmarked dev-only in the lockfile. They still get audited — npm audit\ncovers devDependencies too — but a future finding in one of them is now\nvisibly build-time, not shipped.\n\nThe Vercel build is unaffected: it installs devDependencies, as does\n`npm ci` in CI. Verified with lint, unit tests, a full build with route\nstrategies unchanged, and `npx shadcn --version`.","tree":{"sha":"799d18976fa8aff226b950fec5332992d3d9ad98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/799d18976fa8aff226b950fec5332992d3d9ad98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/5bf3c559b7d8a4f6920dc0dc71ab587a97c1ba50","verification":{"payload":"tree 799d18976fa8aff226b950fec5332992d3d9ad98\nparent 153297f615bc4b57ccfc92f836767a1abce8a1aa\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1788785442 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788785442 -0300\n\nchore: move shadcn to devDependencies (#91)\n\nshadcn is a code generator, not a library. Nothing imports it — the only\ntrace of it outside package.json is components.json, the config it reads\nwhen invoked as `npx shadcn add`. Sitting in `dependencies` it still\ndragged its whole CLI tree into the production install: @babel/core,\nexpress, @modelcontextprotocol/sdk and @dotenvx/dotenvx among them.\n\nMeasured from the lockfile, the production tree drops from 620 packages\nto 322 — 48% — with the total unchanged at 1112, since nothing is\nremoved, only reclassified. That is what `npm ci --omit=dev` installs in\nany consumer of this package, and what a container image built the usual\nway would carry.\n\nIt also shrinks what a production advisory has to be judged against: all\nthree packages flagged in the previous audit failure (browserslist, qs,\nfast-uri) reached the tree through shadcn or secretlint and are now\nmarked dev-only in the lockfile. They still get audited — npm audit\ncovers devDependencies too — but a future finding in one of them is now\nvisibly build-time, not shipped.\n\nThe Vercel build is unaffected: it installs devDependencies, as does\n`npm ci` in CI. Verified with lint, unit tests, a full build with route\nstrategies unchanged, and `npx shadcn --version`.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnrMiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADs4QADS5pP/3lDlNVWJtFeB//WJt\nN/20nY/LRUILpP3y+4v4F6nXLUmR3ereQ7YJO3lLT17mbpvLMH2/O1rdjx134Gyu\n+eqlv6rLZuucr+5jME7ZlcOHZh5IjXRo8fo0wsmnWB4Ky4hFWDuguimQgFbeiwWP\n+CpFTWSBQKNimTaRRUkbpVinIZuzGZsN4cehyqOSX+ANyAeeB4oVJynyNY9BNJPu\naKY3kkuP8yjeaK6jqUL/ePZzbTOInJOPjWTg7IuMN4OgKNvnw+byzEKtYMiqH08k\n297hQ7tW7/DFhsPm/NTHXYtL0pYGio6VVMAnt2AqNVQMY2A3Yu6+uKt/UuGpKOs2\n6b2vdhoVFcagc1UZkD6wZy9lzg6gmpwn3nbU7PabE8MUsPdsYR0pGMjYyxO6ZvbS\nCRg5N+r41XPXOv3H9ZxySn0BFYT1n5VFlk8fXo6lUUyGVIT8hNIEPemxXC99h6gm\nROcXEOhdlGxkEUnj0LI3YOFQTsLCeT+s+6eMlf3pSa7ZyiAHgUoNqp8aO11rVI1Z\nAh+2ZT3m35+CEd1u/