"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/1fe54226c1d803621837957023a117a32699fd70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:43:13Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T19:43:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: keep agent instructions and docs out of the public repo (#79)\n\nCLAUDE.md, .claude/CLAUDE.md and docs/ are now gitignored and untracked, and\nAGENTS.md is deleted. They stay on disk; they stop being published.\n\nAGENTS.md was a nine-line stub: a Next.js version warning that CLAUDE.md\nalready states in its own words, plus a pointer to .claude/CLAUDE.md. Nothing\nwas lost by merging it. What did need correcting is that CLAUDE.md called\nAGENTS.md \"the canonical, exhaustive AI-agent rules doc\" and told readers it\nwins on disagreement — a claim about a stub. The exhaustive doc is, and was,\n.claude/CLAUDE.md; CLAUDE.md now says so. The `@../AGENTS.md` import at the\ntop of .claude/CLAUDE.md pointed at the file being deleted and is gone.\n\nLanguageSwitcher.tsx explained a cache-keying decision by deferring to a note\nin CLAUDE.md, which readers of this repository will no longer have. The\ncomment now states the reason itself: the (blog) route group''s shared layout\nrenders the component above the page, so it survives /blog/[slug] navigations.\n\nNot covered here, and it cannot be: docs/rendering-strategies.md and the six\ncomments that cite it live on the #78 branch, not on main. They need the same\ntreatment once #78 merges.","tree":{"sha":"e3d32f5cb0873b488173f2b2c6e9388ece655f28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/e3d32f5cb0873b488173f2b2c6e9388ece655f28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/1fe54226c1d803621837957023a117a32699fd70","verification":{"payload":"tree e3d32f5cb0873b488173f2b2c6e9388ece655f28\nparent f20321996f0bf5eebfaec02e9230c103e9c0b6d4\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1787168593 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787168593 -0300\n\nchore: keep agent instructions and docs out of the public repo (#79)\n\nCLAUDE.md, .claude/CLAUDE.md and docs/ are now gitignored and untracked, and\nAGENTS.md is deleted. They stay on disk; they stop being published.\n\nAGENTS.md was a nine-line stub: a Next.js version warning that CLAUDE.md\nalready states in its own words, plus a pointer to .claude/CLAUDE.md. Nothing\nwas lost by merging it. What did need correcting is that CLAUDE.md called\nAGENTS.md \"the canonical, exhaustive AI-agent rules doc\" and told readers it\nwins on disagreement — a claim about a stub. The exhaustive doc is, and was,\n.claude/CLAUDE.md; CLAUDE.md now says so. The `@../AGENTS.md` import at the\ntop of .claude/CLAUDE.md pointed at the file being deleted and is gone.\n\nLanguageSwitcher.tsx explained a cache-keying decision by deferring to a note\nin CLAUDE.md, which readers of this repository will no longer have. The\ncomment now states the reason itself: the (blog) route group''s shared layout\nrenders the component above the page, so it survives /blog/[slug] navigations.\n\nNot covered here, and it cannot be: docs/rendering-strategies.md and the six\ncomments that cite it live on the #78 branch, not on main. They need the same\ntreatment once #78 merges.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhgdRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8ykQAFqRD2j51ninn1FTlNwTXr4u\nssUbu0as1005QdTL/OLK/nkkpy6G+T+kPxLDA12bzyWyWNOF2yfRjgfdku34RbgP\nMd9uP80KH7FkxSyJJRPcgS/ZBiv+MlnnMq3rZQ8/gPVlKE6O8bjdoFXZAzL1XzQL\nUFMrkFujpi/V7jyVC7Q7lhgHGMmEX+11UT7h0ebzaXg5tOk69eSCaiTMxNHG1LS8\n6uGQSRIXQLY7ZtzgQZ4rQxdQy7k7ZM3yXUc8xrX9Etovc6ebnRgNAWRrof18sSGL\nQlLL9XX1iwhAI8zNek1NGxgNhQ621XeI/Q3fn1bekuoLDCEwZZ/zFiw2UsAhBD4x\nqDTa+366P+uyP0AQUrWAfUcDhuPfDaHPFAKp/hUvybJAqatt71BnTstnh9Vchf+n\noWv4+SAJ77mtk3euuY7COCgDek7B6crWzaerzBukMXdU/jwJHPsLsh+g94KUzP2q\nNmOSy7IDpINpvHa2BwVXFzouaJkTY2qeCD4A1Ju+F+yyhYZsqmKKz25Du1I3MuBJ\nYHq6NSy8C0rEhlG7Ua9ep/XP0IGHe8rzxo5gyp7xNjHiUTdg55TUywNR93IKCYvI\nx5eUaMsqZbxpAr9q4FfwoNW9hrARnjyb3pPfnPcwQ9IqX3E7qtk4PNsj3Fu433Xy\nIs3KdtsplVZv/AoSTB/i\n=S0+Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-19T19:43:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow",