elcsantana/vertex-web/commits/55e5b5f0b40fec0fa8705e211190584ef6255e41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:15:58Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:15:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add an explicit draft/publish toggle and honor the real publish date (#74)\n\nReplace the single \"publish now\" checkbox in the post editor with two\nmutually-exclusive buttons (\"publish now\" / \"save as draft\"), matching\nvertex-api''s new publishedAt field: a draft no longer has its creation\ndate masquerade as its publish date once it eventually goes live. The\npost page and home listing now display publishedAt (falling back to\ncreatedAt for posts published before this field existed) instead of\ncreatedAt everywhere a \"published on\" date is shown.","tree":{"sha":"c2d77757e4bb35fd5cfcc2c41bd2da4b0afc246e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/c2d77757e4bb35fd5cfcc2c41bd2da4b0afc246e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/55e5b5f0b40fec0fa8705e211190584ef6255e41","verification":{"payload":"tree c2d77757e4bb35fd5cfcc2c41bd2da4b0afc246e\nparent b0f01dfe737ba01098dbda1d0c1d39c5c5bf7362\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1785176158 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785176158 -0300\n\nfeat: add an explicit draft/publish toggle and honor the real publish date (#74)\n\nReplace the single \"publish now\" checkbox in the post editor with two\nmutually-exclusive buttons (\"publish now\" / \"save as draft\"), matching\nvertex-api''s new publishedAt field: a draft no longer has its creation\ndate masquerade as its publish date once it eventually goes live. The\npost page and home listing now display publishedAt (falling back to\ncreatedAt for posts published before this field existed) instead of\ncreatedAt everywhere a \"published on\" date is shown.","reason":"valid",