ngrid stretch + sm:h-full/aspect-auto, cropped with object-cover. The\nadmin-only edit/delete controls sat in normal flex flow in the text\ncolumn, and opacity-0 still reserves layout space, so the row (and\ntherefore the cover crop) ended up taller only for admins. Making the\ncontrols an absolutely positioned overlay removes them from the flow\nso the image renders identically for admins and anonymous visitors.","tree":{"sha":"79d015a537a11919eaf654aa32292320dcb4ce67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/79d015a537a11919eaf654aa32292320dcb4ce67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/b0f01dfe737ba01098dbda1d0c1d39c5c5bf7362","verification":{"payload":"tree 79d015a537a11919eaf654aa32292320dcb4ce67\nparent 22877ec65a2a0b2c437dc94cf540df45255fca4d\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1785173568 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785173568 -0300\n\nfix: stop admin edit/delete overlay from reflowing the featured post''s cover image (#73)\n\nThe featured card''s cover image stretches to match its row height via\ngrid stretch + sm:h-full/aspect-auto, cropped with object-cover. The\nadmin-only edit/delete controls sat in normal flex flow in the text\ncolumn, and opacity-0 still reserves layout space, so the row (and\ntherefore the cover crop) ended up taller only for admins. Making the\ncontrols an absolutely positioned overlay removes them from the flow\nso the image renders identically for admins and anonymous visitors.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZ5ZACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOXwQACe/Ns7cP7RvM412QeGm1Dzk\nuHb74Yzxzp/gf6EdILkPbU9aG/fN+gwcscHxU9fErgPMUrRWAmgXvRsy6DTdZLja\nawgEnyCE9oM27cUPkii+V1R+5CoPBhI5kGeSTHeu4B2lehTBv70wGfm/piX9mVgT\nCouLfk7EDtmRWqPPuR726qJDzYQKeFHMSedV/TO8iRcxeFyjPVwDbH+JrHCKX4N8\n0iZArunvgos9AvxnfPEFiqKf80+p+P03tdvL36XS3LKqWlVluHVc6BAQ0mK32h/m\nFtS1cCFu2IQKU/CrpDFCFo8TQskEhCbxGx+oz476MSK+Mb9Rjopro8lOMk3P4+Nd\nPDss1et