e":"2026-07-25T14:05:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add profile header with photo and social links to the About page (#68)\n\n/about is the page ranking for \"samuel santana dev\" searches, but had no\nphoto and only plain-text GitHub/LinkedIn/email links buried at the end of\nthe article. Adds an AboutProfileHeader card (avatar, name, tagline, and\nicon links with rel=\"me\") above the Markdown content, reusing the same\nSOCIAL_PROFILES source as the footer and the Person JSON-LD sameAs.","tree":{"sha":"883853d23dbe6214385d3158b42bb44dc0cf4fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/883853d23dbe6214385d3158b42bb44dc0cf4fb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/c8aadbdc061f6fb205497179eb9b2b73d726de86","verification":{"payload":"tree 883853d23dbe6214385d3158b42bb44dc0cf4fb9\nparent 57258efde9bf46ad69815c9b3d95286163e83540\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1784988308 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784988308 -0300\n\nfeat: add profile header with photo and social links to the About page (#68)\n\n/about is the page ranking for \"samuel santana dev\" searches, but had no\nphoto and only plain-text GitHub/LinkedIn/email links buried at the end of\nthe article. Adds an AboutProfileHeader card (avatar, name, tagline, and\nicon links with rel=\"me\") above the Markdown content, reusing the same\nSOCIAL_PROFILES source as the footer and the Person JSON-LD sameAs.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZMKUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqmcQAFiWuxWGUvJFIxTpi4zAKKjT\nQgXEEGaBqe60+DJf0MwO099W5zZShki5kkjlwXthXnaGDZ0MZeVROK0QqGw4tCmX\nfnXryI58RPKZaOAI5tbs8sqrG/dEvxXNClHx3UtgKZcH6Uc0ntvX1MhY8WrxCeop\nQUJ8fKpFMNIwxpG5iFY2bmP+5DByl91aZzwe10DDnCyhI4CgKSP8egpgDPnvQxCS\nzN5qObaUiw6Pju6mowIM0S3teEJOxdPj8x9Xs0WwJPKgt0Ho1TaAgq9dzm7HyTWc\nsIVv0nX2aTYWCPrVBrjtLAnxLcEeKCux1Y40jR2R9it1Pc7NOi2DIHAyMMSTeicK\nD0zoZ1pKK8d6UZ7Xc+EMDQN0Mq