thor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/57258efde9bf46ad69815c9b3d95286163e83540/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T13:15:33Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T13:15:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add Person sameAs schema and rel=me social links for entity disambiguation (#67)\n\nGoogle was surfacing a different person''s GitHub profile for \"samuel santana dev\"\nsearches since nothing tied this site to the real github.com/samuelcsantana or\nLinkedIn profile. Adds sameAs to the existing Person JSON-LD (post pages and a\nnew one on /about, the page currently ranking) and reciprocal rel=\"me\" links in\nthe footer, matching the rel=\"me\" GitHub already emits on the profile website\nfield.","tree":{"sha":"c4a23f86c744c73d2851d1336dcce760515a6650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/c4a23f86c744c73d2851d1336dcce760515a6650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/57258efde9bf46ad69815c9b3d95286163e83540","verification":{"payload":"tree c4a23f86c744c73d2851d1336dcce760515a6650\nparent 18b99bb8543a5419e2f08e3fe1bedbb59dd2f4a4\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1784985333 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784985333 -0300\n\nfeat: add Person sameAs schema and rel=me social links for entity disambiguation (#67)\n\nGoogle was surfacing a different person''s GitHub profile for \"samuel santana dev\"\nsearches since nothing tied this site to the real github.com/samuelcsantana or\nLinkedIn profile. Adds sameAs to the existing Person JSON-LD (post pages and a\nnew one on /about, the page currently ranking) and reciprocal rel=\"me\" links in\nthe footer, matching the rel=\"me\" GitHub already emits on the profile website\nfield.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZLb1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjW0QABAppnglwLhYLxa6Rdy+Wz3K\n/1MPyYjSTGJxNteTdKxDum8mqDyLZD1CjyHGk26se8m8RGPtGfHsNkTZ4+QB+LZ2\neNk+x6AU3jIlKdkKgFzpZjheezRbQz4wXP2MUk6SVeG2m5zZjWTGCSqx5H4GXYPy\n5JntUCa/gQSWne8aKo9GY6R6uvidv9p2N86WMevwtQ4/u9hxqW+k7+mU+qxqfHk2\n2Pz0t+6GvG80FBnJ9aevTunYzexsaajkQyY4p9nPVOal3e66vZ4kxpdrkktYdVu9\nx9meZEyPNkQ+2WFihhArab039nemCzoSDG1UdJBkgjBzkxpMjpiGx+UZ43QuZJ0j\nIRQ5vhHDcD7K3DqX2BB+RtoruZGyFDcm0CqaG5CV+iJgK/B3dV/rue0IZAEmfQ30\nIFnUObzEEuOnXhiWFnkH348ofDYme6AAJ8SLRU4QXDqxbbaF95bICEClSNJQO3ma\npONlXNP6RkuBOpDubeIKesjofb49Q1kCiQoJwkU0hgfnrEmzbwAHVXFs0GuXNcLa\ntzPkDkk64c0Z2EqH4EpXs33abQUrTjkijReMm4J80bErHmJf1fXmKcjfnzlHLPPH\nySIX2pbJU0Ik9YC/BgUXj7XMMXi274BMqLr2ARqJO0dKr5oG8PQfMelc57BSwU0X\nggNwX/RPKdACWPGT6RwD\n=b7fT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T13:15:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/57258efde9bf46ad69815c9b3d95286163e83540","node_id":"C_kwDOTOZb-9oAKDU3MjU4ZWZkZTliZjQ2YWQ2OTgxNWM5YjNkOTUyODYxNjNlODM1NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/18b99bb8543a5419e2f08e3fe1bedbb59dd2f4a4","sha":"18b99bb8543a5419e2f08e3fe1bedbb59dd2f4a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/18b99bb8543a5419e2f08e3fe1bedbb59dd2f4a4"}],"sha":"57258efde9bf46ad69815c9b3d95286163e83540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/57258efde9bf46ad69815c9b3d95286163e83540"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/18b99bb8543a5419e2f08e3fe1bedbb59dd2f4a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T00:59:39Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T00:59:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: patch high-severity dependency vulnerabilities from npm audit (#66)\n\nBump next to 16.2.11, fixing 9 CVEs (SSRF in Server Actions and\nrewrites, middleware/proxy bypass, cache confusion, DoS, and\nunauthenticated Server Function endpoint disclosure). Override\nnext''s bundled postcss/sharp to patched versions (XSS/path-traversal\nin postcss, libvips CVEs in sharp) since next itself hasn''t bumped\nthose pins yet, and override minimatch to a version whose own\nbrace-expansion dependency is patched, closing a DoS advisory that\nwas otherwise unfixable without an eslint major bump.\n\nVerified npm run lint, npm run test, and npm run build all still\npass. The remaining 3 moderate findings (shadcn''s bundled MCP SDK/\nHono dev server, Windows-only path traversal) are in a dev-only CLI\ntool not part of the runtime bundle, and sit below the Security\nworkflow''s --audit-level=high gate.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"aff80c6c4465795f6bcfaacac03c88c84165581e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/aff80c6c4465795f6bcfaacac03c88c84165581e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/18b99bb8543a5419e2f08e3fe1bedbb59dd2f4a4","verification":{"payload":"tree aff80c6c4465795f6bcfaacac03c88c84165581e\nparent 3dd900bab52c093f2c4a95f4f461bb0f370976e3\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1784941179 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784941179 -0300\n\nfix: patch high-severity dependency vulnerabilities from npm audit (#66)\n\nBump next to 16.2.11, fixing 9 CVEs (SSRF in Server Actions and\nrewrites, middleware/proxy bypass, cache confusion, DoS, and\nunauthenticated Server Function endpoint disclosure). Override\nnext''s bundled postcss/sharp to patched versions (XSS/path-traversal\nin postcss, libvips CVEs in sharp) since next itself hasn''t bumped\nthose pins yet, and override minimatch to a version whose own\nbrace-expansion dependency is patched, closing a DoS advisory that\nwas otherwise unfixable without an eslint major bump.\n\nVerified npm run lint, npm run test, and npm run build all still\npass. The remaining 3 moderate findings (shadcn''s bundled MCP SDK/\nHono dev server, Windows-only path traversal) are in a dev-only CLI\ntool not part of the runtime bundle, and sit below the Security\nworkflow''s --audit-level=high gate.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZAp7CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATZkQAKm4VbDVPiC7DDqzhEu/y2PU\noBYRJzl+mOLsnI0k6slaIKoqwvRgDvevR4qxs7Lp8xxxycJ6bkFxRfFf5mKuReXO\nEJfENa8YRfYHMpHPKX4g6O1WrBV1eIzxpJ6YUf8SoGP4N/SmnX0jKo8Ya7UjJR61\nHbVYWo3P6SoWZpW5A7ubrEvydWRgAVB29EkAFCntckcqKwsOOvXMLh4Vg+Q2UFPu\n3szBFOMLGDenzxrPZ5x7VEodXMHKLXW4CpIAv17ZekR3WsWSqKd8hQCGkPKCH8Se\nE591viUzcQNXuNy1c9RQlkHlcqGIOfR+ZV9rRbXTmHSBIoLEMUsZ/Lyv9NMTMz0k\nFF7yMIJ12HwVYAjjoikUTvcy1Lt5sjDyUptTSEtR4J3EmDpxXEQ73HH4VVTgQnAL\nub4hK7vSZtGFmBXchU7wnna42KBj/Y7oZLOXK7JcLwQ3UKpa9muzMEipqwCM1bhC\nN58EG8tC5Ps3N09GrJvkGUeNAGwPitjnBWHbknttcevdHy2/6Z/285IRcAAg02eI\nPZRy959iA+pVHALYfvp+HO4QCQdNnlvhoVaQXi3N1fsTdKQ0gzMkweo3HUBnKcVH\n63UsDWZP941CzldFVDA+EpPowFphJU3ZLZhnX4t2rrvM1D9ioi