owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/3dd900bab52c093f2c4a95f4f461bb0f370976e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T00:18:30Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T00:18:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: raise next/image quality for post covers to avoid gradient banding (#65)\n\nDefault quality (75) visibly bands and flattens covers built on smooth,\ndark gradients. Bumping CoverImage''s bucket-served covers to 90 keeps the\nresize/AVIF/WebP re-encode benefit while fixing the visible quality loss;\nqualities: [75, 90] in next.config.ts is required by Next 16 to allow the\nextra value without affecting the rest of the site''s default.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73dbeaf567279e6569efdb28b6cb5412c0827ff4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/73dbeaf567279e6569efdb28b6cb5412c0827ff4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/3dd900bab52c093f2c4a95f4f461bb0f370976e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 73dbeaf567279e6569efdb28b6cb5412c0827ff4\nparent 1377cb45aa4b369cb4f9013c6449d20399d8eae5\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1784938710 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784938710 -0300\n\nfix: raise next/image quality for post covers to avoid gradient banding (#65)\n\nDefault quality (75) visibly bands and flattens covers built on smooth,\ndark gradients. Bumping CoverImage''s bucket-served covers to 90 keeps the\nresize/AVIF/WebP re-encode benefit while fixing the visible quality loss;\nqualities: [75, 90] in next.config.ts is required by Next 16 to allow the\nextra value without affecting the rest of the site''s default.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZADWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABMQQAKSmyRbOCiogQtOl4F237TGb\nOiZmdb4jXOa0cLVbMT7TXpp2xPkvRY4xO3gBwBfcDRYSShSgVB9v5pA7nypiW+ib\nsVuSxIGja+NaVGrAD7itE5VgB0oy7+2LY5kZJTpKijSM4N5X5PD38lW+H3Q0yUBj\n1ktAMGfI5s4wG+8PfiS1wy6MTlmrtsQLQvcedkEZ6gBGyDZZQf1x0gzueMBJHPE4\nxGr1sRHXcgGO2VwzsnH7n4Pzdw8aighMcSsg/ROaKY58Ta/DTzUNeYHBw4aVgTRK\nNlt0K40QgVNsCEylBN4NZxMM9YMUhSKq1RpmylF2OxiUHYZC38Vl8RmuustdqhOC\nSBL46QuY6MCxg4eddrdR7gtwRq8M9mI/J0esB4ppEUbOeZbwwVLI7bZGiFBLhcKr\nu+ME6iAjmxPV02LDhB46ebCRpi+DcIdgrVvlXwBfyRoO7Qt9oZnl21a7GZRRPuH+\nXLJlN1dCWHCr089zh5qse5dCQPgp0Pia3Tvte2cPzpxxSeokSx/VG3KNEJVryQ0C\nVZLw1V7vg5zxOdG10rsXKfG/WxkSnugD6V1zBytup5YtaUGxC46vyzsAzdbSBDO2\nXtiMeA6kcCIf9P37Cb5iaAhUqgpSaFULlpDBls/QWtKl58//VLvQwihoVzo4RVq3\nWJXwJJf2d3CX3LrcsvTP\n=ODn0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T00:18:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcj