"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/0272ccdc9fc0f47b5d38c6b7cab68e53640932fe","node_id":"C_kwDOTOZb-9oAKDAyNzJjY2RjOWZjMGY0N2I1ZDM4YzZiN2NhYjY4ZTUzNjQwOTMyZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743","sha":"3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743"}],"sha":"0272ccdc9fc0f47b5d38c6b7cab68e53640932fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/0272ccdc9fc0f47b5d38c6b7cab68e53640932fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T03:34:31Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T03:34:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve cross-locale post slugs instead of 404ing after locale-detection redirects (#52)\n\nA shared pt post link opened by a visitor whose browser prefers en/es\ngets re-prefixed by the locale-detection redirect without translating\nthe slug (/blog/<pt-slug> -> /en/blog/<pt-slug>), which 404ed for any\npost that has its own translated slug. The post page now retries the\nlookup under the other locales, renders the content the link promised\n(the slug''''s own language) with a notice linking to the visitor''''s\nlanguage version, and points canonical/JSON-LD at the rendered\ncontent''''s real URL. The header language switcher gets the same\ncross-locale retry so it no longer no-ops on these URLs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be1453c5e06de224650c3a8ee61006410aeecc5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/be1453c5e06de224650c3a8ee61006410aeecc5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743","verification":{"payload":"tree be1453c5e06de224650c3a8ee61006410aeecc5a\nparent 8f4b7633dad6762f678e5695c81c1a602fa79105\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783654471 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783654471 -0300\n\nfix: resolve cross-locale post slugs instead of 404ing after locale-detection redirects (#52)\n\nA shared pt post link opened by a visitor whose browser prefers en/es\ngets re-prefixed by the locale-detection redirect without translating\nthe slug (/blog/<pt-slug> -> /en/blog/<pt-slug>), which 404ed for any\npost that has its own translated slug. The post page now retries the\nlookup under the other locales, renders the content the link promised\n(the slug''''s own language) with a notice linking to the visitor''''s\nlanguage version, and points canonical/JSON-LD at the rendered\ncontent''''s real URL. The header language switcher gets the same\ncross-locale retry so it no longer no-ops on these URLs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUGhHCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA+NkQABhIVNgS+csU6JFiEhcj7pJF\naOA3GOgTsSR+ISmEKfhN2M0Fer9BVbzMw13Nh6tzybNBwGS4De6KDdQXtgCmb+Y9\nHKB3avz29p8LNVsjI+dkLS3LY7/tjeTD0rJNeep1UCs0WLJwm746R7IgTG0qFIkP\nsexqbQXNCxf72J2bQksfpha6rlZLms9NZrJ9e0i3dVQLV5IBKW9qCj2DPl6Kdfa8\n7LAOWtdNSZxiEIBn80uqDjjlTnlFnKbEGtPSmd0EwXWy0stEUrIlk1dP9n66Z8Xj\nfuzRGj9bXJubjtmuwGlqICK1o/3kuCKqbuzPxOs5PcGk7vEvxqbO6rS+aJsqo2LU\nXXohrTucjhLOyjmnaIBB5XYkxBGHJ2LPd9818lZfgibcfaor/QyFcT22ATBTwV1B\nHIhI6sBbmJrRhbIWLeDtpXann4/p51j4d388AVkXjd6zK9XKzcPsx0lpuvAXXYFS\nIWzryKcAh9SwGz6QD/YsnNPi/Us2Bplw6tB+axtTu6jt52vmQuDg69A5vRB9B7ci\nMONx0EBGE/FCao4FRbRqyIlYT4KhLKVOpRh66mUfdTDcwJsUMYZVHbq8ohhxDoea\nRJwMoNUZQ6ZYIGi0shltCwYTNI5EnxpN0N/zcm4sNtbij0cJzpWpDmE9LCsU7F0F\nF7se5LdiHF5fi2+S0szy\n=5MJ/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-10T03:34:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743","node_id":"C_kwDOTOZb-9oAKDMzMTg5NThlYzU4OTE1MTMzYjIxMDEzNWEyNTliYzdjMDJmYzc3NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/8f4b7633dad6762f678e5695c81c1a602fa79105","sha":"8f4b7633dad6762f678e5695c81c1a602fa79105","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/8f4b7633dad6762f678e5695c81c1a602fa79105"}],"sha":"3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/3318958ec58915133b210135a259bc7c02fc7743"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/8f4b7633dad6762f678e5695c81c1a602fa79105/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T19:42:22Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T19:42:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: keep language visible in the mobile header, move account actions into the menu (#51)\n\nOn phones the language switcher is what a foreign visitor needs\nimmediately, while login is a rare action (and the comments section\nhas its own login button) — the previous layout had it backwards.\nThe switcher now collapses to the current locale''s flag with a\ndropdown of options below md (one responsive component, so the\npost-slug fetch isn''t duplicated), and the header''s rightSlot\n(login trigger / account actions) hides below md in favor of\nLogin / Profile / Sign out entries inside the hamburger menu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8301b2fbf8e2f21f344042757056f46425095f96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/8301b2fbf8e2f21f344042757056f46425095f96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/8f4b7633dad6762f678e5695c81c1a602fa79105","verification":{"payload":"tree 8301b2fbf8e2f21f344042757056f46425095f96\nparent afe4343ef344e3900b3891ea16f38fc324d1a299\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783626142 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783626142 -0300\n\nfeat: keep language visible in the mobile header, move account actions into the menu (#51)\n\nOn phones the language switcher is what a foreign visitor needs\nimmediately, while login is a rare action (and the comments section\nhas its own login button) — the previous layout had it backwards.\nThe switcher now collapses to the current locale''s flag with a\ndropdown of options below md (one responsive component, so the\npost-slug fetch isn''t duplicated), and the header''s rightSlot\n(login trigger / account actions) hides below md in favor of\nLogin / Profile / Sign out entries inside the hamburger menu.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude F