ield icon and the modal said \"Admin\nAccess\" / \"Sign in to manage the blog''s articles\", but any visitor\ncan sign in (e.g. to comment) — admin is a role resolved after\nlogin, not the login''s purpose. Swap the icon for LogIn and reword\nthe modal title/subtitle in all three locales around commenting.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f5099f1d0bbc781e5f8ea5c0cad28e3d56801d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/2f5099f1d0bbc781e5f8ea5c0cad28e3d56801d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/afe4343ef344e3900b3891ea16f38fc324d1a299","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f5099f1d0bbc781e5f8ea5c0cad28e3d56801d4\nparent 9583cdb5b7a4048d8634ae15092171f7f7cd5e94\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783625356 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783625356 -0300\n\nfix: reframe the login trigger and modal as general sign-in, not admin access (#50)\n\nThe header trigger used a Shield icon and the modal said \"Admin\nAccess\" / \"Sign in to manage the blog''s articles\", but any visitor\ncan sign in (e.g. to comment) — admin is a role resolved after\nlogin, not the login''s purpose. Swap the icon for LogIn and reword\nthe modal title/subtitle in all three locales around commenting.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqT/aMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAshAQAJju6FFnvoguhZFgHUeT39EZ\nrz1IikykOD+6XFPA8sXwwJuSV4nO+kA2fdDM3fBW703C5ER74IofpGU5HyaPEBxM\n7L+6jB6gsNW7wcC4n0VpvtYNGXCbx1Dknoi2VHAw1QieWnNec4eZUxXQwrr9p8wG\nvumIOpzHm37Dk/cqIrBQQnRqjTHjP0Bh6HNqTG/GyKypsxoWnBXW0+JFzFgjcN12\nveazukc0DuZrKioMJLv5yXFsLTNSBhFYloFCtNoGiWJj7EpUpaARzYLYZresr5Fp\nGSwSmof/nDqMFpwiQIQ+rSdApWDD+8c1J5GCmlB1EY02GXBF6bt6j4D+edYetFHv\nn6mfDV1Hy5BzfxcrCXlRk9+0pQ66idXB4d1K0tFK/j2i8PMHrW45CXVCUHxlzEtw\niybm0gh+KcUQGQfcSz/0zTavKi+mGaXf+Yuu0vc6ueWJX/AO7Agih2asuOKCs3Ul\nogjDwp5Ktdb/ydhd2EQ1KYlMR3