01ac65e6039c6239048759fbec1d22364efe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/d3b5c5881c02a5d631bf4575d8f8cf013434e619/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:02:01Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T23:02:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: make meta description per-locale, like title/content/slug (#38)\n\nmetaDescription was a single field shared across pt/en/es — a reader\nviewing a post in English or Spanish saw the admin''s Portuguese-written\nsearch snippet in Google/Twitter regardless of the page''s actual\nlanguage, hurting SEO language signals and click-through rate for\nnon-pt readers.\n\nAdds metaDescriptionEn/metaDescriptionEs (matching vertex-api PR #13),\nmoves the \"Meta Description (SEO)\" field into CreatePostForm/\nEditPostForm''s per-language tab system (same persistent-input-per-\nlanguage pattern already used for title/slug/content, to avoid the\ndata-loss bug that pattern was introduced to fix), and adds\ngetLocalizedMetaDescription to localized-content.ts.\n\nDeliberately does NOT fall back to another locale''s hand-written text\nthe way title/slug/content do — a locale without its own override\nfalls through to an auto-generated excerpt of that locale''s own\n(possibly itself pt-fallback) content instead, since a stale\ncross-locale SEO blurb could describe different words than what''s\nactually rendered on the page.","tree":{"sha":"2eaaee637ad273c8f8d754ed22eabec861fd27c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/2eaaee637ad273c8f8d754ed22eabec861fd27c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/d3b5c5881c02a5d631bf4575d8f8cf013434e619","verification":{"payload":"tree 2eaaee637ad273c8f8d754ed22eabec861fd27c7\nparent dbbf07bb11c673b8030a7ac3d85f2f1bff7c3cfb\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783551721 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783551721 -0300\n\nfeat: make meta description per-locale, like title/content/slug (#38)\n\nmetaDescription was a single field shared across pt/en/es — a reader\nviewing a post in English or Spanish saw the admin''s Portuguese-written\nsearch snippet in Google/Twitter regardless of the page''s actual\nlanguage, hurting SEO language signals and click-through rate for\nnon-pt readers.\n\nAdds metaDescriptionEn/metaDescriptionEs (matching vertex-api PR #13),\nmoves the \"Meta Description (SEO)\" field into CreatePostForm/\nEditPostForm''s per-language tab system (same persistent-input-per-\nlanguage pattern already used for title/slug/content, to avoid the\ndata-loss bug that pattern was introduced to fix), and adds\ngetLocalizedMetaDescription to localized-content.ts.\n\nDeliberately does NOT fall back to another locale''s hand-written text\nthe way title/slug/content do — a locale without its own override\nfalls through to an auto-generated excerpt of that locale''s own\n(possibly itself pt-fallback) content instead, since a stale\ncross-locale SEO blurb could describe different words than what''s\nactually rendered on the page.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTtbpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqicQAAh8/kT7QxOpMFW/za2CnPv9\njaH4l5/wITdiePlJjpQoGiXl71LShHuBrO6uK9qmJ7G8oTS8jT/b4V3rATaPnq1/\n8q8p+c8kzrDgMbR2VenDky7sfUS0lssGWfDubnAZUPUrAyJMQmW0aTvNOA9iLrbO\nvyFyM5GqjJA47K0az6XnxRaODnNVpVevuIn1uhoddAktKpXItSxL6V+UrkEI589O\n2Ci2IUqJiO5ZjAtELFEjrNtg5QMNHj8v1btq04MUlY2ggWhSaDXyAryz9ux5H2tw\nzrQzOpiIQhYmMAV2itFhdePQossg/0FtjiUtArgjvq/bSDZSsDu9jORMRhcKh8AY\nDyO6o6kHzw0r4xkElxJsYIQc8C4MedpduK3j7CDnchwO96c7hH9Qw43RF2KlMDHL\ne1O7VVnh1LNcxRR8i49AsDiBoXdSUgoAbKFGJ1Hgj/PmJf2OXR44TgoMWvduhM2d\nHBZwmSlRKyj2eaqRTGa0idPXi8/Nt5wdktytnKmFIvzAxCzdtgzsONc0GyJ2VtZt\n3kFWPyepSi6il6qIzjJT+55cofERs/SLa2kjeXh3WNGJEhFvTB7fcH8Nmn0Gbdqn\npVOdJ6gOdv6uqsizrf+111qhuvDwZyyejdd28qolmE5PTowbiDtp0XaKwnfHAulY\nbm9iKfu8+rBTJEDhgAix\n=T6wT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T23:02:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.git