ail":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: show a fallback notice when a post has no translation for the current locale (#37)\n\nSwitching language on a post with no translation for the target locale\nsilently rendered the pt content under that locale''s URL, with no\nindication to the reader why the text hadn''t changed. Adds a discrete\ncallout right below the title (reusing getTranslatedLocales, already\nused by sitemap.ts/generateMetadata to decide the same thing) telling\nthe reader this article isn''t translated yet and they''re seeing the\noriginal Portuguese version, instead of leaving them to guess.","tree":{"sha":"07f43021d31c4fea4c488d9b64f95325e6653548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/07f43021d31c4fea4c488d9b64f95325e6653548"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/dbbf07bb11c673b8030a7ac3d85f2f1bff7c3cfb","verification":{"payload":"tree 07f43021d31c4fea4c488d9b64f95325e6653548\nparent bab590538a1c9b591fbcb2952db87fe959052392\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783551694 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783551694 -0300\n\nfeat: show a fallback notice when a post has no translation for the current locale (#37)\n\nSwitching language on a post with no translation for the target locale\nsilently rendered the pt content under that locale''s URL, with no\nindication to the reader why the text hadn''t changed. Adds a discrete\ncallout right below the title (reusing getTranslatedLocales, already\nused by sitemap.ts/generateMetadata to decide the same thing) telling\nthe reader this article isn''t translated yet and they''re seeing the\noriginal Portuguese version, instead of leaving them to guess.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTtbOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASdwQAE/8tzIJcmco3+QcelyLZePS\nFhZVoZzeF0VpxyVCpIWcGqY/D3WJ5p5rAkrFc7fhA/NbYXNwhF9AY+mvSt4Gty6z\njJWNzo+/h5km2clAdH0f+9LX3mkR3Bca6+H6lDoqd6vV5gNlVOYXXMhTN