users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/c491006b79325964f3c9fb0620cb6b583fdba65c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:18:05Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T22:18:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: keep every language switcher option always clickable (#34)\n\nA prior change (#33) disabled a locale button whenever the current post\nhad no translated content for it, treating that as a way to avoid a\nconfusing \"page not found\"-adjacent experience. That was an\novercorrection: pt is a required field, and getLocalizedSlug/\ngetLocalizedContent already always fall back to it, so every locale\nwas already guaranteed to resolve to real, reachable content — clicking\ninto an untranslated locale was never actually broken, it just showed\nthe pt fallback under that locale''s URL, same as a direct visit to that\nURL already does. Blocking the click removed a working navigation path\nfor no correctness benefit, so every locale button is clickable again.","tree":{"sha":"51e0402d67cfe93b8a76ad4a77799fe687ff9ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/51e0402d67cfe93b8a76ad4a77799fe687ff9ee5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/c491006b79325964f3c9fb0620cb6b583fdba65c","verification":{"payload":"tree 51e0402d67cfe93b8a76ad4a77799fe687ff9ee5\nparent db20929d84db48fe7d62ddc94b1cf699d9578abc\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783549085 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783549085 -0300\n\nfix: keep every language switcher option always clickable (#34)\n\nA prior change (#33) disabled a locale button whenever the current post\nhad no translated content for it, treating that as a way to avoid a\nconfusing \"page not found\"-adjacent experience. That was an\novercorrection: pt is a required field, and getLocalizedSlug/\ngetLocalizedContent already always fall back to it, so every locale\nwas already guaranteed to resolve to real, reachable content — clicking\ninto an untranslated locale was never actually broken, it just showed\nthe pt fallback under that locale''s URL, same as a direct visit to that\nURL already does. Blocking the click removed a working navigation path\nfor no correctness benefit, so every locale button is clickable again.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTsydCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwgIQAEzdH86fenSEc5ROgURhwTeT\ni7c73QBw7+UCVQ+aMbnqbzzVvki1oRbst91BOcUtKyNjlHISmiob6xtJ2bLvyQnR\nYRpxF3HTDoC0YuKtnhOpJ8/qFfJpr1f5xiQgH9kNAjjDLYuxgRM/VPAU2AhrRUgS\nMsOEU3ikpcTL83+IyUxYrNWGGaiULNzr+8igk8CBiTLwwGHE8vgrRpMkZglhe+a7\naErf3WwsNJyTyxWUcaYZ7hB3PUZuY+mq0aeaUwBQF8fx1LIiaL15ZhSu1hJJKtF4\nFZt/DC0Q7vJty/0D2/omlBSJakWYSQFbJx1KPGrC77f1d2t395J2tzn2kYrb4RAx\nn6yLOjkEsKd1tAIU2rx1L9UHjyQO8hk47KlT8zsjzASnmAlZa9N5gWBAJalfCXbB\n93a0oAWhG5xgWLmfrAFOFmeuzRx83/TThFLXUYcxCIUsokxar5mIp72heV7qg+/G\n3G53Ug1BN2lhkpvRK+MQklz1FqbNuI0QmWuxr3q6MSHEH1QTUX+cUKizgpW0EEOg\nxWi3uIiRSSDUKYZAwEkSBSKv8M3cFnAyglDqTWo7T8rCBnmc1WnpHxeRMJzboCyp\nvKeFoLF224fj9Ye0SPcxrBeWwp1G3x9FZ5VHP5aH4tO2swtkPIP489aXTcumh4pW\n/fQJQveyvB1elUfa/fQ6\n=DUWU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T22:18:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/c491006b79325964f3c9fb0620cb6b583fdba65c","node_id":"C_kwDOTOZb-9oAKGM0OTEwMDZiNzkzMjU5NjRmM2M5ZmIwNjIwY2I2YjU4M2ZkYmE2NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/db20929d84db48fe7d62ddc94b1cf699d9578abc","sha":"db20929d84db48fe7d62ddc94b1cf699d9578abc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/db20929d84db48fe7d62ddc94b1cf699d9578abc"}],"sha":"c491006b79325964f3c9fb0620cb6b583fdba65c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/c491006b79325964f3c9fb0620cb6b583fdba65c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/db20929d84db48fe7d62ddc94b1cf699d9578abc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T21:13:03Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T21:13:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: disable language switcher options a post has no translation for (#33)\n\nPreviously, switching to a locale a post had no content for silently\nfell back to the pt slug/content, which read to users as if the switch\njust didn''t work — clicking English/Spanish appeared to do nothing (or\nthe URL changed but the content and title stayed in Portuguese), and in\nedge cases the naive same-slug fallback could point at a URL that\ndidn''t actually resolve. The switcher now fetches the current post,\ndisables the locales it has no translated content for, and simply\nleaves the reader on the post they''re already viewing instead of\nnavigating anywhere.","tree":{"sha":"176902f4e7e80c5c9de9d4d1239843dc0fcaa6f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/176902f4e7e80c5c9de9d4d1239843dc0fcaa6f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/db20929d84db48fe7d62ddc94b1cf699d9578abc","verification":{"payload":"tr