om/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/fb08dd81f01a906ce3759127dc1df4c20241b983/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:01:59Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T19:01:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: support a per-locale slug and full Spanish content for posts (#26)\n\nCompanion to vertex-api''s per-locale slug support. A post''s en/es\nversion can now have its own SEO-friendly slug instead of sharing the\npt one, and Spanish gets full title/content fields (it had none before\n— es readers silently saw pt content; getLocalizedTitle/Content now\nhandle es the same way as en).\n\nThe language switcher can''t resolve a post''s per-locale slug from\nnext-intl''s static routing (that only knows fixed pathnames, and the\nslug mapping is data-driven), so on a /blog/[slug] page it fetches the\npost from the already-public GET /posts/:slug and reads slugEn/slugEs\ndirectly before navigating — everywhere else keeps the existing\npathname-preserving locale swap. A post without its own translated\nslug falls back to the pt slug under that locale''s prefix, mirroring\nvertex-api''s findPublishedBySlug fallback (getLocalizedSlug in\nlocalized-content.ts is the single source of truth both the switcher\nand generateMetadata/sitemap.ts''s hreflang alternates use).\n\nCreatePostForm/EditPostForm''s pt/en language toggle becomes pt/en/es,\neach tab with its own optional slug field (pt''s stays required).\npost-language-fields.ts centralizes the tab->field-name mapping so\nboth forms (and their tests) agree on the same naming.","tree":{"sha":"da3c62d2cc09130d41d8ba662eb73f97f8a97884","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/da3c62d2cc09130d41d8ba662eb73f97f8a97884"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/fb08dd81f01a906ce3759127dc1df4c20241b983","verification":{"payload":"tree da3c62d2cc09130d41d8ba662eb73f97f8a97884\nparent 0ee72bd6ae517653ed8248baa97127a23b2e6d10\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783537319 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783537319 -0300\n\nfeat: support a per-locale slug and full Spanish content for posts (#26)\n\nCompanion to vertex-api''s per-locale slug support. A post''s en/es\nversion can now have its own SEO-friendly slug instead of sharing the\npt one, and Spanish gets full title/content fields (it had none before\n— es readers silently saw pt content; getLocalizedTitle/Content now\nhandle es the same way as en).\n\nThe language switcher can''t resolve a post''s per-locale slug from\nnext-intl''s static routing (that only knows fixed pathnames, and the\nslug mapping is data-driven), so on a /blog/[slug] page it fetches the\npost from the already-public GET /posts/:slug and reads slugEn/slugEs\ndirectly before navigating — everywhere else keeps the existing\npathname-preserving locale swap. A post without its own translated\nslug falls back to the pt slug under that locale''s prefix, mirroring\nvertex-api''s findPublishedBySlug fallback (getLocalizedSlug in\nlocalized-content.ts is the single source of truth both the switcher\nand generateMetadata/sitemap.ts''s hreflang alternates use).\n\nCreatePostForm/EditPostForm''s pt/en language toggle becomes pt/en/es,\neach tab with its own optional slug field (pt''s stays required).\npost-language-fields.ts centralizes the tab->field-name mapping so\nboth forms (and their tests) agree on the same naming.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTp6nCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAx8EQAKe8P0bQq5PTTXrNmC2NvpYh\nHayYsEkYWqaMPZX1PnrZ7R453SfZB236BiImbG18oVBuM2FKqKZ8xwdqnYO3lfmm\njjuMHJaSZ69k3VUQThip8Gtzai1PpEFPiiPjij2jyKC5HrTZwI81WbIH4C3ROAkX\n/5ZPE04P7xvGkKNlq6qSoseAExcbftOXZA+G95sHLOtyKfH+BHH+moL5+wUAjKm3\n71f3Z1LAXihZFav/I+9Vf54VlAvTMB032cdMiTd2dPcu6mdV2boqO9ZvCBWDXr93\nqnQU1b4wkalf0fmlTHC2X25Jjwo1SwgIkz41AHBHq+jucRcD0I8bgFE+8SmoUDOx\nBKlZVBeHeft2DVZoEfz1nb+xsNcszGT+yaJk7ERtFvj5b/1OBn507OCcN7XdNHjB\nTK5LvC3UzwoBj6cfKSf+ZpC0Xuxd8Fc9mgX/WYLCG6oY1N858KAKZjadouzn9Bto\nuUs9Z2U/8Z5BRLatWUzk5CbUMgzXnRPDFN2jDR06WbJvpzBI2Z1vWY/hx8V6dcpB\n7by8xj6b/1PTXorr8w87FcxQv1rAOQr1pND/938VvB0NG7LUNFOQiEsUMOXxuxnX\nVrhgUB/BfI6Rxs209vQHGS20LQWFJ36trrNqQwXXuJSYuRKcrshOCrfPSgGN5ae7\n+o7GkocynY9G3RTFL8/b\n=iqlh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T19:01:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commit/fb08dd81f01a906ce3759127dc1df4c20241b983","node_id":"C_kwDOTOZb