ed\non the full page width, unrelated to the header''s wider container —\non a 1440px viewport this put its content ~207px out of step with the\nheader logo above it (measured with Playwright).\n\nApplies the same outer/inner wrapper split already used on\nblog/[slug]/page.tsx: an outer box matching the header''s effective\nwidth, with the article left-aligned inside it at lg+. Re-measured\nafter the fix: 1px gap between the header logo and the article''s\nheading/paragraphs, down from 207px.","tree":{"sha":"2272f8a74da47093dad0f0d7dfa3dbc479766dde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/2272f8a74da47093dad0f0d7dfa3dbc479766dde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/0ee72bd6ae517653ed8248baa97127a23b2e6d10","verification":{"payload":"tree 2272f8a74da47093dad0f0d7dfa3dbc479766dde\nparent f733317bdea0ddcbccab30e573851d4e2fdf459c\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783534863 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783534863 -0300\n\nfix: align About page content with the header (#25)\n\nThe About page''s <article> was a single \"mx-auto max-w-3xl\" centered\non the full page width, unrelated to the header''s wider container —\non a 1440px viewport this put its content ~207px out of step with the\nheader logo above it (measured with Playwright).\n\nApplies the same outer/inner wrapper split already used on\nblog/[slug]/page.tsx: an outer box matching the header''s effective\nwidth, with the article left-aligned inside it at lg+. Re-measured\nafter the fix: 1px gap between the header logo and the article''s\nheading/paragraphs, down from 207px.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTpUPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0U4QAF58EbavQzYA+HWDT9p7d8F2\nAqQj1NnfekxW6/gnZnKqJSbT+LFVmKq9Ta1NL+27SnC4lGb096gmFQozTHiYB+h9\nB4FBPOf9FbW5QFt0JW1Iz/mGUBisIlo/J8x2gGceckozi0wnKSw6EMv5ugR504XT\nOtAWbY0wM4vAiy/Lq+wMVD6Dn+mhe2s8G+aWE/sawkkTU2WnpYXTnfLnj4lCUhuc\nj82Gdk8es2YSwueBX