8248baa97127a23b2e6d10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/0ee72bd6ae517653ed8248baa97127a23b2e6d10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/f733317bdea0ddcbccab30e573851d4e2fdf459c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T18:20:53Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T18:20:53Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: use a Settings icon for the admin panel badge, not User (#24)\n\n* perf: link \"back to blog\" straight to \"/\" instead of via \"/blog\"\n\n\"/blog\" only exists as a locale-aware redirect stub to \"/\" (for old\nbookmarks/links to the pre-rename blog index), so an internal link\nthrough it forces the browser to fetch \"/blog\"''s RSC payload, follow\nthe redirect, then fetch \"/\" separately — two round-trips for a\nnavigation that should be one hop.\n\nMeasured with Playwright (authenticated, warm route cache): 462ms ->\n197ms for the same click-to-rendered-home navigation.\n\n* docs: use full name and credit NestJS in the footer\n\nSwaps \"Samuel\" for \"Samuel Santana\", and \"Tailwind CSS\" for \"NestJS\"\nin the footer''s tech credit — the site targets senior/tech-lead roles,\nso signaling the full-stack (Next.js + NestJS) build is more relevant\nhere than the CSS framework.\n\n* fix: use a Settings icon for the admin panel badge, not User\n\nThe decorative badge on the \"Admin Panel Active\" card used a User\nicon, which reads as \"profile/account\" rather than \"administration\" —\nand duplicated the Users icon already used by the \"Manage Users\" quick\nlink right next to it. Settings communicates the card''s actual purpose\n(an admin controls hub) more directly.","tree":{"sha":"73b528ac5fc3eea3b671f752928a597030a06ff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/73b528ac5fc3eea3b671f752928a597030a06ff7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/f733317bdea0ddcbccab30e573851d4e2fdf459c","verification":{"payload":"tree 73b528ac5fc3eea3b671f752928a597030a06ff7\nparent 8f214090d52c76d8408affc45ba653496b6701e2\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783534853 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783534853 -0300\n\nfix: use a Settings icon for the admin panel badge, not User (#24)\n\n* perf: link \"back to blog\" straight to \"/\" instead of via \"/blog\"\n\n\"/blog\" only exists as a locale-aware redirect stub to \"/\" (for old\nbookmarks/links to the pre-rename blog index), so an internal link\nthrough it forces the browser to fetch \"/blog\"''s RSC payload, follow\nthe redirect, then fetch \"/\" separately — two round-trips for a\nnavigation that should be one hop.\n\nMeasured with Playwright (authenticated, warm route cache): 462ms ->\n197ms for the same click-to-rendered-home navigation.\n\n* docs: use full name and credit NestJS in the footer\n\nSwaps \"Samuel\" for \"Samuel Santana\", and \"Tailwind CSS\" for \"NestJS\"\nin the footer''s tech credit — the site targets senior/tech-lead roles,\nso signaling the full-stack (Next.js + NestJS) build is more relevant\nhere than the CSS framework.\n\n* fix: use a Settings icon for the admin panel badge, not User\n\nThe decorative badge on the \"Admin Panel Active\" card used a User\nicon, which reads as \"profile/account\" rather than \"administration\" —\nand duplicated the Users icon already used by the \"Manage Users\" quick\nlink right next to it. Settings communicates the card''s actual purpose\n(an admin controls hub) more directly.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTpUFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA8LgQAHLTYW4/vWtWG/FrA1yBzg/U\niD8jEUkKixxRp1J6ZXR0S3k+ct3TQnoSRpHDhbr6kJiysdqgjonWPQguOHOEu7QW\nc2vsGzk6gAOyzHnGl6lFwb8EF9H7SyAk7YIxeTAf0fYl0Pp7IPNqjzisIRi5iJ2m\ny2eQAhpeLRXLAC5jth5rv4zl+rsYPxjFadhPhvwJBDqQSX2O0XwcreNFOH1a79OQ\nMvaiODWB6Kvcdr4ukT4PCKNkWr/pRV8PwXXGKpE3M+/URAZmV6+76xsQcy1eE5Yq\nPjkYHMYOMijSW07CVfbEpYtktmzOI2rwCK6z04JI4/jFnrlKDSbUuIixXe9JAX1B\n6VnbuMqf1Pczpo21q12WzVmC34RVG3h0RJljGCsJaFYfUURMKH7TIFlB7IOv5J7B\n/2odCcjhAWZbJ/MMjtCahYrU2DpH9isLntf2QOegecDtYm31kJkwirfw6mICvi43\nexDhJT6E15fOG6yUfByobL3uLQMW1j8h5KnLITMNV1HTT+Y58x/SV8+nEvfpzgbJ\nlCGAifgvqagIQpiKcuMi6S13utqA5R8OhAbO2CYwPFF99le4NQM7d7ll+CDJb1z2\nA4Bk59Xtdgx9TySYcfBdsxgYo1HIX5etmTRWU2KxEYa0yVUOqnTjFCPiELixK+Zr\ngWj23I1SjgHDTq5EEAEB\n=3NTv\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T18:20:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow