22,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/d2fa845fa2b06462392f5fcbc7017e5dd533b476/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T15:05:15Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T15:05:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add a copy-to-clipboard button on Markdown code blocks (#14)\n\nPlain Markdown just emits a static <pre><code>, so this intercepts\nreact-markdown''s \"pre\" renderer with a small client component that\nreads the rendered element''s textContent (sidestepping rehype-highlight''s\nspan-per-token wrapping) and copies it via the Clipboard API. Wired into\nthe post reading page and both create/edit post preview tabs — the three\nplaces that already run rehype-highlight.","tree":{"sha":"6d42a869e8f59670304d186eb4835957803b33a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/6d42a869e8f59670304d186eb4835957803b33a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/d2fa845fa2b06462392f5fcbc7017e5dd533b476","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d42a869e8f59670304d186eb4835957803b33a3\nparent 3c7b7d8a91da43ae0ca6606d805834e55106f70f\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783523115 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783523115 -0300\n\nfeat: add a copy-to-clipboard button on Markdown code blocks (#14)\n\nPlain Markdown just emits a static <pre><code>, so this intercepts\nreact-markdown''s \"pre\" renderer with a small client component that\nreads the rendered element''s textContent (sidestepping rehype-highlight''s\nspan-per-token wrapping) and copies it via the Clipboard API. Wired into\nthe post reading page and both create/edit post preview tabs — the three\nplaces that already run rehype-highlight.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTmcrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAm/4QADi+XjJVXrPDoBdtwTZto6f8\nxf9oN+MqRSJlZvGrZUZi1l2Bj6iEdiOWVZBkZKuygV4nW+5GEGWqP/1PMvy9+cop\nwOBylsYFTolcgWex1SoPL6fgHtyPqO+vj8fioY0ATpxrc29LdNCF3kannq6VMYg5\nTxQsnowj59Vwtur6cqv1hL2xMs1DoyqAZBcD1T9+/wW99O7eVJIcYJcBY5RlkJNj\nXT2OXwoiNEM+gLI5IeqSimhM/eC+8OfJE2lYiM15YL7MDRpJw6YzlryYfE7VXa9m\ne9hhS0k9rR0VOq+ifuXUdqfz2cucGasYICfPxO8XJ1TQBtbDJtvUlfbvZBhCyJ5v\nEwYP+vStAGU3Z9/7bNhsUuvlcnWoqlSzDfnHT99+ZfePT7rYAZDDFOOFPzK45mZG\nTKi2iVnGnQiFIXJc+z2oZmDHYT4N/BaNn9eOPB/BMVh4meI1ttLrQU1arrpbWWw8\nOzsZL8Dkp3Msh2nHmDlw2fj0k+PID95KirW8orv/7I2mbwveQ5mhrrF4JmqqjFva\nPg4aCbczUGk7OLZj053hbyT2lvENJ2p6SzAO3GbgRerdps6vjBIATQVfIDqXKOci\nmavHKjDl0M9hxB5v7KmXcxqcM+tH2CN4FMvYihGX8Otf3K61tEBQA4ZMe9uOBrBQ\naqJcMgGm15iYMsvuuURZ\n=ONBg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-08T15:05:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_ad