i.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/d2627f3c0b0b39b7aaf546714ad316a2455da5bb"}],"sha":"b7e1b6acd429b96ef387eff6481ca01660a11f1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/b7e1b6acd429b96ef387eff6481ca01660a11f1c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/commits/d2627f3c0b0b39b7aaf546714ad316a2455da5bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T23:16:43Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T23:16:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: always show a user''s role, add self-service account deletion (#8)\n\n- UserRow was only rendering a role badge for admins — a regular\n  user''s row showed nothing at all, making it look like their role\n  was missing rather than confirming they''re a plain \"Usuário\"/\"User\".\n  Now every row gets a badge either way.\n- Profile page gets a \"Danger Zone\" with a delete-my-account button:\n  LGPD (Art. 18) gives any data subject the right to request deletion\n  of personal data processed under consent, and the confirm dialog\n  says plainly that no data is retained and the session ends\n  immediately. Calls the paired vertex-api DELETE /users/me, then\n  clears the access_token cookie and redirects home — continuing to\n  browse as a user whose account no longer exists doesn''t make sense.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8bc28f4e199a062c747d9bee8e717ff0e4cfff1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/trees/8bc28f4e199a062c747d9bee8e717ff0e4cfff1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/vertex-web/git/commits/d2627f3c0b0b39b7aaf546714ad316a2455da5bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 8bc28f4e199a062c747d9bee8e717ff0e4cfff1d\nparent f1f00b09ddf6c38fceb5fce1da38f01b1c9a7f6e\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1783466203 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783466203 -0300\n\nfeat: always show a user''s role, add self-service account deletion (#8)\n\n- UserRow was only rendering a role badge for admins — a regular\n  user''s row showed nothing at all, making it look like their role\n  was missing rather than confirming they''re a plain \"Usuário\"/\"User\".\n  Now every row gets a badge either way.\n- Profile page gets a \"Danger Zone\" with a delete-my-account button:\n  LGPD (Art. 18) gives any data subject the right to request deletion\n  of personal data processed under consent, and the confirm dialog\n  says plainly that no data is retained and the session ends\n  immediately. Calls the paired vertex-api DELETE /users/me, then\n  clears the access_token cookie and redirects home — continuing to\n  browse as a user whose account no longer exists doesn''t make sense.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTYjcCRC1aQ7uu5Uh